<item>
<sku>122803</sku>
<name>Nghia export p-10 metal hoof</name>
<description>&lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; kopytko do manicure / pedicure nghia export p-10 &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; the tool is used to wipe the epidermis and to precisely and remove cuticles, membranes and remains of gel and acrylic from the plate &lt;br &gt; nail. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; - made of polished, stainless steel, used in the production of surgical instruments &lt;br&gt; - has two different precise ends &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; (flat knife - 9mm blade and a convex rounded chisel, 8 mm wide) &lt;br&gt; - slightly notched handle, preventing slipping and sticking in the hand while working &lt;br&gt; - can be disinfected and sterilized by any method (chemical, thermal, chemical and thermal) &lt;br&gt; - total hoof length: 9 cm &lt;br&gt; - weight: 12 g &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; tool suitable for autoclave sterilization and disinfection with chemical purges * &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; * autoclave - basic sterilization at 121 ° C for 15 minutes, deactivation at 132-134 ° C, pressure 3 bar &lt;br&gt; attention !!! &lt;br&gt; steel, even stainless steel, regardless of the manufacturer, may under special conditions be damaged, destroyed, which may result in discoloration, pitting and even corrosion. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; * chemical disinfection - with a liquid intended for this purpose, used according to manufacturer's recommendations. &lt;br&gt; attention !!! &lt;br&gt; not following the manufacturer's recommendations (too strong solution, too long disinfection time) may cause the metal to react, causing discoloration and damage to the tool &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
<price>5.08</price>
