<name>Omi pro-line clippers al-201 acrylic nail nippers jaw16 / 6mm lap joint</name>
<description>&lt;div&gt; omi al-201 cutters are manufactured with a specially designed jaw16 / 6mm jaw to facilitate cutting the nail trough and removing cuticles. equipped with a double spring, satin finish with polished elements. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; omi offers the best quality of its products through the introduction of the latest technology, materials (Japanese cobalt steel) and skillful workmanship by highly experienced craftsmen. The uniqueness of omi lies in its durability and sharpness, which ensures that it cuts anywhere on the blade without tearing or damaging the skin. this advantage gives greater efficiency and comfort of work. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; omi by nghia made in vietnam &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; a tool suitable for sterilization in autoclave and disinfection in chemical decomposition * &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; * autoclave - basic sterilization temperature 121 ° C for 15 minutes, deactivation temperature 132-134 ° C, pressure 3 bar &lt;br&gt; attention !!! &lt;br&gt; steel, even stainless steel, regardless of the manufacturer, may under special conditions be damaged, destroyed, which may result in discoloration, pitting and even corrosion. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; * chemical disinfection - with a liquid intended for this purpose, used according to manufacturer's recommendations. &lt;br&gt; attention !!! &lt;br&gt; not following the manufacturer's recommendations (too strong a solution, too long disinfection time) may cause the metal to react, causing discoloration and damage to the tool &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
