<item>
<sku>113076</sku>
<name>Omi pro-line clippers podo nb-106 ingrown nail nippers box joint</name>
<description>&lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; clamps omi nl-106 have a specially constructed jaw which allows easy access to ingrown nails &lt;span&gt; &lt;span&gt;. The boxed joint gives extra force on the axis, which enables smooth, safe and secure cuts equipped with one spring with lock, satin finish with polished parts &lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span&gt; &lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; omi offers the best quality of its products by introducing the latest technology, materials (Japanese cobalt steel) and skillful workmanship by highly experienced craftsmen. &lt;br&gt; omi's uniqueness lies in its durability and sharpness which ensures a cut anywhere on the blade without tearing or damaging the skin or nail. this advantage gives greater efficiency and comfort of work. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; omi by nghia made in vietnam &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; a tool suitable for sterilization in autoclave and disinfection in chemical decomposition * &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; * autoclave - basic sterilization temperature 121 ° C for 15 minutes, deactivation temperature 132-134 ° C, pressure 3 bar &lt;br&gt; attention !!! &lt;br&gt; steel, even stainless steel, regardless of the manufacturer, may under special conditions be damaged, destroyed, which may result in discoloration, pitting and even corrosion. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; * chemical disinfection - with a liquid intended for this purpose, used according to manufacturer's recommendations. &lt;br&gt; attention !!! &lt;br&gt; not following the manufacturer's recommendations (too strong solution, too long disinfection time) may cause the metal to react, causing discoloration and damage to the tool &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
