<item>
<sku>113077</sku>
<name>Omi pro-line cb-102 cuticle nipper jaw12 / 4mm box joint</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;OMI CB-102 forceps have specially designed blade bevel angles, allowing for various approaches to cut cuticles without causing damage. The box joint provides additional force on the axis, enabling smooth, safe, and precise cutting. They are equipped with a single spring with a lock and have a satin finish with polished elements. &lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt; OMI stands out for offering the best quality products by incorporating the latest technologies and using materials such as Japanese cobalt steel, crafted by highly experienced artisans. OMI's uniqueness lies in the durability and sharpness of the tool, ensuring precise cutting at every point of the blade without risking damage to the skin. This advantage provides greater efficiency and comfort during work. &lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;OMI by NGHIA - Made in Vietnam.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;  The tool is suitable for sterilisation in an autoclave and can be disinfected using chemical solutions.&lt;br&gt;  * Autoclave - Basic sterilisation at a temperature of 121 °C for 15 minutes, deactivation at a temperature of 132-134 °C, pressure of 3 bars.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;  Please note: Steel, even stainless steel (INOX), regardless of the manufacturer, may get damaged under certain conditions, resulting in discolouration, pitting, or even corrosion.&lt;br&gt;  * Chemical disinfection - Use the appropriate solution as recommended by the manufacturer.  &lt;p&gt;  Please note: Not following the manufacturer's recommendations (using too strong a solution or prolonged disinfection time) may lead to metal reactions causing discolouration and damage to the tool.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
