<item>
<sku>113192</sku>
<name>Syis - microneedle pen 05 silver</name>
<description>&lt;div&gt; microneedle pen is a modern device for microneedle mesotherapy, used to regenerate the skin, eliminate wrinkles, and treat scars and reduce stretch marks. The "pen" regenerates, heals and reduces skin imperfections faster, more effectively and at the same time in a less painful way. allows the introduction of active substances into the skin by puncturing it with pulsating needles. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; what is the procedure? &lt;br&gt; microneedle pen stimulates the natural regenerative capacity of the human body. The "pen" punctures the skin in a regulated way, which activates its auto-renewal processes, i.e. the multiplication of collagen and elastin. its micro needles penetrate to a depth of 2.5 mm, which additionally allows the absorption of active substances into the skin. Thanks to this, the skin regains a healthy and youthful appearance at an unprecedented pace. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; The proven effect of the microneedle pen is: &lt;br&gt; - smoothing wrinkles &lt;br&gt; - regenerating the skin &lt;br&gt; - reducing acne scars &lt;br&gt; - reducing stretch marks &lt;br&gt; - reduction of scars (reduction of skin imperfections) &lt;br&gt; - reduction of pores &lt;br&gt; - prevention of baldness &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; the device works wirelessly and on a cable, the set includes a charger, two lithium batteries and a solid case visible in the photos. has 5 modes of operation with different frequency of punctures. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; technical specification: &lt;br&gt; - needles: 12 &lt;br&gt; - the device is made of steel &lt;br&gt; - needle length adjustment interval: 0.25 mm - 2.5 mm &lt;br&gt; - weight 56 ​​g &lt;br &gt; - puncture frequency 6500-10000 rpm &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; 1. 6500r / m &lt;br&gt; 2. 7500r / m &lt;br&gt; 3. 8500r / m &lt;br&gt; 4. 9500r / m &lt;br&gt; 5. 10000r / m &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; -5 frequency modes &lt;br&gt; - working time after charging: up to 3 hours &lt;br&gt; - German motor &lt;br&gt; - pen size: 12x18x155mm &lt;br&gt; -2 lithium batteries &lt;br&gt; -time needed to charge the battery: 75min &lt;br&gt; -device is CE certified &lt;br&gt; -warranty period 12 months. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
