<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano &lt;/strong&gt;is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship, as well as high comfort of use. The offer includes a large selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, washers and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Large illuminated plafond&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;An eye-catching &lt;strong&gt;illuminated plafond&lt;/strong&gt;, equipped with a rotating cylinder, is an excellent advertisement for a barbershop. &lt;strong&gt;The distinctive design&lt;/strong&gt;, with rotating elements in red, white and blue, creates a unique, internationally understood business card of the barbershop. Using &lt;strong&gt;the wired remote control&lt;/strong&gt;, you can turn on both the lighting and the rotation of the plafond.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A distinctive element of the barbershop&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The use of high-quality materials &lt;strong&gt;ensures durability and resistance to weather conditions&lt;/strong&gt;, which makes the plafond suitable for all conditions. Elements in shades of silver at the top and bottom add elegance. &lt;strong&gt;The possibility of mounting on the wall &lt;/strong&gt;ensures convenient and practical placement of the plafond.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Power cord length: 120 cm&lt;br&gt;Power: 12 W&lt;br&gt;Rated voltage: 220-240 V&lt;br&gt;Package dimensions: 75×33×25 cm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
