<item>
<sku>123900</sku>
<name>Syis - microneedle pen 05 silver + syis cosmetics</name>
<description>&lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; microneedle pen set + 10 x 3ml moisturizing and nourishing ampoules &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; microneedle pen &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; is a modern device for microneedle mesotherapy, used to regenerate the skin, eliminate wrinkles and treat scars and reduce stretch marks. The "pen" regenerates, heals and reduces skin imperfections faster, more effectively and at the same time in a less painful way. allows the introduction of active substances into the skin by puncturing it with pulsating needles. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;u&gt; what is the procedure? &lt;/u&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;u &gt; &lt;/u&gt; &lt;br&gt; microneedle pen stimulates the natural regenerative capacity of the human body. The "pen" punctures the skin in a regulated way, which activates its auto-renewal processes, i.e. the multiplication of collagen and elastin. its micro needles penetrate to a depth of 2.5 mm, which additionally allows the absorption of active substances into the skin. Thanks to this, the skin regains a healthy and youthful appearance at an unprecedented pace. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; proven action &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; microneedle pen is: &lt;br&gt; - smoothing wrinkles &lt;br&gt; - regeneration skin &lt;br&gt; - reduction of acne scars &lt;br&gt; - elimination of stretch marks &lt;br&gt; - reduction of scars (reduction of skin imperfections) &lt;br&gt; - reduction of pores &lt;br&gt; - prevention of alopecia &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; the device works wirelessly and on a cable, the set includes a charger, two lithium batteries and a solid case visible in the pictures. has 5 modes of operation with different frequency of punctures. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;u&gt; technical specification: &lt;/u&gt; &lt;br&gt; - needles: 12 &lt;br&gt; - the device is made of steel &lt;br&gt; - needle length adjustment interval: 0.25 mm - 2.5 mm &lt;br&gt; - weight 56 ​​g &lt;br&gt; - puncture frequency 6500-10000 rpm &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; 1. 6500r / m &lt;br&gt; 2. 7500r / m &lt;br&gt; 3. 8500r / m &lt;br&gt; 4. 9500r / m &lt;br&gt; 5. 10000r / m &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; -5 frequency modes &lt;br&gt; - working time after charging: up to 3 hours &lt;br&gt; - German engine &lt;br&gt; - pen size: 12x18x155mm &lt;br&gt; -2 lithium batteries &lt;br&gt; - time needed to charge the battery: 75 min &lt;br&gt; - device CE certified &lt;br&gt; - warranty period 12 months. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; 10x3ml moisturizing and nourishing ampoules &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; for dry, tight skin that requires moisturizing, nourishing and smoothing. thanks to the panthenol content, the ampoules effectively soothe any changes and accelerate the regeneration of damaged epidermis. collagen together with hyaluronic acid and milk proteins are responsible for the proper hydration of the skin, strengthen the hydrolipid layer and support nmf - a natural moisturizing factor. the skin becomes elastic and radiant. properly moisturized and nourished skin absorbs nutrients much better. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; the kit includes a 1pc device. + a pack of 10 x 3ml ampoules &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
