<item>
<sku>125969</sku>
<name>Kessner ionic hair straightener 230 ° c</name>
<description>&lt;div&gt; professional kessner straightener with ionization and high-quality floating plates. &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div&gt; features: &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div&gt; - 25x100mm ceramic-tourmaline plates &lt;br&gt; - power: 46w &lt;br&gt; - adjustable temperature: 130-230 ° C : &lt;br&gt; - 170-180 ° c - for fine, bleached or damaged hair &lt;br&gt; - 180-200 ° c - for normal and wavy hair &lt;br&gt; - 210-230 ° c - for thick, coarse or ethnic hair &lt;br&gt; - rotating (360 °) cable, length 2 m &lt;br&gt; - quick heating up to 180 ° c in 30 seconds &lt;br&gt; - plate dimensions: 24 x 110mm &lt;br&gt; - cool tip &lt;br&gt; - temperature display ( LCD) &lt;br&gt; - temperature adjustment buttons +/- &lt;br&gt; - on / off button &lt;br&gt; - straightener lock &lt;br&gt; - voltage: 220-240vac 50/60 hz &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; technology tourmaline &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div&gt; tourmaline is a semi-precious mineral - a powerful, natural source of ionic energy. fragmented tourmaline, placed in the product line, emits huge amounts of negative ions that close the hair cuticles, maintaining an appropriate level of its hydration. thanks to the action of ions, the hair is resistant to moisture, gains amazing shine and is arranged perfectly. &lt;/div&gt;</description>
