<description>&lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; professional cuticle nippers nghia d-03 3.5mm &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; professional cuticle cutters made of stainless steel with a double-sided spring, designed for precise cutting of cuticles. Thanks to the lap joint &lt;br&gt; method (which minimizes wear and the possibility of looseness compared to other joining methods), the clippers ensure perfect work for a long time. the pliers have a specially profiled handle (classic type), which ensures high precision, convenience and comfort of work. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; - blade size 3.5 mm &lt;br&gt; - made of steel stainless steel &lt;br&gt; - specially profiled handle, which ensures high precision, convenience and comfort of work &lt;br&gt; - jaw connection method: lap joint (not recessed) &lt;br&gt; - type of spring: double-sided, mounted on a stainless steel screw &lt;br&gt; - total length of the pliers: 10.5 cm &lt;br&gt; - can be disinfected and sterilized by any method &lt;br&gt; (chemical, thermal, chemical-thermal) &lt;br&gt; - weight: 40g &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;div&gt; tool suitable for autoclaving and disinfection in chemical decomposition * &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; * autoclave - basic sterilization at 121 ° C for 15 minutes, deactivation at 132-134 ° c, pressure 3 bars &lt;br&gt; attention !!! &lt;br&gt; steel, even stainless steel, regardless of the manufacturer, may under special conditions be damaged, destroyed, which may result in discoloration, pitting and even corrosion. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; * chemical disinfection - with a liquid intended for this purpose, used according to manufacturer's recommendations. &lt;br&gt; attention !!! &lt;br&gt; not following the manufacturer's recommendations (too strong solution, too long disinfection time) may cause the metal to react, causing discoloration and damage to the tool &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
