<item>
<sku>104815</sku>
<name>Derma roller for mesotherapy 0.25 mm 192 titanium needles</name>
<description>&lt;div&gt; activ system dermo - roller &lt;p&gt; dermo - roller is a professional device for microneedle mesotherapy, which is one of the alternatives to laser treatments and plastic surgery, as well as deep chemical peels. is an innovative way to regenerate and rebuild the skin. dermo roller activ is a roller covered with thin, titanium micro-needles with a length of 0.25mm to 2.0mm, which in 5 minutes make nearly 250,000 microneedles on the skin. due to the fact that they are made of titanium and not surgical steel, they are extremely thin like a human hair and thus actually stick into the skin. the precision of titanium needles guarantees safety and comfort during the procedure. each roller's head is equipped with 192 titanium needles. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; needles length and application: &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 0.25 mm - gentle exfoliation of the epidermis, stimulation of microcirculation, improvement of color &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 0.30 mm - exfoliation of the epidermis, stimulation of microcirculation, creation of microchannels, improvement of color &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 0.50 mm - exfoliation of the epidermis, stimulation of microcirculation, creation of microchannels, microdamages of the epidermis, improvement of color &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The length of 0.25 - 0.50 can be used for home use according to all safety rules. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 0.75 mm - exfoliation of the epidermis, stimulation of microcirculation, creation of microchannels, controlled damage to the epidermis, leading to stimulation of fibroblasts to produce collagen and elastin &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 1.00 mm - exfoliation of the epidermis, stimulation of microcirculation, creation of microchannels, controlled damage to the epidermis, leading to stimulation of fibroblasts to produce collagen and elastin, thickening of the walls of blood vessels, elimination of discoloration &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 1.5 mm - exfoliation of the epidermis, stimulation of microcirculation, creation of microchannels, controlled, deep damage to the dermis, leading to stimulation of fibroblasts to produce collagen and elastin, thickening of the walls of blood vessels, skin regeneration at many levels, elimination of discoloration &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 2 , 0 mm - exfoliation of the epidermis, stimulation of microcirculation, formation of microchannels, controlled, very deep damage to the dermis, leading to stimulation of fibroblasts to p production of collagen and elastin, thickening of blood vessel walls, skin regeneration at many levels, elimination of discoloration &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; derma roller produces microscopic tubules in the skin, the so-called microdamages resulting in increased production of collagen and elastin, which makes the skin age slower. thanks to the microperforation of the outer layers of the skin, the active ingredients reach much deeper than during the daily application of cosmetics. after applying active substances to the skin, only .03% to 3% of the substances are transported to the skin. after using the derma roller, the active substances are absorbed by 3000% more. skin stimulation is gentle, thanks to which the reproductive cells of the skin and blood vessels remain undamaged. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; remember that each roller should be sterile closed, so that each client can see before the procedure that the roller with which the procedure will be performed was not damaged. nobody used. the roller must be originally packed. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; How does the activ system dermo-roller work? &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; the derma roller's task is to remove dead skin and loosen the connections between its cells &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; stimulates the living layers of the skin &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; increases blood flow in the skin and stimulates fibroblasts to synthesize collagen and elastin &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; each subsequent treatment gradually reduces stretch marks, scars &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; improves the contour of the face &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; improves the firmness and elasticity of the skin &lt;/p&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt; the effects of the activ system dermocutter: &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; tension and elasticity &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; wrinkle reduction &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; elimination of drooping eyelids and corners lips &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; elimination of the effects of photoaging of the skin &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; strengthening of mimic muscles &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; smoothing out mimic wrinkles &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; lightening of age spots and discoloration &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; thickening of the walls of blood vessels, which makes them stronger and less brittle &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; thickens the layers of living epidermis, thanks to which vesicles are less visible &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; smoothing acne scars &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; epidermis peeling &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; epidermis cleansing &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; narrowing of the dilated orifices of the sebaceous glands &lt;/p&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; for whom activ system dermo-roller? &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; the treatment is completely natural, safe &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; it can be performed by people of all ages and skin types &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; can be used on thin skin and on all parts of the face and body &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; causes painless perforation of the skin surface &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; no hypersensitivity to the sun's rays after the treatment &lt;/p&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt; no side effects &lt;/p&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt; worth knowing! &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; every, even the smallest damage to the epidermis causes the activation of self-renewal processes in the skin. with age, the skin's ability to self-renew weakens, as can be seen, for example, in slower healing wounds. Systematic microperforation of the epidermis is a safe form of skin stimulation, stimulating its regeneration and, as a result, increasing skin density. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; After the first treatment, your skin will be tighter and stronger. after intensive therapy, you can get firmer and younger skin. the effect is fully visible after 24 hours. the number of treatments that must be performed for maximum effect depends on the individual condition of the skin. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; treatments should be performed after anesthesia with emla ointment, according to the client's feelings. one should take into account the appearance of droplet bleeding on the surface of the skin and the formation of scabs. after each treatment, the roller should be washed under running water and disinfected, also before the procedure, the roller should be disinfected e.g. with ahd. the treatment can be performed with saline. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span&gt; we would like to inform you that according to Art. 38 point 5 of the Act on consumer rights, due to health protection and hygiene, the right to withdraw from a distance contract does not apply to products delivered in sealed packaging, if the packaging has been opened after delivery. &lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
