<item>
<sku>101648</sku>
<name>Electric cosmetic chair 2240 eclipse 3 strong. white</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;For many years, &lt;strong&gt;the ACTIVESHOP brand&lt;/strong&gt; has been offering a wide range of products that are suitable for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment, you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to specialized equipment, such as cosmetic furniture.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/101648/EN_101648_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Eclipse series&lt;/strong&gt; cosmetic chairs are distinguished by their simple, modern design. They are equipped with practical functions, which makes them &lt;strong&gt;ideal for a wide range of treatments&lt;/strong&gt; performed in professional beauty salons, as well as many specialized medical offices.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/101648/EN_101648_2a.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimalism and functionality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Eclipse electric cosmetic chair&lt;/strong&gt; with a modern design is equipped with &lt;strong&gt;3 actuators&lt;/strong&gt;, which are controlled by a remote control on a cable. The ease of adjustment allows &lt;strong&gt;smooth positioning&lt;/strong&gt; for a variety of treatments, and the minimalist finish will work well in almost any interior.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/101648/EN_101648_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Using an&lt;strong&gt; easy-to-use remote control&lt;/strong&gt;, you can effortlessly adjust the chair in&lt;strong&gt; 3 planes&lt;/strong&gt; – it has height, backrest and footrest. Thanks to this, you can smoothly adjust the chair into a comfortable &lt;strong&gt;reclining position&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing you to &lt;strong&gt;comfortably perform both facial and body treatments&lt;/strong&gt; on it. What's more, fully extended it reaches a length of &lt;strong&gt;more than 2,3 meters&lt;/strong&gt;, making it an excellent support for taller users. On the right side of the seat is a special metal &lt;strong&gt;holder for hanging the remote control&lt;/strong&gt;. This makes it easier to store it and ensures that it will always be at hand.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/101648/EN_101648_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The headrest is extendable&lt;/strong&gt;, which helps to adjust the equipment to the needs of users of different heights, providing stable head support during treatments. &lt;strong&gt;The armrests, movable in 180º&lt;/strong&gt;, make it easy to take a seat and provide comfortable access for the person performing the treatment. The solutions used significantly affect the&lt;strong&gt; high comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt; and work ergonomics.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/101648/EN_101648_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Futuristic design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The solid base&lt;/strong&gt; ensures stability, product durability and comfort of work. The chair is filled with foam and covered with a pleasant to the touch, matte imitation leather in shades of white. Thanks to the use of such material, the equipment is &lt;strong&gt;resistant to moisture and easy to clean&lt;/strong&gt;. The streamlined shape and simplicity of the finish make it look &lt;strong&gt;very aesthetically pleasing&lt;/strong&gt; and will fit into almost any interior.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/3epAtmO2gCg" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Detailed dimensions of the chair are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set includes:&lt;/strong&gt; seat with base, wired remote control, power supply.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Type: electric&lt;br&gt;Number of actuators: 3&lt;br&gt;Color: shades of white&lt;br&gt;Material of upholstery: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Seat filling: foam&lt;br&gt;Control: remote control, manual&lt;br&gt;Warranty: one year&lt;br&gt;Power: 200 W&lt;br&gt;Voltage: 220-230 V&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>1199.18</price>
<category_subcategory>Cosmetic furniture&gt;Cosmetic chairs</category_subcategory>
<qty>0</qty>
<weight>75.0000</weight>
<brand>ACTIVESHOP</brand>
<tax>23%</tax>
<EAN>5906717402470</EAN>
