<item>
<sku>130927</sku>
<name>Hairbrush O-13</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;For many years, the &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVESHOP &lt;/strong&gt;brand has been offering a wide range of products that are suitable for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment, you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to specialized equipment, such as cosmetic furniture.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Versatile professional hairbrush&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The modern &lt;strong&gt;O-13 hair brush&lt;/strong&gt;, made of high-quality nylon fibers, is &lt;strong&gt;an ideal tool for combing both natural and extended hair&lt;/strong&gt;. It works great on wet and dry hair, effectively dealing with even the most tangled strands. Additionally, &lt;strong&gt;the brush massages the scalp&lt;/strong&gt;, and thanks to additional fibers, it &lt;strong&gt;smoothes the hair, gives it shine and protects it from frizz and static&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Styling comfort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The openwork body&lt;/strong&gt; of the brush ensures effective air circulation during drying, which&lt;strong&gt; protects the hair from heat &lt;/strong&gt;and improves the comfort of styling. The unique fiber ending &lt;strong&gt;minimizes the risk of pulling the ends&lt;/strong&gt;, making the hair less likely to be damaged. The ergonomic, non-slip handle provides a firm grip, which &lt;strong&gt;increases comfort and precision &lt;/strong&gt;during styling.&lt;strong&gt; Lightweight, handy and with a non-slip handle&lt;/strong&gt;, ideal for everyday use. &lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Color: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Total length: 24 cm&lt;br&gt;Handle length: 12 cm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>3.05</price>
<category_subcategory>Hairdressing salon equipment&gt;Hair-styling accessories</category_subcategory>
