;div&gt; leads to increased blood flow in the skin and stimulation of fibroblasts to synthesize collagen and elastin &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; each subsequent treatment gradually reduces stretch marks, scars &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; improves the contour of the face &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; improves skin firmness and elasticity &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; effects of activ system dermolyer: &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; tension and elasticity &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; wrinkle reduction &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; elimination of drooping eyelids and mouth corners &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; elimination of the effects of photoaging of the skin &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; strengthening of facial muscles &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; smoothing out expression lines &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; lightening age spots and discoloration &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; thickening of the walls of blood vessels, making them stronger and less brittle &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; thickening of the layers of living epidermis, thanks to which dilated capillaries are less visible &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; smoothing out acne scars &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; peeling the epidermis &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; cleansing the epidermis &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; narrowing of the dilated sebaceous glands &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; who is activ system dermo-roller for? &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; the treatment is completely natural, safe &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; perform it maybe people of all ages and skin types &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; can be used on thin skin and on all parts of the face and body &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; causes a painless perforation of the skin surface &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; after treatment no hypersensitivity to the sun's rays &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; no side effects &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; good to know! &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; each, even the smallest damage to the epidermis activates the skin's self-