tin, thickening of the walls of blood vessels, elimination of discoloration &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; 1, 5 mm - exfoliation of the epidermis, stimulation of microcirculation, formation of microchannels, controlled, deep damage to the dermis, leading to stimulation of fibroblasts to produce collagen and elastin, thickening of the walls of blood vessels, skin regeneration at many levels, elimination of discoloration &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; 2.0 mm - exfoliation of the epidermis, stimulation of microcirculation, formation of microchannels, controlled, very deep damage to the dermis, leading to awakening fibroblasts to produce collagen and elastin, thickening of blood vessel walls, skin regeneration at many levels, elimination of discoloration &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; derma roller produces microscopic size in the skin tubules, the so-called microdamages resulting in increased production of collagen and elastin, which makes the skin age slower. thanks to the microperforation of the outer layers of the skin, the active ingredients reach much deeper than during the daily application of cosmetics. after applying active substances to the skin, only .03% to 3% of the substances are transported to the skin. after using the derma roller, the active substances are absorbed by 3000% more. skin stimulation is gentle, so that the reproductive cells of the skin and blood vessels remain undamaged. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; remember that each roller should be sterile closed so that each client can see before the procedure that the roller with which the procedure will be performed was not nobody used. the roller must be originally packed. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; how does the activ system dermo-roller work? &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; the derma roller's task is to remove dead skin and loosen the connections between its cells &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; stimulates the living layers of the skin &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; leads to increased blood flow in the skin and stimulation of fibroblasts to synthesize collagen and elastin &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; each subsequent treatment gradually reduces stretch marks, scars &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; improves the contour of the face &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; improves skin firmness and elasticity &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; effects of activ system dermolyer: &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; tension and elasticity &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; wrinkle reduction &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; elimination of drooping eyelids and mouth corners &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; elimination of the effects of photoaging of the skin &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; strengthening of facial muscles &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; smoothing out expression lines &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; lightening age spots and discoloration &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; thickening of the walls of blood vessels, making them stronger and less brittle &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; thickening of the layers of living epidermis, thanks to which dilated capillaries are less visible &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; smoothing out acne scars &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; peeling the epidermis &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; cleansing the epidermis &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; narrowing of the dilated sebaceous glands &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; who is activ system dermo-roller for? &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;br&gt; the treatment is completely natural, safe &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; perform it maybe people of all ages and skin types &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; can be used on thin skin and on all parts of the face and body &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; causes a painless perforation of the skin surface &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; after treatment no hypersensitivity to the sun's rays &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; no side effects &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; good to know! &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; each, even the smallest damage to the epidermis activates the skin's self-renewal processes. with age, the skin's ability to self-renew weakens, as can be seen, for example, in slower healing wounds. Systematic microperforation of the epidermis is a safe form of skin stimulation, stimulating its regeneration and, as a result, increasing the density of the skin. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; after the first treatment your skin will be tighter and stronger. after intensive therapy, you can get firmer and younger skin. the effect is fully visible after 24 hours. the number of treatments that must be performed for maximum effect depends on the individual condition of the skin. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; treatments should be performed after anesthesia with emla ointment, according to the client's feelings. one should take into account the appearance of droplet bleeding on the surface of the skin and the formation of scabs. after each treatment, the roller should be washed under running water and disinfected, also before the procedure, the roller should be disinfected e.g. with ahd. the treatment can be performed with saline. &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;span&gt; we would like to inform you that pursuant to Art. 38 point 5 of the Act on consumer rights, due to health protection and hygiene, the right to withdraw from a distance contract does not apply to products delivered in sealed packaging, if the packaging has been opened after delivery. &lt;/span&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
