<name>CERAMIC CHIN STRAIGHTENING BRUSH</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Kessner Electric Beard Straightener, Men's Comb, Beard Brush, 200 &amp;deg; C Quick and Safe Temperature Control, Ionizing 2-in-1 Hair and Beard Brush&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The 40W beard smoothing brush is equipped with an advanced PTC heating element, produces fast and stable heat in 30 seconds, smoothes the beard and hair, and provides a natural, elegant and shiny look. Free yourself from clutter and increase your beauty and confidence.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;- Full protection against burns.&lt;br /&gt;The ceramic heating layer and silicone brush head prevent burns and provide a pleasant feeling on the skin.&lt;br /&gt;- PTC rapid heating technology&lt;br /&gt;It is enough to press a button to reach a stable temperature of 170 ℃ in 30 seconds.&lt;br /&gt;- Hair care with negative ions.&lt;br /&gt;The intelligent ion generator can evenly transfer the heat to each beard and protect it from overheating.&lt;br /&gt;- Adjustable 3 levels of temperature.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;It helps to achieve a better result with all types of thick hair styling.&lt;br /&gt; The unique ion technology used, quickly shapes the beard in daily care and supports the health of the beard and hair, perfect for all types of beard and hair, short or long-cut. High-quality 2-in-1 hair straightener for better styling results and more comfort.&lt;br /&gt; The strong hair of the straightener is equipped with a ceramic coating and a skin-friendly silicone head that ensures even heat distribution and a quick regeneration time. They prevent skin and hair injuries, provide maximum comfort.&lt;br /&gt; The ergonomic curves of the brush are based on the contours of human cheeks and head, thanks to which they perfectly fit the face.&lt;br /&gt; 3 adjustable temperature ranges significantly reduce styling time. The LED button clearly shows the current temperature level and is very easy to operate.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
