<item>
<sku>142878</sku>
<name>Capillus Ultraliss Nanoplastia, set for the nanoplasty treatment, 3x400ml</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Capillus Ultraliss Nanoplastia, set for the nanoplasty treatment, 3x400ml&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The Capillus Ultraliss Nanoplastia treatment consists in professional progressive straightening of the hair, restoration of the strands and their moisturizing. There is no formaldehyde in the composition of cosmetics. As a result of nanoplasty, the hair stops frizz, is perfectly smooth and shiny, and remains straight and flexible for a long time. The set includes a cleansing shampoo preparing for the treatment, a caring serum, and a moisturizing lotion.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Discover the effects of nanoplasty from Capillus Ultraliss:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; perfectly smooth hair&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; reconstruction&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; hydration&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; improved flexibility&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; smoothing&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; frizz reduction&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Directions for use:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You should not perform nanoplasty on damaged hair in poor condition. To maintain the effect of the treatment, use salt-free and keratin-free cosmetics in home care for a long time.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Treatment application method:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Wash your hair with step 1 shampoo and dry it well. Divide your hair into 4 sections and start applying the serum step 2 with the brush from the roots to the tips, starting at the back of the head. REMEMBER ABOUT THE RIGHT SELECTION OF THE QUANTITY OF THE PRODUCT; as a rule, the serum is applied in a small amount. Leave the product on for 20 to 40 minutes depending on the structure of the hair, periodically assessing the condition of the hair.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Time to leave the product on the hair:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;20 min: fine and colored hair.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;30 min: Medium and healthy hair.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;40 mins: thick and healthy hair&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Remove any excess product, then dry thoroughly with a hair dryer. After the treatment, using a straightener, iron your hair in small strands at a temperature of 200-230&amp;ordm;C 10 to 20 times each strand. Let your hair cool down, then rinse well with water. To complete the process, apply a step 3 mask. Leave the mask on the hair for about 5 minutes and rinse thoroughly. Finally, blow-dry your hair.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Capacity: 400ml + 400ml + 400ml&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Capillus Ultraliss Nanoplastia, Cleansing Shampoo, Step 1, 400ml&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Capillus Nanoplastia cleansing shampoo is the first step of an innovative hair rejuvenation treatment. The shampoo prepares the hair for the treatment and for the absorption of active ingredients contained in the serum. The Capillus Ultraliss Nanoplastia treatment consists in professional progressive straightening of the hair, restoration of the strands and their moisturizing. There is no formaldehyde in the composition of cosmetics. As a result of nanoplasty, the hair stops frizz, is perfectly smooth and shiny, and remains straight and flexible for a long time.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Capillus Ultraliss Nanoplastia, serum, step 2, 400ml&lt;br /&gt;Capillus Nanoplastia straightening serum is the second step of an innovative hair rejuvenation treatment. The Capillus Ultraliss Nanoplastia treatment consists in professional progressive straightening of the hair, restoration of the strands and their moisturizing. There is no formaldehyde in the composition of cosmetics. As a result of nanoplasty, the hair stops frizz, is perfectly smooth and shiny, and remains straight and flexible for a long time.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Capillus Ultraliss Nanoplastia, moisturizing lotion, step 3, 400ml&lt;br /&gt;The Capillus Nanoplastia moisturizing lotion is the third step of the innovative hair rejuvenation treatment. The Capillus Ultraliss Nanoplastia treatment consists in professional progressive straightening of the hair, restoration of the strands and their moisturizing. There is no formaldehyde in the composition of cosmetics. As a result of nanoplasty, the hair stops frizz, is perfectly smooth and shiny, and remains straight and flexible for a long time.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>50.61</price>
