<description>&lt;p&gt;Rotating, automatic hair clipper.&lt;br /&gt;The modern technology of the crosspiece allows for quick and independent creation of perfect waves. The ceramic plates rotating 360 &amp;deg; evenly distribute the heat, which quickly penetrates the hair. This ensures hydration and protection against damage to the hair. The product closes the hair cuticle to give the hair shine.&lt;br /&gt;The crimp plates allow you to create a variety of hairstyles, such as crimp all hair or play with combining straight and crimped hair.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Technical data:&lt;br /&gt;Dimensions: 31cm x 3.8cm x 5.8cm&lt;br /&gt;Temperature: 170 &amp;deg; - 210 &amp;deg;&lt;br /&gt;Power: 36W&lt;br /&gt;Voltage: 100-240V&lt;br /&gt;Warm-up time: 30 seconds, temperature 170 &amp;deg;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
