<item>
<sku>141188</sku>
<name>4Rico Bar Hocker QS-B16g velvet black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/141188/EN_141188_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4Rico &lt;/strong&gt;brand furniture combines functionality and comfort. The hockers and makeup chairs available in their offer are distinguished by a wide selection of patterns, colors, and upholstery materials. They will be a sophisticated accent to any space – both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/141188/EN_141188_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An elegant element of the beauty salon&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hocker 4Rico QS-B16G&lt;/strong&gt; combines high quality with functionality and &lt;strong&gt;impresses with its luxurious design&lt;/strong&gt;. It will be perfect for services such as makeup or eyebrow styling. It will also be an elegant element of the reception desk, &lt;strong&gt;emphasizing the exclusive character of the interior&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/141188/EN_141188_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Height adjustment with a gas lift&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;solid gas lift&lt;/strong&gt; allows easy and smooth height adjustment within &lt;strong&gt;60-80 cm&lt;/strong&gt; and guarantees safety of use. The hocker easily adjusts to the user’s needs and the specifics of treatments, making it &lt;strong&gt;versatile and comfortable&lt;/strong&gt;, especially for makeup and styling.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/141188/EN_141188_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features for comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The furniture is equipped with &lt;strong&gt;ergonomic foot support&lt;/strong&gt; and a properly contoured, low backrest. These features provide &lt;strong&gt;appropriate body support&lt;/strong&gt;, reducing muscle tension and allowing for long and pleasant beauty sessions. In addition, the &lt;strong&gt;easy rotation of the hocker&lt;/strong&gt; enables effortless position changes, which clearly increases work efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/141188/EN_141188_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stylish finish&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The hocker is distinguished by &lt;strong&gt;pleasant-to-touch, velvet upholstery&lt;/strong&gt; in shades of black, giving it an exclusive character. &lt;strong&gt;Stylish stitching&lt;/strong&gt; on the hocker’s backrest emphasizes its elegant look and careful workmanship. The &lt;strong&gt;round base with non-slip rubber&lt;/strong&gt; ensures stability, while the gold color harmonizes with the velvet upholstery, giving the furniture a refined style. Thanks to its &lt;strong&gt;ergonomically contoured seat and adjustable height&lt;/strong&gt;, the hocker is an ideal choice for those who appreciate both style and comfort.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The exact dimensions of the hocker are provided in the photo.&lt;br&gt;Gold elements are lacquered. Mechanical damage to the coating is not subject to complaint.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cylinder: gas&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: velvet&lt;br&gt;Color of upholstery: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Frame color: shades of gold&lt;/p&gt;</description>
