<item>
<sku>138342</sku>
<name>STRAIGHTENER CURLING IRON 2IN1 TORSION K-148</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;2in1 styling curler straightener thanks to its unique and intuitive design, you can create waves and curls or get the effect of super smooth, straight hair. The plates are longer, therefore they provide faster styling thanks to better results after the first stroke on the hair strand.&lt;br /&gt;The uniquely twisted plates help to gain confidence for those users who usually struggle to curl their hair with a straightener. Thanks to the intuitive design, creating your dream look requires a minimum of work, while the rounded outer casing immediately cools the hair and thus fixes curls.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advantages:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- Twisted plates for easy curling and straightening.&lt;br /&gt;- A friendly 2-in-1 styling device that allows you to create bouncy curls, soft waves and smooth, elegant hairstyles.&lt;br /&gt;- Ceramic plates covered with an antistatic tourmaline coating, which ensures a smooth glide and does not cause static on the hair.&lt;br /&gt;- Digital temperature display; adjustable temperature settings 140-230&amp;ordm;C every 10&amp;ordm;C. Suitable for all hair types&lt;br /&gt;- Smooth, rounded body instantly cools the hair down and fixes curls.&lt;br /&gt;- Floating plate ensures even pressure on the hair.&lt;br /&gt;- Temperature control.&lt;br /&gt;- On / off button.&lt;br /&gt;- Automatic shutdown after 30 minutes.&lt;br /&gt;- Swivel cord.&lt;br /&gt;- Lock for easy storage.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Voltage 100-240V&lt;br /&gt;The frequency of 50-6Hz&lt;br /&gt;Power: 40W&lt;br /&gt;Working temperature 140-230&amp;ordm;C&lt;/p&gt;</description>
