<name>STRAIGHTENER CURLING IRON INNOVATION AIR FLOW K-245</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Innovation Air Flow K-245 device is a revolution in straighteners for professional use. Its advantage is a specially developed design that makes it unique: unlike conventional straighteners, which open and close with the inevitable loss of heat. Innovation is equipped with a central hole through which the hair flows. This feature guarantees a constant optimal temperature during straightening with perfect, long-lasting results, and the activated Air Flow system provides additional air flow, protects the hair from drying out and helps to close the hair cuticle. The air flow is imperceptible with the hand, but the effect is visible during operation of the device. Since no pressure is required to close the straightener, hands are now free to move through each strand, large or small, making it much easier and faster to achieve the perfect smoothness or natural wave. An innovative solution that facilitates styling and does not burden the wrist. The non-slip and anti-burn handle ensures maximum comfort during use.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advantages:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- Innovative design to protect against heat loss&lt;br /&gt;- Air Flow system to protect the hair&lt;br /&gt;- Ceramic-titanium plates with tourmaline coating&lt;br /&gt;- Temperature adjustment button from 140 to 220&amp;ordm;C&lt;br /&gt;- Turns off automatically after 30 minutes of non-use&lt;br /&gt;- Swivel cable&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Voltage: 100-240V&lt;br /&gt;Frequency: 50-60HZ&lt;br /&gt;Power: 36W&lt;/p&gt;</description>
