<description>&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality of craft and precision of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OCHO PRO&lt;/strong&gt; is a unique brand that provides high-quality tools for the beauty industry. &lt;strong&gt;OCHO PRO&lt;/strong&gt; oversees the production and focuses on a continuous improvement of tools that help in the performance of treatments and daily care.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/134801/EN_134801_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solutions that make your work easier&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;OCHO professional nippers are made of high quality stainless steel. They have a double-sided spring which allows for smooth cutting. A specially shaped handle in classic mode ensures high precision, comfort, and ease of work.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/134801/EN_134801_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perfectly precise nippers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Lap Joint&lt;/strong&gt; method of joining the jaws was used; the nippers' jaws engage perfectly during operation, allowing for an accurate cut. Working with these nippers will be trouble-free, even for a long time of use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/134801/EN_134801_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For beauty salon and home use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OCHO PRO nippers&lt;/strong&gt; stand for high quality and efficiency. They are perfect for manicure treatments. They will also work well for all small care tasks. You can use them in a beauty salon or at home. Suitable for autoclave sterilisation and chemical disinfection.  &lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Jaws available in size:&lt;strong&gt; 12 (4 mm)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The total length of the nippers: &lt;strong&gt;10.2 cm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;After use, remove the remains of the cuticle, dust, and nail;&lt;br&gt;Dip in disinfectant;&lt;br&gt;Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil;&lt;br&gt;Replace the cap to avoid bending the blade,&lt;br&gt;Never put the clippers down with the blade pointing down;&lt;br&gt;Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: Store in a dry and safe place. Keep away from children.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
