available in size: &lt;strong&gt;3,5 mm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The total length of the nippers: &lt;strong&gt;10.2 cm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;After use, remove the remains of the cuticle, dust, and nail;&lt;br&gt;Dip in disinfectant;&lt;br&gt;Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil;&lt;br&gt;Replace the cap to avoid bending the blade,&lt;br&gt;Never put the clippers down with the blade pointing down;&lt;br&gt;Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: Store in a dry and safe place. Keep away from children.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
