<item>
<sku>134810</sku>
<name>OCHO PRO 101 Cuticle Pusher</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OCHO PRO&lt;/strong&gt; is a unique brand that provides high-quality tools for the beauty industry. &lt;strong&gt;OCHO PRO&lt;/strong&gt; has set itself the goal of creating and constantly improving tools that help in the performance of treatments and in daily care.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/134810/EN_134810_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ocho Pro Cuticle Pusher&lt;/strong&gt; is perfectly suitable for manicure and pedicure. It is used to wipe the epidermis and to effectively move cuticles, pellets and any gel and acrylic residues from the nail plate.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;It is properly contoured, fits perfectly in the hand (like a pen) and has a nice look.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;It has various features that testify to the high quality of the product:&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;It is made of special stainless steel, which is used in the production of surgical instruments.&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;It has two different ends (a two-sided flat knife and a convex rounded knife)&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;The handle is notched, so it will not slip in your hand while working.&lt;br&gt;Suitable for autoclave sterilisation and chemical disinfection.  &lt;/li&gt;  &lt;/ul&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/134810/EN_134810_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Length: 12 cm&lt;br&gt;Cutter tip length: 8 mm&lt;br&gt;Round, convex tip length: 19 mm&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;div class="video-container"&gt;   &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dlChhG7oN_s" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;   &lt;/IFRAME&gt;   &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
