<description>&lt;p&gt;A very easy-to-use roller for curling your hair will make you shine at any party!&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;You can curl your hair yourself in just 5 easy steps:&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;1. Start with slightly damp hair - for example, dampening dry hair with a spray or a wet brush. You can also dry your hair after showering until it is slightly damp.&lt;br&gt;2. Use a hair clip to set the center of the curler on top of your head.&lt;br&gt;3. Start braiding your hair on one side by wrapping it around the curler.&lt;br&gt;4. When you braid your hair to the end, wrap it with elastic bands (wraps).&lt;br&gt;5. Remove the roller from the hair.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Enjoy the final effect and feel special!&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The set includes: a roller, a hair clip, two hair bands (wrappers).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
