<item>
<sku>144401</sku>
<name>SNIPPEX TITANIUM MANICURE PLIERS CS82</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SNIPPEX brand&lt;/strong&gt; offers a wide range of cosmetic tools necessary for any salon. Professional accessories such as cuticle nippers, hoofs and tweezers, thanks to their high quality workmanship, will ensure comfort and precision during treatments. Thanks to the ease of use, SNIPPEX cosmetic tools are used both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/144401/EN_144401_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Colorful model of nippers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The SNIPPEX professional manicure pliers&lt;/strong&gt; are made of high-quality carbon steel, making them highly resistant to damage and dulling. A specially applied coating makes them eye-catching with a &lt;strong&gt;multitude of colors&lt;/strong&gt;. The elegant finish and rainbow colors will meet the most demanding tastes! The polished, smooth surface ensures that the nippers are easy to keep clean. They are suitable for disinfection at low temperatures.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/144401/EN_144401_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work comfort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The double spring provides &lt;strong&gt;excellent precision cutting&lt;/strong&gt;. Careful manufacturing of it allows comfortable, quiet and smooth operation. The way it is profiled makes the pliers fit perfectly in the hand, guaranteeing comfortable use. The extended arms are perfect for those with larger hands.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profiled blade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Precision blades are perfect for manicure treatments. The profile of their bevel makes it easy to perform precise treatments. The jaws of the clippers are connected by the Lap Joint method, so they connect perfectly during use, which ensures &lt;strong&gt;precise cutting&lt;/strong&gt;. The pliers come with a matching blade cover.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/144401/EN_144401_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Blade length: 7 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length of the nippers: 11,5 cm&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• After use, remove residue of epidermis, dust, nail; &lt;br&gt;• Dip in disinfectant liquid; &lt;br&gt;• Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil; &lt;br&gt;• Apply a cover to protect the tool from damage;&lt;br&gt;• Never put the cuticle nippers with the blade facing down; &lt;br&gt;• Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Caution&lt;/strong&gt;. Store in a dry and safe place. Keep out of reach of children.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>7.12</price>
<category_subcategory>Podiatry&gt;Tools and accessories&gt;SNIPPEX AND EXO</category_subcategory>
<qty>8</qty>
<weight>0.0450</weight>
<brand>SNIPPEX</brand>
<tax>23%</tax>
<EAN>5906717451829</EAN>
