<item>
<sku>144402</sku>
<name>SNIPPEX MANICURE PLIERS BLACK CS61</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SNIPPEX brand&lt;/strong&gt; offers a wide range of cosmetic tools necessary for any salon. Professional accessories such as cuticle nippers, hoofs and tweezers, thanks to their high quality workmanship, will ensure comfort and precision during treatments. Thanks to the ease of use, &lt;strong&gt;SNIPPEX&lt;/strong&gt; cosmetic tools are used both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/144402/EN_144402_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elegant model of pliers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The SNIPPEX professional manicure pliers&lt;/strong&gt; are made of high-quality carbon steel, making them highly resistant to damage and dulling. The semi-matte finish and black elements give the tool an extremely elegant look. The pliers are suitable for disinfection at low temperatures.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work comfort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Carefully made single element connecting the arms ended with a special spring allows for comfortable, quiet and smooth operation. The way the arms are profiled makes the nippers &lt;strong&gt;fit perfectly in the hand&lt;/strong&gt;, guaranteeing comfortable use. The non-slip handle is not only a &lt;strong&gt;high comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;, it also gives the pliers an interesting look. The small size and lightness of the tool allow use in almost any conditions.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/144402/EN_144402_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profiled blade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Precise, short blades are perfect for manicure treatments. The angle at which they are cut, as well as their size, make it &lt;strong&gt;easier to perform treatments&lt;/strong&gt; in hard-to-reach areas. The jaws of the nippers are connected by the Lap Joint method, so they connect perfectly during use, which ensures precise cutting. The pliers come with a matching blade cover.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/144402/EN_144402_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Blade length: 5 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length of the nippers: 11 cm&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• After use, remove residue of epidermis, dust, nail; &lt;br&gt;• Dip in disinfectant liquid; &lt;br&gt;• Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil; &lt;br&gt;• Apply a cover to protect the tool from damage;&lt;br&gt;• Never put the cuticle nippers with the blade facing down; &lt;br&gt;• Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Caution&lt;/strong&gt;. Store in a dry and safe place. Keep out of reach of children.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
