ant, durable and easy to clean. It is suitable for disinfection at low temperatures.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Width of "spatula": 6 mm&lt;br&gt;Width of "knife": 7 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length: 14 cm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
