ool from slipping in the hand&lt;/strong&gt; and is visually appealing. The hoof is made of high-quality carbon steel, making it dull-resistant, durable and easy to clean. It is suitable for disinfection at low temperatures.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Width of "spatula": 7 mm&lt;br&gt;Length of "knife" blade: 9 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length: 12,5 cm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
