<item>
<sku>144257</sku>
<name>OCHO PEDICURE NIPPERS CNO84 11,6CM</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OCHO PRO&lt;/strong&gt; is a unique brand that produces high-quality, innovative and best-in-class tools for the beauty industry. They offer products such as specialized tweezers, hooves and pliers. &lt;strong&gt;OCHO PRO's&lt;/strong&gt; goal is to create and continuously improve accessories that help with treatments and daily grooming.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/144257/EN_144257_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Handy tool&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The OCHO PRO professional pedicure pliers&lt;/strong&gt; are made of high-quality carbon steel, making them highly resistant to damage and dulling. The minimalist, semi-matte finish makes them look elegant, and keeping them clean is extremely easy. They are suitable for disinfection at low temperatures.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work comfort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The spring connecting the arms provides &lt;strong&gt;excellent precision cutting&lt;/strong&gt;. Careful manufacture of it allows comfortable, quiet and smooth operation. The way of profiling and the size of the arms make the pliers &lt;strong&gt;lie securely in the hand&lt;/strong&gt;, guaranteeing comfortable use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/144257/EN_144257_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profiled blade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The massive, curved blades are &lt;strong&gt;perfect for cutting even tougher cuticles or nails&lt;/strong&gt;. Their shape makes it easier to perform treatments even in hard-to-reach areas. The jaws of the nippers are connected by the Lap Joint method, so they connect perfectly during use, which ensures &lt;strong&gt;extremely precise cutting&lt;/strong&gt;. The pliers have a matching blade cover.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/144257/EN_144257_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Blade length: 16 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length of the nippers: 12,5 cm&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• After use, remove residue of epidermis, dust, nail; &lt;br&gt;• Dip in disinfectant liquid; &lt;br&gt;• Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil; &lt;br&gt;• Apply a cover to protect the tool from damage;&lt;br&gt;• Never put the cuticle nippers with the blade facing down; &lt;br&gt;• Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Caution&lt;/strong&gt;. Store in a dry and safe place. Keep out of reach of children.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>14.03</price>
