<item>
<sku>141646</sku>
<name>Disposable hairdresser/barber cape 120x150 cm 100 pieces</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A hairdressing cape&lt;/strong&gt; is an essential piece of equipment for any hair salon or barbershop. It helps &lt;strong&gt;maintain high standards of cleanliness&lt;/strong&gt; by protecting the client's body and clothing from splashing during hair treatments. It will also find use in other specialized salons, including cosmetic ones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep clean during treatments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A transparent foil hairdresser's cape&lt;/strong&gt; is perfect for all services offered in beauty salons, including various hair care and coloring treatments. &lt;strong&gt;It professionally protects clothing&lt;/strong&gt; against soiling with products used during treatments. It will also come in handy during both dry and wet haircuts –&lt;strong&gt; it prevents the cut hair from getting under the clothes&lt;/strong&gt;. In beauty salons, it will find use, especially during makeup or henna treatments.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take care of the customer's comfort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The capes are made of &lt;strong&gt;light foil&lt;/strong&gt;, which adequately &lt;strong&gt;protects against all kinds of splashes&lt;/strong&gt;. Thanks to their universal size and a wide range of adjustments with a tie around the neck, they &lt;strong&gt;will work well for any client&lt;/strong&gt;, regardless of their height, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring comfort during the procedure&lt;/strong&gt;. Using disposable hairdressing capes contributes to &lt;strong&gt;the improvement of hygienic comfort&lt;/strong&gt; in the beauty salon.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The package contains &lt;strong&gt;100 pieces&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size:&lt;/strong&gt; 120×150 cm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
