<item>
<sku>144212</sku>
<name>SNIPPEX EYELASH CURLER S100 PINK</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SNIPPEX brand&lt;/strong&gt; offers a wide range of cosmetic tools necessary for any salon. Thanks to their high-quality workmanship, professional accessories such as cuticle nippers, hoofs and tweezers, will ensure comfort and precision during treatments. Thanks to the ease of use, &lt;strong&gt;SNIPPEX cosmetic tools&lt;/strong&gt; are used both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Snippex eyelash curler&lt;/strong&gt; is a simple device with which even at home you can quickly achieve a beautiful curl of eyelashes. It allows you to lift and curl eyelashes from the very root, and the gently rounded form &lt;strong&gt;guarantees a natural effect&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The functional shape &lt;/strong&gt;guarantees comfortable use. It is equipped with an efficient mechanism that automatically opens the tongs, which &lt;strong&gt;ensures safe and smooth use&lt;/strong&gt;. The eyelash curler has a metal construction and a special rubber cover that protects lashes from damage. Thanks to its non-slip grips, it&lt;strong&gt; fits perfectly in the hand&lt;/strong&gt; for comfortable use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool hygene&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Curl your eyelashes before applying mascara – this is safer for the hairs and &lt;strong&gt;prevents them from breaking&lt;/strong&gt;. Also remember that the eyelash curler &lt;strong&gt;should be disinfected after each use&lt;/strong&gt;. Contaminants that remain on it (e.g. epidermis, sebum, cosmetics) can contribute to eye infections.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to curl eyelashes with an eyelash curler?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;• Gently apply the properly shaped concave part of the curler to the upper eyelid, as close to the root of the lashes as possible. The hairs should be in between the tongs of the curler. Be careful not to catch the skin of the eyelid.&lt;br&gt;• Tighten the device and hold for 10 to 30 seconds to allow the hairs to bend. For best and most lasting results, pinch the lashes at several points – at the root, in the middle and at the very tips.&lt;br&gt;• Gently release the grip.&lt;br&gt;• For more excellent effect, highlight your lashes with mascara.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dimensions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Overall length: 11 cm&lt;br&gt;Width of forceps: 3 cm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>1.22</price>
