<item>
<sku>142858</sku>
<name>Foil backrest cover for hairdressing chair</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The cover for the backrest of the hairdressing chair&lt;/strong&gt; is a product that will extend the life of professional furniture. Made of a thick, tear-resistant material, it will &lt;strong&gt;prevent dirt and damage to the upholstery&lt;/strong&gt; that may occur due to daily use. It will also be a good protection against dust or damage to the furniture in transit. &lt;strong&gt;The universal size&lt;/strong&gt; will allow it to fit most of the standard rectangular models.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backrest protection&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Extremely easy to use, the cover &lt;strong&gt;will perfectly protect the upholstery&lt;/strong&gt; from possible abrasion, moisture and splashing with preparations used during beauty treatments. It is designed &lt;strong&gt;to adequately cover each side of the backrest&lt;/strong&gt;, guaranteeing excellent furniture protection. &lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Careful workmanship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The cover is finished to extend the durability of the product as much as possible. Hems on the edges ensure &lt;strong&gt;the comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt; and prevent fraying of the material. The transparent, waterproof material is &lt;strong&gt;impervious and easy to keep clean&lt;/strong&gt;. When folded, the cover does not take up much space and is &lt;strong&gt;easy to store&lt;/strong&gt;. It will work well in any beauty salon and other specialized places.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The cover is reusable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One piece&lt;/strong&gt; in the package.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dimensions:&lt;/strong&gt; 35×50×8 cm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
