<item>
<sku>144225</sku>
<name>OCHO HOOF PO34 14.8CM</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OCHO PRO&lt;/strong&gt; is a unique brand that produces high-quality, innovative and best-in-class tools for the beauty industry. They offer products such as specialized tweezers, hooves and pliers. &lt;strong&gt;OCHO PRO's&lt;/strong&gt; goal is to create and continuously improve accessories that help with treatments and daily grooming.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/144225/EN_144225_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical nail tool&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The OCHO PRO&lt;/strong&gt; multifunctional double-sided hoof will hit the most demanding tastes! Extraordinary functionality and eye-catching rainbow-colored design will find use both in beauty salons and at home, with special caution due to the possibility of injury.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to use the cuticle hoofs?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The tool has &lt;strong&gt;two functional tips&lt;/strong&gt; of different shapes, used as needed. &lt;br&gt;• &lt;strong&gt;The extended, rounded spatula&lt;/strong&gt; is perfect for working with longer nails. Thanks to the properly ground edge, it allows to remove cuticles efficiently, while not damaging the nail plate. It will prepare the plate for further treatments.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;strong&gt;The narrow, pointed one&lt;/strong&gt; will prove useful for removing dirt from under the nail and cuticle residues from the plate. The small size allows you to reach hard-to-reach places.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/144225/EN_144225_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functionality and aesthetics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The grooving on the surface of the handle &lt;strong&gt;prevents the tool from slipping in the hand&lt;/strong&gt;, and together with the interesting color scheme gives the tool an attractive appearance. The hoof is made of high-quality carbon steel, so it is durable and maintains an ideal degree of sharpness for a long time. It is suitable for disinfection at low temperatures.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Tips width: 9 i 1 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length: 15 cm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
