<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OCHO PRO&lt;/strong&gt; is a unique brand that produces high-quality, innovative and best-in-class tools for the beauty industry. They offer products such as specialized tweezers, hooves and pliers. &lt;strong&gt;OCHO PRO's&lt;/strong&gt; goal is to create and continuously improve accessories that help with treatments and daily grooming.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/144233/EN_144233_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical nail tool&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The OCHO PRO multifunctional double-sided hoof&lt;/strong&gt; is a practical tool that will find its place both in the beauty salon in the home cosmetic kit. The tool is distinguished by its extraordinary functionality and eye-catching rainbow design.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to use the cuticle hoofs?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The tool has &lt;strong&gt;two functional tips&lt;/strong&gt; of different shapes, used as needed. &lt;br&gt;• The extended, &lt;strong&gt;rounded spatula&lt;/strong&gt; is perfect for working with longer nails. The properly ground edge allows you to remove cuticles efficiently, while not damaging the nail plate.&lt;br&gt;• The second tip, &lt;strong&gt;a modified arrowhead&lt;/strong&gt;, has different surfaces that will work well for procedures such as cutting cuticles, cleaning the nail plate after previous stylizations or removing dirt and cuticle from under the nail surface.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/144233/EN_144233_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functionality and aesthetics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The grooving on the surface of the handle &lt;strong&gt;prevents the tool from slipping in the hand&lt;/strong&gt;, and together with the interesting color scheme, it gives the tool an attractive look. The hoof is made of high-quality carbon steel, making it durable and easy to keep clean. It is suitable for disinfection at low temperatures.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Width of spatula: 9 mm&lt;br&gt;Width of arrowhead: 11 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length: 14,5 cm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
