<item>
<sku>146833</sku>
<name>Gabbiano barber's helper C12 black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/146833/EN_146833_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano&lt;/strong&gt; is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship, as well as high comfort of use. The offer includes a large selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, washers and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/146833/EN_146833_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep your workplace clean&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The stylish &lt;strong&gt;barber's helper Gabbiano C12&lt;/strong&gt; is a great piece of salon equipment, which will find its place especially in interiors decorated in an old-school style. It allows you&lt;strong&gt; to organise your workspace&lt;/strong&gt; and arrange your products so that the most important ones are always at hand.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/146833/EN_146833_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quick and easy access to the tools you need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The capacious organizer is equipped&lt;strong&gt; with a large number of compartments&lt;/strong&gt;. Pull-out shelves with handles and places for accessories, drawers, compartments and special pockets for storing barbering products and tools &lt;strong&gt;make it easier to keep your work area tidy&lt;/strong&gt; and significantly improve the organization of the space. Easy assembly and removal of the wheels&lt;strong&gt; improve the mobility of the furniture&lt;/strong&gt;, thanks to which the helper can be moved freely. &lt;strong&gt;The extendable handle&lt;/strong&gt;, located at the back of the helper, allows the furniture to be easily transported.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/146833/EN_146833_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure product storage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Drawers are equipped with locks that help &lt;strong&gt;protect products&lt;/strong&gt;, especially during transport. When closed, all the storage compartments stay in one place, &lt;strong&gt;preventing tools from shifting&lt;/strong&gt;, moving around and getting damaged.&lt;strong&gt; A key and code padlock&lt;/strong&gt; are also included to further secure your equipment.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/146833/EN_146833_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A unique design for your barbershop&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The characteristic style of &lt;strong&gt;the Gabbiano C12 helper&lt;/strong&gt; is a the perfect solution for barbershops that appreciate &lt;strong&gt;the unique look and elegant details&lt;/strong&gt;. The fronts of the cabinets are decorated with &lt;strong&gt;stylized British patterns&lt;/strong&gt;, which will certainly emphasize the atmosphere of the interior. The material imitating leather in shades of black and metal elements add &lt;strong&gt;elegance, masculine character and a luxurious look&lt;/strong&gt; to the furniture. This helper will be a great choice for people who appreciate both interesting &lt;strong&gt;design and functionality&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/146833/EN_146833_6.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The exact dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Included:&lt;/strong&gt; helper, set of wheels, padlock, keys.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ICOhViz-zYA" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;</description>
<price>134.96</price>
<category_subcategory>Hairdressing salon equipment&gt;Hairdressing helpers</category_subcategory>
<qty>0</qty>
<weight>13.4000</weight>
<brand>GABBIANO</brand>
<tax>23%</tax>
