<description>&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A small accessory that improves hairdressing treatments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hair clips&lt;/strong&gt; are an essential accessory in every hairdressing salon, significantly &lt;strong&gt;increasing the comfort of work&lt;/strong&gt;. Practical clips are useful &lt;strong&gt;when separating hair strands&lt;/strong&gt; during various hairdressing treatments, including hair coloring, cutting or &lt;strong&gt;creating complicated updos&lt;/strong&gt;. They will also work great at home, being not only &lt;strong&gt;a facilitation with fancy hairdo&lt;/strong&gt;, but also a great idea for &lt;strong&gt;a comfortable everyday hairstyle&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical solutions for comfortable work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The wide jaws&lt;/strong&gt; allow wide strands to be gripped, while the well-profiled teeth and the appropriate spring &lt;strong&gt;ensure hair is held decently&lt;/strong&gt;. The clip material is &lt;strong&gt;easy to clean&lt;/strong&gt;, so it is not difficult to remove product residues and keep the accessory clean. &lt;strong&gt;The simple design &lt;/strong&gt;makes these clips &lt;strong&gt;a practical element&lt;/strong&gt; that will fit into the interior of any beauty salon.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The pack contains &lt;strong&gt;12 pieces&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Width: 8 cm&lt;br&gt;Colour: black&lt;br&gt;Material: plastic&lt;/p&gt;</description>
