<item>
<sku>147025</sku>
<name>Gabbiano hairdresser's helper with UV sterilizer 68UV black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147025/EN_147025_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano&lt;/strong&gt; is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship, as well as high comfort of use. The offer includes a large selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, washers and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147025/EN_147025_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A practical way to organize your workplace&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The professional &lt;strong&gt;hairdresser's helper Gabbiano 68UV with UV sterilizer&lt;/strong&gt; is an extremely useful element of beauty salon equipment that will &lt;strong&gt;improve work&lt;/strong&gt; and allow to take care of &lt;strong&gt;proper order and organisation of the workplace&lt;/strong&gt;. Thanks to the practical arrangement of products, the most necessary ones will always be at hand. &lt;strong&gt;The enclosed back panel prevents the drawers&lt;/strong&gt; from accidentally being pulled out the other way, which could result in damage to the utensils inside.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147025/EN_147025_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Easy access to all the tools you need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The capacious organizer is equipped with a &lt;strong&gt;set of storage trays&lt;/strong&gt; that will help to &lt;strong&gt;ensure order&lt;/strong&gt; in the workplace, sorting out the tools necessary for the hairdresser's work. The set includes &lt;strong&gt;six containers&lt;/strong&gt;: two without compartments, two with compartments and two narrow and deeper ones. &lt;strong&gt;Their arrangement in the organizer can be freely changed&lt;/strong&gt; at will to suit your own needs, and a large selection of different types of drawers allows you to segregate the utensils at your discretion. In addition, &lt;strong&gt;the two deepest cuvettes can be placed at different heights on the sides of the helper&lt;/strong&gt;, so that the utensils placed in them will always be at the right level.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147025/EN_147025_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daily dry disinfection at your fingertips&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The UV-C sterilizer installed in the helper&lt;/strong&gt; is an excellent solution that will ensure the safety of the treatments performed. It will &lt;strong&gt;easily and quickly&lt;/strong&gt; clean the surfaces of tools from most pathogens. The interior of the device is made of surgical steel and is mirrored, which reflects UV rays and ensures more thorough disinfection.&lt;strong&gt; An efficient quartz lamp&lt;/strong&gt; with a wavelength of 254 nm &lt;strong&gt;effectively destroys various forms of microorganisms&lt;/strong&gt;. The suggested duration of the process is 10 minutes, but you can freely adjust this value within &lt;strong&gt;5-30 minutes&lt;/strong&gt;, which are counted down by the digital display.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147025/EN_147025_6.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Suitable solutions for the comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The metal dryer holder&lt;/strong&gt; is adapted to most models available on the market, which &lt;strong&gt;allows you to conveniently hang up the equipment&lt;/strong&gt; during services. On the helper there are two places where you can easily place a hanger, which allows you &lt;strong&gt;to adjust the organizer to individual needs&lt;/strong&gt;, ensures comfortable use and does not hinder work.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147025/EN_147025_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention to detail&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;On top of the helper is a&lt;strong&gt; shallow recess&lt;/strong&gt;, which will be great for putting away tools while you work. It will also be a great place &lt;strong&gt;to put the most necessary accessories for the duration of the service&lt;/strong&gt; – as in the case of coloring – bowls, paints or brushes. The surface of the recess – like all the trays in the set – is covered with &lt;strong&gt;a matt, rough, non-slip layer&lt;/strong&gt;, thanks to which it cushions and keeps the placed instruments in a given place.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147025/EN_147025_7.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimalist design and functionality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The simple style&lt;/strong&gt; of the helper makes it suitable for any interior. Made of&lt;strong&gt; easy-to-clean, durable material&lt;/strong&gt;, this piece of furniture in shades of black will significantly improve the work in any beauty salon. &lt;strong&gt;Rubberised wheels&lt;/strong&gt; provide mobility, allowing it &lt;strong&gt;to be moved freely and smoothly&lt;/strong&gt; depending on the needs – whether during treatments around the hairdressing chair or putting it away after the service. They can also be easily dismantled if necessary. This helper will prove especially useful for those who highly value &lt;strong&gt;functionality&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The exact dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes:&lt;/strong&gt; helper's frame with sterilizer, two trays without compartments, two trays with compartments, two narrow and deep trays, dryer holder, set of wheels, instruction.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Suggested disinfection time: 10 minutes&lt;br&gt;UV lamp life: 5000 hours&lt;br&gt;Power: 6 W&lt;br&gt;Voltage: 100-240 V&lt;/p&gt;</description>
