<item>
<sku>146517</sku>
<name>OCHO PRO PROFESSIONAL CUTICLE NIPPERS 06 JAW14</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ocho Pro&lt;/strong&gt; is a unique brand that produces high-quality, innovative and best-in-class tools for the beauty industry. They offer products such as specialized tweezers, hooves and pliers. The &lt;strong&gt;Ocho Pro's&lt;/strong&gt; goal is to create and continuously improve accessories that help with treatments and daily grooming.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/146517/EN_146517_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extremely precise tool&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Ocho Pro professional cuticle nippers 06 JAW14&lt;/strong&gt; for manicure are made of &lt;strong&gt;high-quality stainless steel&lt;/strong&gt;, making them highly resistant to damage and blunting. &lt;strong&gt;The semi-matte finish&lt;/strong&gt; makes them look elegant, while keeping them clean is extremely easy. &lt;strong&gt;They are suitable for sterilization in the autoclave&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/146517/EN_146517_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High working comfort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The double spring&lt;/strong&gt; connecting the arms ensures &lt;strong&gt;an excellent feel and cutting precision&lt;/strong&gt;. Its careful execution allows for &lt;strong&gt;comfortable, quiet and smooth operation&lt;/strong&gt;. The way of profiling and the size of the arms make the nippers &lt;strong&gt;fit perfectly in the hand&lt;/strong&gt;, guaranteeing comfort of use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/146517/EN_146517_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perfectly shaped blade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precise, short blades&lt;/strong&gt; are perfect for manicure treatments. Their bevel profile and small size make it &lt;strong&gt;easier to perform treatments in hard-to-reach areas&lt;/strong&gt;. The jaws of the nippers are connected using &lt;strong&gt;the Lap Joint method&lt;/strong&gt;, so that they make perfect contact during use, which &lt;strong&gt;ensures precise cutting&lt;/strong&gt;. The pliers have a &lt;strong&gt;matching cover&lt;/strong&gt; for the blades made of durable plastic.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dimensions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade length: 6 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length of the clippers: 10.5 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• After use, remove residue of epidermis, dust, nail; &lt;br&gt;• Dip in disinfectant liquid; &lt;br&gt;• Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil; &lt;br&gt;• Apply a cover to protect the tool from damage;&lt;br&gt;• Never put the cuticle nippers with the blade facing down; &lt;br&gt;• Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;br&gt;Caution. Store in a dry and safe place. Keep out of reach of children.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>6.00</price>
<category_subcategory>Podiatry&gt;Tools and accessories&gt;OCHO PRO</category_subcategory>
