<item>
<sku>144783</sku>
<name>Hairdresser's cape collar</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;For many years, &lt;strong&gt;the ACTIVESHOP brand&lt;/strong&gt; has offered a wide range of products that work well for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort during the haircut&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The hairdresser's collar&lt;/strong&gt; has been designed to&lt;strong&gt; increase the comfort of the haircut&lt;/strong&gt;. The way it is shaped makes &lt;strong&gt;the cut hair stop in the recesses of the collar&lt;/strong&gt;, without falling on the floor or neck. This allows you&lt;strong&gt; to save time&lt;/strong&gt; that would have to be spent on sweeping the hair, and additionally there is &lt;strong&gt;no problem of irritating hairs&lt;/strong&gt; falling onto the neck. It also &lt;strong&gt;works well when applying hair care products&lt;/strong&gt; that could splash onto clothes.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A practical accessory for the hairdressing salon&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The comfortable &lt;strong&gt;Velcro fastening&lt;/strong&gt; allows for adjustment and&lt;strong&gt; individual adaptation&lt;/strong&gt; to each client. The product is made of &lt;strong&gt;waterproof material&lt;/strong&gt;, which makes it easy to clean and is also impervious to moisture, thus &lt;strong&gt;protecting clothes from getting wet&lt;/strong&gt; during hairdressing treatments. Its compact dimensions and &lt;strong&gt;extremely simple folding&lt;/strong&gt; make it easy to store.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
