<item>
<sku>147938</sku>
<name>Tattoo Cartridge EL CARTEL V2 3 InRow 0.25 3RL Long Taper 10 pcs.</name>
<description>&lt;h2&gt;EL CARTEL 3RLX – Precision and Power in a Straight Line&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Models: 3RLX3 / 3RLX4 / 3RLX5 / 3RLX6&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;EL CARTEL 3RLX&lt;/strong&gt; cartridges are the perfect tool for artists who demand maximum control, precision, and speed. With a &lt;strong&gt;linear needle configuration&lt;/strong&gt; (soldered side by side – flat style), these cartridges are ideal for techniques such as &lt;strong&gt;dotwork&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;stippling&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;linework&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;geometric designs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;h3&gt;Features:&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;ul&gt;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linear layout&lt;/strong&gt;: 3, 4, 5 or 6 needles in a row – more possibilities with full precision&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perfect for dotwork&lt;/strong&gt;: fast and consistent dot application, better coverage and saturation&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-quality build&lt;/strong&gt;: sharp, durable needles, stable membrane, and precise control&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Universal compatibility&lt;/strong&gt;: fits most pen-style machines and cartridge grips&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;/ul&gt;    &lt;h3&gt;Usage:&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;ul&gt;    &lt;li&gt;Dotwork / stippling – quickly creating uniform dot patterns&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;Linework – clean, bold lines in various widths&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;Textures, mandalas, geometric details&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;Perfect for large areas shaded with dots&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;/ul&gt;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Choose quality and precision. Work with 3RLX by EL CARTEL and feel the difference.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;  Available in: &lt;strong&gt;3RLX3, 3RLX4, 3RLX5, 3RLX6&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>11.16</price>
