<description>&lt;p&gt;Capillus ULTRALISS Termo Redutor FORTE No. 2 Nanoplastic Professional Line.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Termo Redutor reducing serum formula containing organic glyoxalic acid with a high content of keratin and amino acids intensively smooths hair reducing volume and counteracting frizz progressive hair straightening system for up to 4 months*.&lt;br /&gt;*when the treatment is properly performed and hair is properly cared for after the treatment with natural cosmetics without salt and sulphates, preferably containing keratin and amino acids such as the Alterlook botanical line.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Volume 500 ml.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Directions for use&lt;br /&gt;Add 5 ml of ampoule content to every 50 g of mask and mix thoroughly then divide into 4 sections and apply with a brush to the hair starting from the back of the head with a 1 cm distance from the roots. Leave the product on the hair for 20 to 40 minutes depending on the need, assessing the condition of the hair periodically. Remove excess product and then blow dry with a hairdryer. Then using a flat iron set at 200-230 degrees Celsius, pull through strand by strand 15 to 30 times. Rinse thoroughly.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Important!&lt;br /&gt;Before treatment, it is advisable to carry out a hair elasticity test to determine the condition of the hair, do not use on damaged hair with poor condition.&lt;br /&gt;Do not use on pregnant women.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
