<item>
<sku>142875</sku>
<name>Capillus Ultraliss Nanoplastic, cleansing shampoo, step 1, 400ml</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;CAPILLUS ULTRALISS Shampoo 400ml - step 1 of the CAPILLUS ULTRALISS Nanoplasty treatment&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;CAPILLUS ULTRALISS Nanoplasty is a professional cosmetic line for progressive hair straightening without formaldehydes with organic glyoxalic acid keratin and amino acid complex. It effectively restores and moisturises hair to reduce volume and frizz, leaving hair smooth and shiny.&lt;br /&gt;For a long-lasting straight effect, it is recommended to use the following hair care products after the treatment&lt;br /&gt;It is recommended to use salt-free and keratin-based hair care products after the treatment.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Important!&lt;br /&gt;Prior to treatment, it is advisable to carry out a hair elasticity test to determine the condition of the hair, this is important in order to choose the correct amount of Capillus Ultrallis straightening serum. The nanoplasty treatment should not be performed on damaged hair with poor condition.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Treatment application method:&lt;br /&gt;- Wash hair with step 1 shampoo and dry well.&lt;br /&gt;- Divide the hair into 4 sections and start applying the serum step 2 using a brush from root to tip, starting at the back of the head. REMEMBER TO CHOOSE THE RIGHT&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;QUANTITY OF PRODUCT; as a rule, apply the serum in a small amount.&lt;br /&gt;- Leave the product on for 20 to 40 minutes depending on the hair structure, periodically assessing the condition of the hair.&lt;br /&gt;- Time the product is left on the hair;&lt;br /&gt;20 min: fine and coloured hair.&lt;br /&gt;30 min: medium and healthy hair.&lt;br /&gt;40 min: thick and healthy hair&lt;br /&gt;- Remove excess product, then dry thoroughly with a hair dryer&lt;br /&gt;hair dryer.&lt;br /&gt;- After the treatment, using a flat iron, iron your hair in small strands at 200-230&amp;ordm;C 10 to 20 times each strand.&lt;br /&gt;- Allow hair to cool and then rinse well with water.&lt;br /&gt;- To complete the process, apply the mask step 3 .&lt;br /&gt;- Leave the mask on your hair for about 5 minutes and rinse thoroughly.&lt;br /&gt;- Finally, blow-dry your hair.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
