<item>
<sku>147825</sku>
<name>4Rico Bar Hocker QS-B313a gray velvet</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147825/EN_147825_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;4Rico&lt;/strong&gt; furniture combines functionality and comfort. The hockers and make-up chairs available in their offer are distinguished by a wide selection of patterns, colors and upholstery materials. They will be a sophisticated accent of any space – both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147825/EN_147825_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An elegant piece of furniture for your salon&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The 4Rico QS-B313a hocker&lt;/strong&gt; is a combination of high quality, comfort and functionality that impresses with its &lt;strong&gt;luxurious design&lt;/strong&gt;. It will be perfect for make-up, eyebrow styling, but it will also be &lt;strong&gt;an elegant element&lt;/strong&gt; of the reception in a beauty salon, emphasizing the exclusive character of the interior.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147825/EN_147825_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adjustable with a gas lift&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Equipped with &lt;strong&gt;a solid gas lift&lt;/strong&gt;, the hocker guarantees safety of use and allows for easy and &lt;strong&gt;smooth height adjustment within the range of 60-80 cm&lt;/strong&gt;. This allows you to adjust the piece of furniture to individual needs, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring high comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt; – both when applying make-up, doing eyebrows, and during other activities.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147825/EN_147825_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilities for user comfort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The furniture has foot support and a &lt;strong&gt;properly profiled, rounded backrest&lt;/strong&gt;. These features provide &lt;strong&gt;adequate body support&lt;/strong&gt;, reducing muscle tension. Thus, it allows for long and pleasant cosmetic sessions. In addition,&lt;strong&gt; the free rotation of the hocker&lt;/strong&gt; allows you to easily change the position, which&lt;strong&gt; increases work efficiency&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147825/EN_147825_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extravagant, stylish finish&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pleasant-to-the-touch, velvet upholstery&lt;/strong&gt; in shades of gray gives the hocker a unique character, and &lt;strong&gt;the aesthetically intertwined fabric on the backrest&lt;/strong&gt; emphasizes the unique look of the furniture. The finish makes the piece of furniture catch the eye. The frame in shades of gold &lt;strong&gt;adds elegance&lt;/strong&gt; and prestige, perfectly matching the velvet.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ISdpEuONNtU" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The dimensions of the stool are given in the photo.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Actuator: gas-powered&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: velvet&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of grey&lt;br&gt;Frame color: shades of gold&lt;br&gt;Gold elements are coated with lacquer. Mechanical damage to the coating is not subject to complaint.  &lt;/p&gt;</description>
