<item>
<sku>147832</sku>
<name>4Rico Cosmetic chair QS-185 white</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147832/EN_147832_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;4Rico&lt;/strong&gt; furniture combines functionality and comfort. The hockers and make-up chairs available in their offer are distinguished by a wide selection of patterns, colors and upholstery materials. They will be a sophisticated accent of any space – both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147832/EN_147832_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ergonomic chair with wooden legs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The stylish 4Rico QS-185 chair&lt;/strong&gt; on wooden legs is characterized by timeless elegance and minimalism. It will perfectly fit into both modern and more classic interiors, giving them a unique expression. The aesthetics of workmanship, ergonomically profiled backrest and comfort of use make the chair meet the requirements of even the most demanding users. It is distinguished by its versatile use – it is ideal for professional salons, beauty salon, nail styling, office or elegant reception, but it will also be perfect for home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147832/EN_147832_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable chair in a Scandinavian style&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The seat is filled with foam and covered with upholstery made of pleasant-to-the-touch synthetic leather in shades of white, which is very easy to keep clean. Small stains and dirt can be easily removed with a slightly dampened cloth. Aesthetic quilting and careful stitching provide an elegant touch, while the metal frame in shades of black adds stability to the furniture. Matte-finished legs are finished with plastic protections, additionally protecting against accidental damage. The chair in the Scandinavian style is a comfortable piece of furniture that will become a decoration of the reception area of any beauty salon.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147832/EN_147832_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/GewLwcNLHv8" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The exact dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;Included: seat, metal frame, 4 legs, assembly kit.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of white&lt;br&gt;Frame color: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Legs color: beech wood&lt;/p&gt;</description>
