<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147835/EN_147835_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;4Rico&lt;/strong&gt; furniture combines functionality and comfort. The hockers and make-up chairs available in their offer are distinguished by a wide selection of patterns, colors and upholstery materials. They will be a sophisticated accent of any space – both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147835/EN_147835_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stylish chair on wooden legs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Upholstered in a pleasant-to-the-touch material,&lt;strong&gt; the 4Rico QS-186 chair&lt;/strong&gt; on wooden legs is distinguished by its&lt;strong&gt; timeless elegance and interesting shape&lt;/strong&gt;. It will fit into any interior, it is &lt;strong&gt;extremely versatile&lt;/strong&gt; – it is ideal for professional parlours, including a beauty salon, nail styling, office or elegant reception. It is also perfect for everyday home use. &lt;strong&gt;The aesthetics of workmanship, ergonomically profiled backrest, geometric stitching and comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt; make the chair will meet the requirements of even the most demanding users.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147835/EN_147835_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable luxury chair&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The seat is upholstered with &lt;strong&gt;pleasant-to-the-touch velvet&lt;/strong&gt; in shades of gray. This gives it &lt;strong&gt;an exclusive look and ensures comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;. Careful stitching in geometric shapes is an &lt;strong&gt;elegant touch&lt;/strong&gt;, and the metal frame in shades of black connecting the legs adds stability to the furniture. &lt;strong&gt;The matte-finished wooden legs&lt;/strong&gt; are finished with plastic protections, additionally protecting against accidental damage. &lt;strong&gt;The chair in the Scandinavian style&lt;/strong&gt; is a comfortable piece of furniture that will become a decoration of the reception area of any beauty salon.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147835/EN_147835_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/mR6cC8M_32c" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The exact dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;Included: seat, metal frame, 4 legs, assembly kit.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: velvet&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of grey&lt;br&gt;Frame color: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Legs color: beech wood&lt;/p&gt;</description>
