<item>
<sku>147997</sku>
<name>EXO poddisk steel carrier 15 mm </name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EXO&lt;/strong&gt; is a brand that provides the highest quality products for the cosmetology and podiatry industry. It is distinguished by exceptional attention to the development of its offerings, with a view to satisfying customer needs. Professional equipment and accessories, including nail drills, will improve the comfort of treatments thanks to their high-quality workmanship.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simple way to improve the quality of pedicure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The professional &lt;strong&gt;Exo pododisk steel carrier&lt;/strong&gt; in the form of a 15 mm diameter disc is intended &lt;strong&gt;for nail drill pedicures&lt;/strong&gt; and significantly improves the performance of specialized services. &lt;strong&gt;Designed to fit most nail drill machines on the market&lt;/strong&gt;. It is perfect for &lt;strong&gt;treating the surface of the entire foot&lt;/strong&gt;, especially local calluses or rough skin of the toes. Due to the dimensions, it is &lt;strong&gt;suitable for work in hard-to-reach places&lt;/strong&gt; and will also prove useful for removing styling from the nail plate. Using disposable abrasive pads &lt;strong&gt;increases the safety and hygiene of the procedure&lt;/strong&gt;. The carrier is suitable for disinfection with appropriate preparations and&lt;strong&gt; sterilization in an autoclave&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Note.&lt;/STRONG&gt; Do not use in nail drill machines with an absorber and/or spray.&lt;/P&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;br&gt;Diameter: 15 mm&lt;br&gt;The length of the grip part: 25 mm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>3.25</price>
<category_subcategory>Podiatry&gt;Podiatry bits</category_subcategory>
