<item>
<sku>148455</sku>
<name>Tattoo Cartridge EL CARTEL V2 0.35 9RL Long Taper 10pcs.</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;EL CARTEL was established to provide high quality needles for most demanding tattoo artists. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;QUALITY MATTERS. Thanks to new technology , high quality materials and very strict quality control - EL CARTEL created next-gen tattoo cartridges .&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;SAFETY FIRST. For safety and hygienic reasons EL CARTEL uses elastic and durable membranes in cartridges to prevent any leakage from ink or blood to machine .&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;New shape of tube helps to store more ink leading to increased efficiency&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Thanks to high quality materials our needles guarantee smooth ink injection and remains sharp during long tattoo sessions.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;All cartridges are sterile with shelf life time up to 5 years. These cartridges work with any machine with cartridge grip.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
