<item>
<sku>147822</sku>
<name>Pro Ink 718 tattoo armrest, pink</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147822/EN_147822_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The PRO INK brand&lt;/strong&gt; responds to the specific needs of the tattoo industry. It offers professional equipment and accessories dedicated to tattoo parlours. The brand's assortment includes products such as tattoo chairs, assistants and supports that significantly facilitate the work.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147822/EN_147822_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Combination of comfort and functionality with style&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The comfortable &lt;strong&gt;Pro Ink 718 tattoo armrest&lt;/strong&gt; is an irreplaceable element of the equipment for every professional tattoo salon, where &lt;strong&gt;the customer's comfort&lt;/strong&gt; and high precision of the service performed are important issues. It facilitate the creation of works of art on your customers' bodies. The armrest combines both &lt;strong&gt;functionality and aesthetics&lt;/strong&gt;, providing not only exceptional, but also a stylish look.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147822/EN_147822_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptation to individual needs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The armrest is &lt;strong&gt;adjustable in height from 68-111 cm&lt;/strong&gt;, which allows it to be adapted to different clients and guarantees &lt;strong&gt;optimal support during the tattoo sessions&lt;/strong&gt;. Thanks to the tilt adjustment function, you can adjust the armrest's positioning to the individual needs of the client, which ensures &lt;strong&gt;even greater comfort&lt;/strong&gt; while tattooing.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147822/EN_147822_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Durability and stability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A solid black frame made of metal ensures&lt;strong&gt; the stability and durability&lt;/strong&gt; of the armrest, which is extremely important during a tattooist's work. Synthetic leather upholstery in shades of pink makes it easier to clean the equipment. &lt;strong&gt;Modern design&lt;/strong&gt; will make the interior of a tattoo parlour more attractive, emphasizing the unique character of the place. &lt;strong&gt;A combination of comfort, functionality and style&lt;/strong&gt; that will surely satisfy both professionals and tattoo parlour clients. The armrest significantly &lt;strong&gt;facilitates work&lt;/strong&gt;, but also helps to create a pleasant atmosphere in the living room and emphasizes its atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Color: shades of pink&lt;/p&gt;</description>
