<item>
<sku>147356</sku>
<name>100 pcs. Wooden manicure cuticle sticks 6,5 cm OCHO NAILS</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The OCHO NAILS&lt;/strong&gt; is a unique brand focusing on professional products for nail stylists. Its assortment includes hybrid nail polishes, nail gels, specialized lamps and nail care accessories. The OCHO NAILS products will meet the requirements of experienced users and those just beginning their adventure with manicures.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perfect nail care tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wooden sticks for manicure and pedicure treatments&lt;/strong&gt; are perfect for removing cuticles around nails. On one side, they are shaped in the form of a spatula, allowing for &lt;strong&gt;easy removal of cuticles&lt;/strong&gt;, while the other side is finished with a cone, which is perfect for &lt;strong&gt;precise cleaning of harder-to-reach areas&lt;/strong&gt;, such as the underside of the nail. &lt;strong&gt;The tips are gentle on cuticles and nails&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring precise action.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perfect manicure at your fingertips&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The sticks &lt;strong&gt;can be used during styling&lt;/strong&gt; to transfer nail decorations and correct minor mistakes when painting nails, such as removing nail polish from unwanted areas. Disposable sticks are &lt;strong&gt;not only practical, but also hygienic&lt;/strong&gt;. The appropriate hardness of the raw material makes them very durable.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The package contains &lt;strong&gt;100 pieces&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Length: 6,5 cm&lt;br&gt;Stick diameter: 4 mm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
