<item>
<sku>147804</sku>
<name>Tattoo armrest Pro Ink 720 black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147804/EN_147804_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;PRO INK&lt;/strong&gt; brand responds to the specific needs of the tattoo industry. It offers professional equipment and accessories dedicated to tattoo parlors. The brand's assortment includes products such as tattoo chairs, assistants and supports that significantly make work easier.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147804/EN_147804_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical and stylish armrest&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Ergonomic &lt;strong&gt;Pro Ink 720 tattoo armrest&lt;/strong&gt; is an inherent piece of equipment for every professional tattoo parlor, wherein an extremely important issue is the customer's convenience and high precision of the provided service. The armrest&lt;strong&gt; combines functionality with aesthetics&lt;/strong&gt;, providing not only exceptional comfort but stylish appearance. It will make it much easier to create works of art on your clients' bodies.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147804/EN_147804_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptation to individual needs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Height of armrest can be adjusted within limits &lt;strong&gt;72-110 cm&lt;/strong&gt;, which allows it to be adapted to different customers and &lt;strong&gt;guarantees optimal support&lt;/strong&gt; during the tattoo session. This model is equipped with a metal footrest that helps the person performing the tattoo &lt;strong&gt;take an ergonomic position&lt;/strong&gt;. The function of incline adjustment from side to side &lt;strong&gt;makes it easier to adjust the position of the armrest&lt;/strong&gt;, which provides even greater comfort while tattooing. An important function of this model is &lt;strong&gt;the option of independent height adjustment on both sides of armrests&lt;/strong&gt;, which ensures a special pink sliding element from below. Wide range of adjustment options &lt;strong&gt;significantly affects work ergonomics and customer comfort&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147804/EN_147804_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A stable and durable piece of equipment for a tattoo parlor&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The armrest makes the work of tattoo artist much easier but also helps to create a pleasant atmosphere in the living room. &lt;strong&gt;Modern design&lt;/strong&gt; will make interior design more attractive, emphasizing the unique character of the place. &lt;strong&gt;A solid frame&lt;/strong&gt; made of black metal ensures &lt;strong&gt;stability and durability&lt;/strong&gt; of the product, which is extremely important when working as a tattoo artist. Upholstery made of synthetic leather in shades of black significantly &lt;strong&gt;makes it easier to clean the equipment&lt;/strong&gt;. Deformation-resistant foam provides &lt;strong&gt;adequate support and durability&lt;/strong&gt; of the product. Pro Ink 720 armrest is &lt;strong&gt;an ergonomic combination of comfort, functionality and style&lt;/strong&gt; that is sure to please demanding users –both professionals and tattoo parlor clients.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147804/EN_147804_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Upholstery color: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Frame color: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Frame material: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>192.27</price>
<category_subcategory>Tattoo studio equipment&gt;Tattoo armrests</category_subcategory>
