<item>
<sku>148437</sku>
<name>Nghia export nail clipper NC.05</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA&lt;/strong&gt; offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools, which significantly improve the quality of everyday life of beauty industry customers. The brand's goal is to effectively meet consumer needs by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148437/EN_148437_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A handy tool&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The practical &lt;strong&gt;NGHIA Export NC.05 nail clipper&lt;/strong&gt; is a small, elegant tool that will work well in both a beauty salon and a home beautician. It is used &lt;strong&gt;to cut fingernails and toenails&lt;/strong&gt;, and thanks to the specially profiled blade, after cutting the nail obtains a perfectly smooth edge. Appropriate dimensions, ergonomic shape and profiled blades &lt;strong&gt;ensure precision of work&lt;/strong&gt; and make it much easier to reach harder-to-reach places.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive nail care&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The tool has &lt;strong&gt;an ergonomic shape&lt;/strong&gt;, which makes it fit perfectly in the hand, and thanks to properly designed joints, it works extremely smoothly. Using it, you can &lt;strong&gt;quickly and effectively shorten your nails and give them the right shape&lt;/strong&gt;. It is handy, easy to store and perfect for daily care.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148437/EN_148437_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Durability and functionality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The product is made of &lt;strong&gt;high-quality INOX stainless steel&lt;/strong&gt;, making it &lt;strong&gt;highly resistant to damage and blunting&lt;/strong&gt;. The product can be sterilized in an autoclave. The smooth, polished finish makes it &lt;strong&gt;easy to keep clean&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/yfKQbr4nEK0" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention.&lt;/strong&gt; Store in a dry and safe place. Keep away from children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade width: 12 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length: 77 mm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
