h, matte finish makes it &lt;strong&gt;easy to keep clean&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention.&lt;/strong&gt; Store in a dry and safe place. Keep away from children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade width: 13 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length: 79 mm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
