from becoming blunt&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention.&lt;/strong&gt; Store in a dry and safe place. Keep away from children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/F34w7oBW4t8" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade length: 19 mm&lt;br&gt;Handle hole diameter: 1,8-2,5 cm&lt;br&gt;Total length: 91 mm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
