<item>
<sku>148419</sku>
<name>Nghia export ingrown nail nippers NL.201 14MM</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA&lt;/strong&gt; offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools, which significantly improve the quality of everyday life of beauty industry customers. The brand's goal is to effectively meet consumer needs by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148419/EN_148419_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A precise tool for perfect nails&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Professional &lt;strong&gt;NGHIA Export NL.201 nail nippers&lt;/strong&gt; are made of high-quality INOX stainless steel, making them &lt;strong&gt;highly resistant to damage and blunting&lt;/strong&gt;. They are perfect for podiatry treatments and &lt;strong&gt;for shortening hard and thick nail plates&lt;/strong&gt;. The pincers are autoclavable and do not require re-sharpening after purchase.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148419/EN_148419_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solutions for high work comfort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The practical double spring&lt;/strong&gt; connecting the arms ensures excellent feel, stability and cutting precision. Careful workmanship allows &lt;strong&gt;for comfortable, quiet and smooth operation&lt;/strong&gt;. The way of shaping and the size of the arms make &lt;strong&gt;the nippers fit perfectly in the hand&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring comfort of use. The matte finish makes them look elegant, and the passivated surface &lt;strong&gt;increases their resistance and makes them easier to keep clean&lt;/strong&gt;. This makes them an ideal tool for both professionals and those who love taking care of their nails at home.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perfectly profiled blades&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Long 14 mm blades&lt;/strong&gt; are perfect for complex manicure treatments. &lt;strong&gt;The straight-cut profile&lt;/strong&gt; and appropriate size make it easier to perform treatments. The jaws of the tongs are connected using &lt;strong&gt;the Lap Joint method&lt;/strong&gt;, thanks to which they meet perfectly during use, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring precise cutting&lt;/strong&gt;. The tongs have a matching blade cover made of durable plastic.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148419/EN_148419_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance method:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;• After use, remove scurf, dust and nail remnants using acetone;&lt;br&gt;• Immerse the tool in disinfectant liquid;&lt;br&gt;• Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil;&lt;br&gt;• Put on a cover to protect the tool from chipping;&lt;br&gt;• Never put the nippers down with the blade pointing down;&lt;br&gt;• Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention.&lt;/strong&gt; Store in a dry and safe place. Keep away from children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade length: 14 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length of the nippers: 12 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: INOX stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>23.98</price>
