<item>
<sku>148425</sku>
<name>Nghia export cuticle nippers CL.205 12 (5 MM)</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA&lt;/strong&gt; offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools, which significantly improve the quality of everyday life of beauty industry customers. The brand's goal is to effectively meet consumer needs by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148425/EN_148425_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A precise tool for perfect cuticles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Professional &lt;strong&gt;NGHIA Export CL.205 cuticle nippers&lt;/strong&gt; are made of high-quality INOX stainless steel, making them &lt;strong&gt;highly resistant to damage and blunting&lt;/strong&gt;. They are perfect for manicure and pedicure,&lt;strong&gt; especially when cutting cuticles&lt;/strong&gt;. The clippers can be sterilized in an autoclave.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148425/EN_148425_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solutions for high work comfort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A double spring&lt;/strong&gt; connects the nipper arms, ensuring excellent feel and cutting precision. Careful workmanship allows&lt;strong&gt; for comfortable, quiet and smooth operation&lt;/strong&gt;. The way of shaping and the size of the arms make &lt;strong&gt;the nippers fit stably in the hand&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring full comfort of use. The matte finish makes them look elegant, and the passivated surface &lt;strong&gt;increases their resistance and makes them easier to keep clean&lt;/strong&gt;. This makes them an ideal tool for both professionals and nail care enthusiasts at home.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perfectly profiled blades&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precise 5 mm long blades&lt;/strong&gt; are perfect for complex manicure treatments. The characteristic cut profile and appropriate size make it &lt;strong&gt;easier to perform very precise treatments&lt;/strong&gt;. The jaws of the tongs are connected using &lt;strong&gt;the Lap Joint method&lt;/strong&gt;, thanks to which they meet perfectly during use, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring accurate cutting&lt;/strong&gt;. The tongs have a matching blade cover made of durable plastic.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148425/EN_148425_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance method:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;• After use, remove scurf, dust and nail remnants using acetone;&lt;br&gt;• Immerse the tool in disinfectant liquid;&lt;br&gt;• Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil;&lt;br&gt;• Put on a cover to protect the tool from chipping;&lt;br&gt;• Never put the nippers down with the blade down;&lt;br&gt;• Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention.&lt;/strong&gt; Store in a dry and safe place. Keep away from children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade length: 5 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length of the clippers: 10,5 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: INOX stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
