re treatments. &lt;strong&gt;The characteristic cut profile&lt;/strong&gt; and appropriate size make it easier to perform very precise treatments. The jaws of the tongs are connected using &lt;strong&gt;the Lap Joint method&lt;/strong&gt;, thanks to which they meet perfectly during use,&lt;strong&gt; ensuring accurate cutting&lt;/strong&gt;. The tongs have a matching blade cover made of durable plastic.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148426/EN_148426_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance method:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;• After use, remove scurf, dust and nail remnants using acetone;&lt;br&gt;• Immerse the tool in disinfectant liquid;&lt;br&gt;• Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil;&lt;br&gt;• Put on a cover to protect the tool from chipping;&lt;br&gt;• Never put the nippers down with the blade down;&lt;br&gt;• Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention.&lt;/strong&gt; Store in a dry and safe place. Keep away from children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade length: 5 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length of the nippers: 10,5 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: INOX stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
