<item>
<sku>148154</sku>
<name>4Rico Chair QS-OF213G black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148154/EN_148154_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4Rico&lt;/strong&gt; furniture combines functionality and comfort. The stools and makeup chairs available in their offer are distinguished by a wide selection of patterns, colors and upholstery materials. They will be a refined accent to any space – both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148154/EN_148154_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A stylish, functional chair&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The elegant &lt;strong&gt;QS-OF213G chair&lt;/strong&gt; upholstered in a pleasant-to-touch material will fit into any interior. It is extremely versatile – &lt;strong&gt;ideal for professional salons&lt;/strong&gt;, including a beauty salon, nail salon, office or elegant reception. It is also perfect for everyday home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148154/EN_148154_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Considerable adjustment possibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Equipped with&lt;strong&gt; an efficient gas lift&lt;/strong&gt;, the chair guarantees safety of use and allows for easy and smooth adjustment of the seat height &lt;strong&gt;within 43-58 cm&lt;/strong&gt;. This allows you to adjust the furniture to your individual needs and services, ensuring &lt;strong&gt;high comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt; - both when applying makeup, eyebrow styling, and during other activities. The full rotation mechanism &lt;strong&gt;improves work efficiency and comfort&lt;/strong&gt;. The armrests are at the right height, allowing for proper shoulder positioning.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148154/EN_148154_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elegant design for comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pleasant to the touch, velvet upholstery&lt;/strong&gt; in shades of black gives the furniture a unique character. The finish makes the furniture eye-catching. The frame in shades of gold adds elegance, perfectly matching the velvet. &lt;strong&gt;Functional wheels&lt;/strong&gt; ensure mobility, making it easier to move the chair and move around the salon while working. &lt;strong&gt;Aesthetics of workmanship, comfort of use, decorative quilting and ergonomically profiled backrest&lt;/strong&gt; make the chair meet the requirements of even the most demanding users.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148154/EN_148154_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Product dimensions are shown in the photo.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Actuator: gas&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: velvet&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Frame color: shades of gold&lt;br&gt;Gold elements are coated with lacquer. Mechanical damage to the coating is not subject to complaint.  &lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Cx6BruGKFaI" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;</description>
<price>99.59</price>
<category_subcategory>4Rico Furniture</category_subcategory>
<qty>194</qty>
<weight>10.3000</weight>
<brand>4RICO</brand>
<tax>23%</tax>
