g&gt;Pleasant to the touch, velvet upholstery&lt;/strong&gt; in shades of navy blue gives the furniture a unique character. The finish makes the furniture eye-catching. The frame in shades of gold adds elegance, perfectly matching the velvet. &lt;strong&gt;Functional wheels&lt;/strong&gt; ensure mobility, making it easier to move the chair and move around the salon while working. &lt;strong&gt;Aesthetics of workmanship, comfort of use, decorative quilting and ergonomically profiled backrest&lt;/strong&gt; make the chair meet the requirements of even the most demanding users.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148156/EN_148156_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Product dimensions are shown in the photo.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Actuator: gas&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: velvet&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of navy blue&lt;br&gt;Frame color: shades of gold&lt;br&gt;Gold elements are coated with lacquer. Mechanical damage to the coating is not subject to complaint.  &lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Cx6BruGKFaI" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;</description>
