<item>
<sku>149587</sku>
<name>Podoland PodoBaby skin and nail regeneration for children and adults 50ml</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PodoBaby - Regeneration of skin and nails for children and adults&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Composition:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Chamomile water - Gently cleanses, tones and soothes irritated skin and damaged nails. Supports the natural regeneration process. Moisturizes, softens and restores the beautiful appearance of the skin and nails.&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Avocado oil - Moisturizes, protects against damage, alleviates irritations, restores the elasticity of the skin and nails. It soothes itching and provides a sense of comfort.&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Collagen - Moisturizes, regenerates, and accelerates the growth of the nail plate. It protects, rebuilds and restores the natural color of the skin and nails. Provides a silky appearance and reduces cracks.&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Panthenol - Moisturizes and reduces roughness. It protects against irritation and smoothes damaged skin and nails.&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;/ul&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Method of use:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The product is in a specialized package ensuring convenient application directly on the skin and nails. Apply in the morning and evening, preferably on moist skin. &lt;br&gt;The preparation is designed for external use only.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;It can be used for children from 1 month of life.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The product is manufactured under certified Production and Quality Control conditions in accordance with ISO 22716. Dermatologically tested. Store at room temperature, away from heat and light sources.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients:&lt;/strong&gt; R. Chamomile Flower Water Organic, Glycerin, Pentylene Glycol, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Aqua, Panthenol, Sodium Acrylates Copolymer, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Lecithin, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Gluconolactone, Phenethyl Alcohol, Caprylyl Glycol, Calcium Gluconate, Parfum&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Producer:&lt;/strong&gt; Podoland&lt;/p&gt;</description>
