<item>
<sku>149589</sku>
<name>Podoland preparation PodoSerum skin and nail restoration 15ml</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PodoSerum - reconstruction of the skin and nails&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Regenerating and repairing nail serum PodoSerum was created by the best podiatrists with many years of experience in care and prevention in the area of feet health. Thanks to a well-thought-out and properly composed formula, the product supports the reconstruction of the nail plate and epidermis, and also has a positive effect on their condition and aesthetics. In addition, the tea tree oil contained in it has antibacterial properties.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PodoSerum:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;increases the flexibility of the nail plate and its resistance to damage&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;moisturizes and strengthens the epidermis of the periungual folds&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;by nourishing the matrix, it supports the reconstruction and regeneration of nails&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;improves the natural ability of the epidermis to self-regenerate&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;reduces discolorations and prevents their formation&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;/ul&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Active ingredients:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Collagen - prevents brittleness, helps to nourish the nail bed and promotes its growth&lt;br&gt;Mexican aloe vera juice - contains vitamin B12, magnesium, proteins and fatty acids - compounds necessary for healthy nail growth&lt;br&gt;Biotin - improves hydration of the nail bed, makes the nail plate more flexible and prevents its fragility&lt;br&gt;Tea tree essential oil - rich in antioxidants and terpenes, reduces nail discoloration and brittleness and has antibacterial properties&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to use:&lt;/strong&gt; Using the applicator at the end of the bottle, gently apply one or two drops of serum to the cleansed and dried skin at the nail matrix and under the nail plate, gently tapping. Use it twice a day.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Store at room temperature, away from sources of heat and light. Do not use in case of hypersensitivity to any ingredient.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The product is manufactured in certified production and quality control conditions in accordance with ISO 22716.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Producent:&lt;/strong&gt; Podoland&lt;/p&gt;</description>
