<item>
<sku>149590</sku>
<name>Podoland preparation PodoSoft softening liquid for skin and nails 200ml</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PodoSoft - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;emollient lotion for skin and nails&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Softens. Cleansing. Moisturizes. Protects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Each treatment is a series of effective steps on a path to achieve success. Although we are used to seeing them primarily through the prism of the quality of the final result, they are no less important individually. Start your work by preparing patients skin and nails with the help of the highest quality ingredients contained in the simple and effective PodoSoft formula.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PodoSoft:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;ul class="ul1"&gt;  &lt;li class="li1"&gt;natural composition doesn’t irritate the skin&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li class="li1"&gt;creates fluffy and abundant foam&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li class="li1"&gt;softens the epidermis without making it too loose&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li class="li1"&gt;gently cleanses the surface of the skin and nails&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li class="li1"&gt;supports cells regeneration and hydration&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li class="li1"&gt;creates a protective layer that prevents damage caused by friction&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;/ul&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to use:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Thoroughly clean feet and nails. Next spray the selected place with a product from a distance of about 15-20 centimeters. Let the created foam work by leaving it in place for about 30 seconds and then start the procedure.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The product can be used multiple times during one treatment.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Store at room temperature, away from sources of heat and light.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Do not use in case of hypersensitivity to any ingredient.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The product is manufactured in certified production and quality control conditions in accordance with ISO 22716 regulation.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The product is intended for professional use only. It facilitates the cleaning of problematic nails and speeds up the podiatry, pedicures and medicures treatments.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Active ingredients:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Peruvian Taro plant seeds - softens and moisturizes&lt;br&gt;Tea tree oil - show the antibacterial properties, refreshes and protects&lt;br&gt;Provitamin B5 - regenerates, nourishes and strengthens the natural barrier of the skin&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients:&lt;/strong&gt; Aqua, Glycerin, Caprylyl/Capryl Glucoside, Panthenol, Melaleuca Alternifolia, Leaf Oil, Hydrolyzed Caesalpinia Spinosa Gum, Caesalpinia Spinosa Gum, Lactid Acid,Decyl Alcohol, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Limonene, Linalool&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class="p1"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Producer:&lt;/strong&gt; Podoland&lt;/p&gt;</description>
