<item>
<sku>149591</sku>
<name>Podoland preparation PodoSoft softening liquid for cuticles and nails 200ml  </name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PodoSpirant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;sweat protection&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;50ml&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support and refreshment for your feet&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Most products designed to reduce sweating of the feet force us to choose between their pleasant, sweat-free fragrance and not feeling the often painful dryness of the skin. For this reason, we have started work on a cosmetic that does not put the patient in such a dilemma - PodoSpirant not only blocks sweat secretion and eliminates the bacteria responsible for its smell, but also contains ingredients, including herbal extracts, that protect the skin against roughness, damage and dryness.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PodoSpirant:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;ul class="ul1"&gt;  &lt;li class="li1"&gt;eliminates microorganisms responsible for the unpleasant smell of sweat&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li class="li1"&gt;has astringent and antibacterial properties&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li class="li1"&gt;tones, softens and nourishes the skin&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li class="li1"&gt;supports the regeneration of the natural barrier of the epidermis&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;/ul&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to use:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;In the evening, wash your feet and dry them carefully, paying particular attention to the spaces between the toes. Apply and massage or leave to absorb on its own. Use for 7 days and then 2-3 times a week. Store at room temperature, away from sources of heat and light. Do not use in case of hypersensitivity to any ingredient.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Store at room temperature, away from sources of heat and light.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Do not use in case of hypersensitivity to any ingredient.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The product is manufactured in certified production and quality control conditions in accordance with ISO 22716.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The product has been dermatologically tested on a sensitive panel, it does not show irritating and sensitizing effects in contact with sensitive skin.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Active ingredients:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gallic rose&lt;/strong&gt; - has a strong astringent, antioxidant and antibacterial effect, reduces the proliferation of bacteria&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Common sage&lt;/strong&gt; - helps to control the activity of the sweat glands&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provitamin B5&lt;/strong&gt; - regenerates and nourishes the skin, strengthens its natural barrier&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aloe vera juice&lt;/strong&gt; - revitalizes and softens the epidermis&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collagen&lt;/strong&gt; - supports skin reconstruction and its flexibility&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FEET&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HANDS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients:&lt;/strong&gt; Aqua, Alkohol Denat., PEG 40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Triethyl Citrate, Glycerin, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Panthenol, Parfum, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Salvia Officinalis (Sage) Oil, Rosa Gallica Flower Extract, Rosa Damascena Flower Oil, Curcuma Longa Root Extract, Sodium Caproyl/Lauroyl Lactylate, Triethyl Citrate, Lactic Acid, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Citric Acid, Gluconolactone, Phenethyl Alcohol, Caprylyl Glycol, Calcium Gluconate, Sorbic Acid, Citronellol, Geraniol, Limonene&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Producer:&lt;/strong&gt; Podoland&lt;/p&gt;</description>
