<item>
<sku>149624</sku>
<name>Podoland Mani &amp; Podo set by Daniel Abratkiewicz </name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;"Not everything can be painted over" - Nail Cleaning Drill Bit Set by Daniel Abratkiewicz.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;If you've ever wondered which specific drill bit to use when a client came in with a diseased nail, you won't have to worry anymore! Assuming we know exactly how to help the client and we decide to tackle the problem, this set, designed with you, Nail Technicians and Podiatrists, in mind, will help you handle all kinds of challenges. Here, everything is laid out for you!&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does the set include?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovative 4-in-1 Drill Bit&lt;/strong&gt;, stainless steel, cuts, diamond coating, red and blue band, size 5mm.   &lt;br&gt;Usage: processing reconstruction, shortening nails, treating diseased areas, working on cuticles.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diamond Drill Bit in a Narrow Cone Shape&lt;/strong&gt;, stainless steel, diamond coating, black protective nanopowder, rounded tip, blue band, size 1,2mm.   &lt;br&gt;Usage: treating and cleaning nail grooves, cleaning spaces and calluses under the nail plate, smoothing the edges of the nail plate.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diamond Drill Bit in a Needle/Spike Shape&lt;/strong&gt;, made of stainless steel with diamond coating. Covered with a black protective nanopowder, marked with a blue band. Its size is 1,8mm.  &lt;br&gt;Usage: precise cleaning of the nail plate in the proximal (matrix) area, cleaning nail grooves.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ball-Shaped Carbide Drill Bit&lt;/strong&gt; with black protective nanopowder coating. It has sharp cuts, marked with a blue band. The drill bit is 1,2mm in size.   &lt;br&gt;Usage: precise cleaning of hard-to-reach areas of the nail plate with diseased spots, evacuation of secretion trapped under the nail plate.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diamond Drill Bit in a Ball Shape&lt;/strong&gt;, made of stainless steel with diamond coating. Additionally, it has a black protective nanopowder coating. Marked with a blue band. Its size is 1,8mm.   &lt;br&gt;Usage: cleaning nail grooves and hard-to-reach areas of the nail plate with diseased spots.&lt;/p&gt;  </description>
