<item>
<sku>149625</sku>
<name>Podoland cutter by a well-known Podiatrist</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Is there a perfect cutter for special tasks, which can simultaneously handle extreme cases of disease-affected nails, development of reconstructions, safe shortening of nails and removal of old nail design? There it is - a proprietary cutter by a well-known Podiatrist 4-in-1! Protected by a special DLC coating "Diamond Like Carbon", which is extremely hard, resistant to wear and corrosion, which is importantly great for high speed operation. The innovative design of the cutter allows perfect development of the restoration. Noteworthy is the martensitic stainless steel, which was additionally hardened during production, making the cutter extremely durable and hard, and this determines its exceptional resistance to wear.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;The front part of the cutter was created from diamond embossing, and this further emphasizes its innovation. This unusual procedure allows you to easily, quickly and safely shorten the &lt;br /&gt;nails without having to replace the cutter with another one. &lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;Fine, cross-cutting incisions analogous to a ceramic cutter, allow to quickly work out hard material such as, acrylic, gel or dental composite. Its rounded shape gives you the ability to reach hard-to-reach areas of the nail plate, and its exceptional durability will allow you to remove fragments too hard for other cutters.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
