<item>
<sku>149631</sku>
<name>Podoland Innovative cutters by Daniel Abratkiewicz (finir + well-known podiatrist)</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Finir Podiatry Cutter by Famous Podiatrist and Fresco by Famous Podiatrist.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The Finir Podological Cutter by Famous Podiatrist with fine spiral incisions, and a special angle of the incisions allows you to remove both podiatric composites. The appropriate density of the incisions allows for even and effective work in the podiatric material. The tool is made entirely of tungsten carbide to ensure safe and controlled work. In addition, the sharpness and depth of the incisions allow quick and precise work on the surface of both the material and lesions in the nail plate. The cutter has been protected with a special DLC coating "Diamond Like Carbon", which is extremely hard, resistant to wear and corrosion, importantly great for high speed operation.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Famous Nail Cutter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Is there a perfect cutter for special tasks, which can simultaneously handle extreme cases of lesioned nails, development of reconstructions, safe shortening of nails and removal of old nail design? There it is - a proprietary cutter by a well-known Podiatrist 4-in-1! Protected by a special DLC coating "Diamond Like Carbon", which is extremely hard, resistant to wear and corrosion, which is importantly great for high speed operation. The innovative design of the cutter allows perfect development of the restoration. Noteworthy is the martensitic stainless steel, which was additionally hardened during production, making the cutter extremely durable and hard, and this determines its exceptional resistance to wear.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The front part of the cutter was created from diamond embossing, and this further emphasizes its innovation. This unusual procedure allows you to shorten your nails easily, quickly and safely without having to replace the cutter with another one.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Fine, cross-cutting incisions analogous to a ceramic cutter, allow to quickly work out hard material such as, acrylic, gel or dental composite. Its rounded shape gives you the ability to reach hard-to-reach areas of the nail plate, and its exceptional durability will allow you to remove fragments too hard for other cutters.&lt;/p&gt;  </description>
<price>33.94</price>
