<description>&lt;p&gt;Used during podiatric procedures to hold a scalpel blade. It consists of a corrugated handle and a handle for holding the blade. The tool has slightly rounded and unsharpened edges so that working with it does not tire the hand. The scalpel holder is used in both podiatry and medicine. Product features: length 123 mm, profiled handle fits blades No. 10, 11, 12, 12D, 13, 14, 15, 15C, 16, 17 slightly rounded and unsharpened edges of the handle made of high quality stainless steel. Ergonomic shape of the tool, simple design, provides quick replacement of blades. Subject to repeated disinfection and sterilization in autoclave at 134&amp;deg;C.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
