<item>
<sku>148116</sku>
<name>4Rico chair QS-GW06G navy blue</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148116/EN_148116_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;4Rico &lt;/strong&gt;furniture combines functionality and comfort. The hockers and make-up chairs available in their offer are distinguished by a wide selection of patterns, colors and upholstery materials. They will be a sophisticated accent of any space – both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148116/EN_148116_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elegant chair for your salon&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Upholstered in a pleasant-to-the-touch material,&lt;strong&gt; the 4Rico QS-GW06G chair&lt;/strong&gt; is a combination of high quality, comfort and functionality that impresses with its luxurious design.&lt;strong&gt; The piece of furniture with intriguing braiding on the backrest&lt;/strong&gt; and polished elements in shades of gold stands out for its &lt;strong&gt;exceptional elegance&lt;/strong&gt;. It will be perfect for professional offices as well as for home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148116/EN_148116_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilities for comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A properly profiled, rounded backrest provides &lt;strong&gt;excellent back support&lt;/strong&gt;, and armrests of appropriate height allow for proper positioning of the arms. These solutions translate into comfort of use and &lt;strong&gt;make it easier to take an ergonomic position, thus reducing muscle tension&lt;/strong&gt;. Metal legs in shades of gold are finished with plastic protection that &lt;strong&gt;protects against accidental damage&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148116/EN_148116_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable, luxurious chair&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The pleasant-to-the-touch material, velvet upholstery&lt;/strong&gt; in shades of navy blue gives the chair a unique character, and the aesthetically interwoven fabric on the backrest emphasizes &lt;strong&gt;the unique appearance of the furniture&lt;/strong&gt;. This gives it an exclusive look and ensures comfort of use. The frame in shades of gold adds &lt;strong&gt;elegance and prestige&lt;/strong&gt;, perfectly matching the velvet. The elegant 4Rico chair is &lt;strong&gt;an exceptionally comfortable piece of furniture&lt;/strong&gt; that will decorate the reception area of any beauty salon.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The exact dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes: &lt;/strong&gt;seat, metal frame, assembly kit.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: velvet&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of navy blue&lt;br&gt;Color of the frame: shades of gold&lt;br&gt;Gold elements are coated with lacquer. Mechanical damage to the coating is not subject to complaint.  &lt;/p&gt;</description>
