ong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148121/EN_148121_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elegant design for comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The finish makes the furniture eye-catching&lt;/strong&gt;. The pleasant-to-the-touch, velvet upholstery in shades of navy blue gives it a unique character. The base in shades of gold adds elegance, perfectly matching the velvet. &lt;strong&gt;Functional wheels provide mobility&lt;/strong&gt;, making it easier to move the chair and move around the salon while working. Careful workmanship, comfort of use and aesthetically interwoven material on the profiled backrest make the chair &lt;strong&gt;will meet the requirements of even the most demanding users&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148121/EN_148121_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The exact dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes:&lt;/strong&gt; seat, base with actuator, assembly kit.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: velvet&lt;br&gt;Actuator: gas lift&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of navy blue&lt;br&gt;Base color: shades of gold&lt;br&gt;Gold elements are coated with lacquer. Mechanical damage to the coating is not subject to complaint.  &lt;/p&gt;</description>
