<name>4Rico swivel chair QS-OF212G gray</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148134/EN_148134_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;4Rico &lt;/strong&gt;furniture combines functionality and comfort. The hockers and make-up chairs available in their offer are distinguished by a wide selection of patterns, colors and upholstery materials. They will be a sophisticated accent of any space – both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148134/EN_148134_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stylish, functional chair&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The elegant &lt;strong&gt;4Rico QS-OF212G chair&lt;/strong&gt;, upholstered in a pleasant-to-touch material with aesthetic stitching and polished elements in shades of gold, will fit perfectly into any interior. The furniture stands out for its &lt;strong&gt;timeless elegance&lt;/strong&gt; and is extremely versatile – &lt;strong&gt;it is perfect for professional salons&lt;/strong&gt;, including a beauty salon, nail salon, office or elegant reception, as well as for home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148134/EN_148134_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant adjustment possibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The chair is equipped with &lt;strong&gt;a full rotation mechanism&lt;/strong&gt;, which improves work efficiency and comfort. &lt;strong&gt;The efficient gas lift&lt;/strong&gt; allows for easy and smooth adjustment of the seat height &lt;strong&gt;within 43-54 cm&lt;/strong&gt;. This makes it possible to adjust the chair to individual needs and the services performed, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring high comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt; – whether during makeup, eyebrow styling or other activities. &lt;strong&gt;Appropriately profiled backrest&lt;/strong&gt; ensures seating comfort, back support and facilitates &lt;strong&gt;correct shoulder positioning&lt;/strong&gt;. The opening located between the backrest and the seat &lt;strong&gt;makes it easier to keep the salon clean&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148134/EN_148134_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elegant design for comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Careful finishing&lt;/strong&gt; makes the furniture eye-catching. The pleasant-to-the-touch, velvet upholstery in shades of gray gives it &lt;strong&gt;a unique character&lt;/strong&gt;. The base in shades of gold adds elegance, perfectly matching the velvet, and &lt;strong&gt;the functional wheels ensure mobility&lt;/strong&gt;, making it easier to move the chair around the salon while working. Aesthetics of workmanship, comfort of use, &lt;strong&gt;decorative stitching&lt;/strong&gt; and ergonomically profiled backrest make the chair &lt;strong&gt;meet the requirements of even the most demanding users&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148134/EN_148134_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The exact dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes: &lt;/strong&gt;seat, base with actuator, assembly kit.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: velvet&lt;br&gt;Actuator: gas lift&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of gray&lt;br&gt;Base color: shades of gold&lt;br&gt;Gold elements are coated with lacquer. Mechanical damage to the coating is not subject to complaint.  &lt;/p&gt;</description>
