<item>
<sku>148140</sku>
<name>4Rico swivel chair QS-MF18G black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148140/EN_148140_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;4Rico &lt;/strong&gt;furniture combines functionality and comfort. The hockers and make-up chairs available in their offer are distinguished by a wide selection of patterns, colors and upholstery materials. They will be a sophisticated accent of any space – both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148140/EN_148140_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elegant, comfortable chair&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The stylish &lt;strong&gt;4Rico QS-MF18G chair&lt;/strong&gt;, upholstered in a pleasant-to-the-touch material with a polished base in shades of gold, &lt;strong&gt;will fit perfectly into any interior&lt;/strong&gt;. The furniture stands out for its timeless elegance and is extremely versatile – it is perfect for professional salons, including a beauty salon, nail salon, office or elegant reception area, as well as for home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148140/EN_148140_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant adjustment possibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The efficient gas&lt;/strong&gt; lift allows for easy adjustment of the seat height &lt;strong&gt;within 47-59 cm&lt;/strong&gt;. This allows the chair to be adjusted to individual needs and the services performed, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring high comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt; – both when applying makeup, eyebrow styling, and during other activities. The chair is equipped with &lt;strong&gt;a full rotation mechanism&lt;/strong&gt;, which improves work efficiency and comfort. &lt;strong&gt;The profiled backrest &lt;/strong&gt;provides adequate back support, and the cushion mounted on the seat with Velcro increases the comfort of use. The opening between the backrest and the seat &lt;strong&gt;makes it easier to keep the salon clean&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148140/EN_148140_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimalist design for comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The simple finish&lt;/strong&gt; makes the furniture eye-catching. The pleasant-to-the-touch, velvet upholstery in shades of black gives it &lt;strong&gt;a unique character&lt;/strong&gt;. The base in shades of gold adds elegance, perfectly matching the velvet, and&lt;strong&gt; the functional wheels ensure mobility&lt;/strong&gt;, making it easier to move the chair around the salon while working. Aesthetics of workmanship, comfort of use and ergonomically profiled backrest make the chair &lt;strong&gt;meet the requirements of even the most demanding users&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148140/EN_148140_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The exact dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes:&lt;/strong&gt; seat, base with actuator, assembly kit.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: velvet&lt;br&gt;Actuator: gas lift&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Base color: shades of gold&lt;br&gt;Gold elements are coated with lacquer. Mechanical damage to the coating is not subject to complaint.  &lt;/p&gt;</description>
