<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148152/EN_148152_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;4Rico &lt;/strong&gt;furniture combines functionality and comfort. The hockers and make-up chairs available in their offer are distinguished by a wide selection of patterns, colors and upholstery materials. They will be a sophisticated accent of any space – both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148152/EN_148152_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aesthetic chair with a unique design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Upholstered in a pleasant-to-the-touch material, &lt;strong&gt;the elegant 4Rico QS-BL14G chair&lt;/strong&gt; with decorative quilting and an interestingly profiled backrest &lt;strong&gt;stands out for its timeless elegance&lt;/strong&gt;. The versatile piece of furniture is perfect for specialist salons, beauty and nail salons, offices or elegant reception areas. &lt;strong&gt;It will also be perfect for home use&lt;/strong&gt;, giving the interior a refined character.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148152/EN_148152_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant adjustment possibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The chair is equipped with &lt;strong&gt;a full rotation mechanism&lt;/strong&gt;, which significantly affects the ergonomics of work. &lt;strong&gt;The efficient gas lift&lt;/strong&gt; allows for easy adjustment of the seat height &lt;strong&gt;between 39-50 cm&lt;/strong&gt;. This makes it possible to adjust the chair to individual needs and the services performed, thus &lt;strong&gt;increasing the work efficiency&lt;/strong&gt; – regardless of the activities performed. The contoured backrest &lt;strong&gt;provides adequate back support&lt;/strong&gt;, which guarantees high comfort of use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://active