<sku>148153</sku>
<name>4Rico swivel chair QS-BL14G green</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148153/EN_148153_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;4Rico &lt;/strong&gt;furniture combines functionality and comfort. The hockers and make-up chairs available in their offer are distinguished by a wide selection of patterns, colors and upholstery materials. They will be a sophisticated accent of any space – both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148153/EN_148153_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aesthetic chair with a unique design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Upholstered in a pleasant-to-the-touch material, &lt;strong&gt;the elegant 4Rico QS-BL14G chair&lt;/strong&gt; with decorative quilting and an interestingly profiled backrest &lt;strong&gt;stands out for its timeless elegance&lt;/strong&gt;. The versatile piece of furniture is perfect for specialist salons, beauty and nail salons, offices or elegant reception areas. &lt;strong&gt;It will also be perfect for home use&lt;/strong&gt;, giving the interior a refined character.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148153/EN_148153_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant adjustment possibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The chair is equipped with &lt;strong&gt;a full rotation mechanism&lt;/strong&gt;, which significantly affects the ergonomics of work. &lt;strong&gt;The efficient gas lift&lt;/strong&gt; allows for easy adjustment of the seat height &lt;strong&gt;between 39-50 cm&lt;/strong&gt;. This makes it possible to adjust the chair to individual needs and the services performed, thus &lt;strong&gt;increasing the work efficiency&lt;/strong&gt; – regardless of the activities performed. The contoured backrest &lt;strong&gt;provides adequate back support&lt;/strong&gt;, which guarantees high comfort of use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148153/EN_148153_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elegance and comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The interesting design gives the chair&lt;strong&gt; a unique character&lt;/strong&gt;. The pleasant-to-the-touch, velvet upholstery in shades of green and &lt;strong&gt;decorative quilting&lt;/strong&gt; make it a decoration of any interior. &lt;strong&gt;A stable, round base&lt;/strong&gt; in shades of gold adds elegance, perfectly matching the velvet. &lt;strong&gt;Aesthetics of workmanship&lt;/strong&gt;, comfortably placed armrests, ergonomically profiled backrest and aesthetic quilting make the chair &lt;strong&gt;meet the requirements of even the most demanding users&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148153/EN_148153_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The exact dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes:&lt;/strong&gt; seat, base with actuator, assembly kit.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: velvet&lt;br&gt;Actuator: gas lift&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of green&lt;br&gt;Base color: shades of gold&lt;br&gt;Gold elements are coated with lacquer. Mechanical damage to the coating is not subject to complaint.  &lt;/p&gt;</description>
