<item>
<sku>148424</sku>
<name>Nghia export ingrown nail nippers NL.205 14MM</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148424/EN_148424_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA &lt;/strong&gt;offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools, which significantly improve the quality of everyday life of beauty industry customers. The brand's goal is to effectively meet consumer needs by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precision nail tool&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Professional &lt;strong&gt;NGHIA Export NL.205 nippers for ingrown nails&lt;/strong&gt; are made of high-quality stainless steel, making them&lt;strong&gt; highly resistant to damage and dulling&lt;/strong&gt;. They are perfect especially &lt;strong&gt;for podiatry treatments&lt;/strong&gt; and for shortening hard and thick nail plates. The nippers are &lt;strong&gt;suitable for autoclave sterilization&lt;/strong&gt; and do not require re-sharpening after purchase.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148424/EN_148424_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solutions for high work comfort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The way of profiling and size of the arms make the nippers &lt;strong&gt;fit perfectly in the hand&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring comfort of use. The practical &lt;strong&gt;double spring &lt;/strong&gt;connecting the arms provides excellent feel, stability and cutting precision. Careful workmanship allows &lt;strong&gt;for comfortable, quiet and smooth operation&lt;/strong&gt;. The matte finish makes them look elegant, and the passivated surface&lt;strong&gt; increases their resistance and makes them easier to keep clean&lt;/strong&gt;. This makes them an ideal tool for both professionals and those who love taking care of their nails at home.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perfectly profiled blades&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Long, massive 16 mm blades&lt;/strong&gt; are perfect for complex manicure and pedicure services. &lt;strong&gt;The straight profile&lt;/strong&gt; and appropriate size make it easier to perform treatments. The jaws of the nippers are connected using &lt;strong&gt;the Lap Joint method&lt;/strong&gt;, so that they meet perfectly during use,&lt;strong&gt; ensuring cutting precision&lt;/strong&gt;. The nippers have a matching blade cover made of durable plastic.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148424/EN_148424_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance method:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;• After use, remove scurf, dust and nail remnants using acetone;&lt;br&gt;• Immerse the tool in disinfectant liquid;&lt;br&gt;• Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil;&lt;br&gt;• Put on a cover to protect the tool from chipping;&lt;br&gt;• Never put the tongs down with the blade pointing down;&lt;br&gt;• Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention.&lt;/strong&gt; Store in a dry and safe place. Keep away from children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ERvE0d6ePoA" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade length: 14 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length of the clamps: 12 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>23.98</price>
