<name>Nghia export cuticle nippers CL.206 12 ( 5MM )</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148427/EN_148427_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA &lt;/strong&gt;offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools, which significantly improve the quality of everyday life of beauty industry customers. The brand's goal is to effectively meet consumer needs by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precise tool for perfect cuticles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Professional &lt;strong&gt;NGHIA Export CL.206 cuticle nippers&lt;/strong&gt; are made of high-quality stainless steel, making them&lt;strong&gt; highly resistant to damage and dulling&lt;/strong&gt;. They are perfect especially for manicures and pedicures, and&lt;strong&gt; when cutting cuticles&lt;/strong&gt;. The nippers are suitable for autoclave sterilization and do not require re-sharpening after purchase.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148427/EN_148427_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solutions for high working comfort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The practical &lt;strong&gt;double spring&lt;/strong&gt; connecting the arms ensures excellent feel, stability and cutting precision. Its careful workmanship allows&lt;strong&gt; for comfortable, quiet and smooth operation&lt;/strong&gt;. The way of shaping and the size of the arms make the nippers &lt;strong&gt;fit perfectly in the hand&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring comfort of use. The matte finish makes them look elegant, and the passivated surface&lt;strong&gt; increases their resistance and makes them easier to keep clean&lt;/strong&gt;. This makes them an ideal tool for both professionals and those who love taking care of their nails at home.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perfectly profiled blades&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precise 5 mm long blades&lt;/strong&gt; are perfect for complex manicure treatments. &lt;strong&gt;The characteristic blade profile&lt;/strong&gt; and appropriate size make it easier to perform treatments. The jaws of the nippers are connected using&lt;strong&gt; the Lap Joint method&lt;/strong&gt;, thanks to which they meet perfectly during use, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring cutting precision&lt;/strong&gt;. The nippers have a matching blade cover made of durable plastic.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148427/EN_148427_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance method:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;• After use, remove scurf, dust and nail remnants using acetone;&lt;br&gt;• Immerse the tool in disinfectant liquid;&lt;br&gt;• Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil;&lt;br&gt;• Put on a cover to protect the tool from chipping;&lt;br&gt;• Never put the tongs down with the blade pointing down;&lt;br&gt;• Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention.&lt;/strong&gt; Store in a dry and safe place. Keep away from children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/pQXDZfePGtM" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade length: 5 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length of the clamps: 10,5 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
