ents. &lt;strong&gt;The characteristic blade profile &lt;/strong&gt;and appropriate size make it easier to perform treatments. The jaws of the nippers are connected using &lt;strong&gt;the Lap Joint method&lt;/strong&gt;, thanks to which they meet perfectly during use, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring precise cutting&lt;/strong&gt;. The nippers have a matching blade cover made of durable plastic.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148428/EN_148428_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance method:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;• After use, remove scurf, dust and nail remnants using acetone;&lt;br&gt;• Immerse the tool in disinfectant liquid;&lt;br&gt;• Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil;&lt;br&gt;• Put on a cover to protect the tool from chipping;&lt;br&gt;• Never put the tongs down with the blade pointing down;&lt;br&gt;• Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention.&lt;/strong&gt; Store in a dry and safe place. Keep away from children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade length: 5 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length of the clamps: 10,5 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
