<name>EXO universal gripper for the nail drill head</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EXO &lt;/strong&gt;is a brand that provides the highest quality products for the cosmetology and podiatry industry. It is distinguished by exceptional attention to the development of the offer, with a view to satisfying customer needs. Professional equipment and accessories, including milling machines, will improve the comfort of treatments thanks to their high quality workmanship.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A practical accessory in a beauty salon&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The universal EXO holder designed to hang the nail drill head &lt;/strong&gt;near the workplace. The possibility of sticking it to a wall, desk or podiatry cabinet in the most convenient place &lt;strong&gt;to make the use of the device as efficient as possible&lt;/strong&gt;. The holder protects the nail drill handle against accidental falls, &lt;strong&gt;reducing the likelihood of damage&lt;/strong&gt;. Made of durable material, it guarantees stability and durability. &lt;strong&gt;Quick installation is ensured by a special sticker with mounting tape&lt;/strong&gt;, which is part of the set. The product &lt;strong&gt;takes into account occupational hygiene issues&lt;/strong&gt; – it is easy to clean and disinfect.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The holder assembly instructions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;1. Clean and degrease the installation area.&lt;br&gt;2. Peel off the protective foil and install the sticker in the desired location.&lt;br&gt;3. Wait 12 hours for the adhesive to properly bond to the surface.&lt;br&gt;4. Install the handle.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention.&lt;/strong&gt; Please note that installation on rough surfaces may cause the product to peel off.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
