<name>Hairdressing wash unit bowl assembly kit</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;For many years, the &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVESHOP &lt;/strong&gt;brand has been offering a wide range of products that are suitable for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical cover for the bowl tilt&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A universal control arm for hairdressing wash units&lt;/strong&gt; is an essential element of equipment for professional hairdressing salons. High quality workmanship makes this &lt;strong&gt;comprehensive set&lt;/strong&gt; provides convenience for staff and comfortable for customers. The set will not only &lt;strong&gt;help with organizing the work in the salon&lt;/strong&gt;, but also emphasize its professionalism. Universal dimensions make it &lt;strong&gt;suitable for most hairdressing wash units available on the market&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Universal installation kit for a hairdressing wash unit bowl&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The set includes &lt;strong&gt;solidly made components&lt;/strong&gt;, such as the joint, the masking rubber, the mounting screws and the elements limiting the tilt of the bowl, which &lt;strong&gt;guarantees not only durability but also stability during use&lt;/strong&gt;. Thanks to the use of &lt;strong&gt;high-quality materials&lt;/strong&gt;, the product is resistant to corrosion and easy to clean.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes:&lt;/strong&gt; joint, masking rubber, mounting screws, elements limiting the tilt of the bowl.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dimensions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Height: 8 cm&lt;br&gt;Swingarm diameter: 22 cm&lt;br&gt;Diagonal between screws: 17 cm&lt;br&gt;Siphon hole diameter: 10 cm&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
