<item>
<sku>149578</sku>
<name>YOGA MAT 1104</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;BALANCE Yoga Mats: Harmony with Nature - Mats made of Natural Rubber and Eco-friendly PU Material&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Welcome to the world of BALANCE - where the harmony of body and mind meets a sustainable approach to ecology. Our yoga mats are created with a passion for yoga and a commitment to the environment. Discover a unique yoga practice experience with mats crafted from natural rubber and innovative PU material.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Why BALANCE yoga mats are exceptional:&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Natural rubber for excellent grip: Our yoga mats are made from high-quality natural rubber, providing excellent grip even in challenging conditions. This is crucial for maintaining stability and safety during your practice.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Eco-friendly PU material: BALANCE cares not only about your well-being but also about the well-being of our planet. We use eco-friendly PU material that is not only exceptionally durable but also fully biodegradable. This means that your BALANCE yoga mat will return to nature after use, leaving no environmental trace.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Elegance and style: Our mats combine functionality with aesthetics. Available in various patterns and colors, BALANCE yoga mats are not just tools for practice but also expressions of your individual style.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Ease of maintenance: Let your yoga practice be even more enjoyable. Our mats are easy to clean - simply wipe them gently to maintain freshness and hygiene.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Join the BALANCE community - people who combine their love for yoga with care for our planet.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Choose a BALANCE yoga mat made of natural rubber and eco-friendly PU material, experience harmony in every session, and do it with respect for the environment. Find your balance with BALANCE!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
