<item>
<sku>147988</sku>
<name>J8890 cape with elastic neckband</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;For many years, the &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVESHOP &lt;/strong&gt;brand has been offering a wide range of products that are suitable for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment, you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to specialized equipment, such as cosmetic furniture.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cleanliness during treatments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A hairdressing cape&lt;/strong&gt; is an essential element of the equipment of every hairdressing salon or barbershop. It helps maintain &lt;strong&gt;high standards of cleanliness&lt;/strong&gt;, protecting the client's body and clothing against splashes during hair treatments. It will also be used in other specialized practices, including beauty salons.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Versatility and functionality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;It is ideal for all services offered in beauty salons, including various types of hair care and coloring treatments. Professionally &lt;strong&gt;protects clothing against contamination &lt;/strong&gt;with products used during treatments. It will also be useful when cutting both dry and wet – it prevents the cut hair from getting under clothes. &lt;strong&gt;The elastic band around the neck &lt;/strong&gt;reduces the chance of hair getting under the cape, providing &lt;strong&gt;even better protection&lt;/strong&gt;. In beauty salons, it will be used especially when applying make-up or henna treatments.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take care of the customer's comfort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The product is made of &lt;strong&gt;waterproof material&lt;/strong&gt; that allows for effortless cleaning and &lt;strong&gt;adequately protects against any type of splashing&lt;/strong&gt;. Thanks to its universal size and the ability to adjust with snaps at the neck, it will fit every client, regardless of their height, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring comfort&lt;/strong&gt; during the procedure.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Color: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;</description>
