<item>
<sku>148423</sku>
<name>Nghia export nail nippers NL.204 16MM</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA &lt;/strong&gt;offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools, which significantly improve the quality of everyday life of beauty industry customers. The brand's goal is to effectively meet consumer needs by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148423/EN_148423_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precise tool for perfect nails&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The professional &lt;strong&gt;NGHIA Export NL.204 nail nippers&lt;/strong&gt; are made of high-quality stainless steel, making them &lt;strong&gt;highly resistant to damage&lt;/strong&gt; and blunting. They are&lt;strong&gt; perfect for podiatric treatments&lt;/strong&gt; and for shortening hard and thick nail plates. The pliers are &lt;strong&gt;suitable for autoclave &lt;/strong&gt;and do not need to be resharpened after purchase.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148423/EN_148423_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solutions for high working comfort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The practical &lt;strong&gt;double spring&lt;/strong&gt; connecting the arms ensures &lt;strong&gt;excellent feel, stability and cutting precision&lt;/strong&gt;. Careful workmanship allows &lt;strong&gt;for comfortable, quiet and smooth operation&lt;/strong&gt;. The way of shaping and the size of the arms make the nippers &lt;strong&gt;fit perfectly in the hand&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring comfort of use. The semi-matt finish and decorative, &lt;strong&gt;non-slip elements on the arms &lt;/strong&gt;make them look elegant, and the passivated surface increases their resistance and makes them easier to keep clean. This makes them&lt;strong&gt; an ideal tool&lt;/strong&gt; for both professionals and those who love taking care of their nails at home.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148423/EN_148423_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perfectly profiled blades&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The massive 16 mm long blades&lt;/strong&gt; are perfect for complex manicure and pedicure treatments. &lt;strong&gt;The straight profile of the bevel &lt;/strong&gt;and appropriate size make it easier to perform treatments. The jaws of the nippers are connected using&lt;strong&gt; the Lap Joint method&lt;/strong&gt;, thanks to which they &lt;strong&gt;meet perfectly during use, ensuring precise cutting&lt;/strong&gt;. The nippers have a matching blade cover made of durable plastic.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintenance method:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;• After use, remove scurf, dust and nail remnants using acetone;&lt;br&gt;• Immerse the tool in disinfectant liquid;&lt;br&gt;• Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil;&lt;br&gt;• Put on a cover to protect the tool from chipping;&lt;br&gt;• Never put the nippers down with the blade pointing down;&lt;br&gt;• Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention.&lt;/strong&gt; Store in a dry and safe place. Keep away from children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/xIRtOxnlMGA" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade length: 16 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length of the clamps: 13 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>20.32</price>
