<name>Pro Ink 718 Tattoo Armrest Black Quilted W</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148560/EN_148560_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;PRO INK&lt;/strong&gt; brand responds to the specific needs of the tattoo industry. It offers professional equipment and accessories dedicated to tattoo parlors. The brand's assortment includes products such as tattoo chairs, assistants and supports that significantly make work easier.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148560/EN_148560_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Combination of comfort and functionality with style&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The comfortable &lt;strong&gt;Pro Ink 718 tattoo armrest with quilting&lt;/strong&gt; is an extremely important element of the equipment of any professional tattoo parlor, where &lt;strong&gt;the customer's comfort&lt;/strong&gt; and high precision of the service performed are important issues. It will facilitate the creation of works of art on the client's body. The armrest combines both functionality and aesthetics, &lt;strong&gt;providing not only exceptional comfort, but also a stylish look&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148560/EN_148560_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adjustment to individual needs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The armrest height is adjustable within the range of 69-106 cm&lt;/strong&gt;, which allows it to be adapted to different clients and guarantees&lt;strong&gt; optimal support during the tattoo session&lt;/strong&gt;. Thanks to the tilt adjustment function, you can adjust the armrest’s positioning to the individual needs of the client and the characteristics of the procedure, &lt;strong&gt;providing even more comfort during tattooing&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148560/EN_148560_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Durability and reliability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A solid frame in shades of black made of metal ensures &lt;strong&gt;the stability and durability&lt;/strong&gt; of the armrest, which is extremely important during the work of a tattoo artist. The upholstery made of synthetic leather in shades of black with elegant white quilting ensures easy cleaning of the equipment. &lt;strong&gt;The modern design&lt;/strong&gt; will make the interior of the tattoo parlor more attractive, emphasizing the unique character of the place. &lt;strong&gt;A combination of comfort, functionality and style&lt;/strong&gt; that will surely satisfy both professionals and clients of the tattoo parlor. The armrest &lt;strong&gt;significantly facilitates work&lt;/strong&gt;, but also helps to create a pleasant atmosphere in the parlor and emphasizes its atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Height adjustment: 69-106 cm&lt;br&gt;Color: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Quilting color: white&lt;/p&gt;</description>
