<name>Small barber mat barbertop</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;For many years, the &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVESHOP &lt;/strong&gt;brand has been offering a wide range of products that are suitable for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment, you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to specialized equipment, such as cosmetic furniture.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential accessory for the barbershops&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The practical rubber barber mat&lt;/strong&gt; is a perfect addition to a workstation in barbershops and hairdressing salons. It ensures &lt;strong&gt;perfect organization of the workplace&lt;/strong&gt;, protecting delicate tools from damage and preventing them from slipping on the counter top. The mat is made of durable material, which guarantees &lt;strong&gt;easy and effective cleaning under running water &lt;/strong&gt;and the possibility of disinfection. The anti-slip surface &lt;strong&gt;protects tools from scratches and ensures stability while working&lt;/strong&gt;. This is an ideal solution for professional barbers who value order, functionality and durability of the equipment.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Photos for illustration purposes only. The product is sold without accessories.&lt;br&gt;Material: rubber&lt;br&gt;Dimensions: 30×19 cm&lt;br&gt;Thickness: 4 mm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
