<item>
<sku>149393</sku>
<name>Gabbiano barber mat</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano &lt;/strong&gt;is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship, as well as high comfort of use. The offer includes a large selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, washers and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovative barber mat&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Gabbiano barber mat with magnetic elements&lt;/strong&gt; is an essential accessory in every professional barbershop. Made of high-quality rubber, it provides &lt;strong&gt;excellent grip and protection for tools &lt;/strong&gt;and work surfaces. The anti-slip structure of the mat prevents scissors, razors and combs from sliding, minimizing the risk of its damage. It is &lt;strong&gt;easy to clean&lt;/strong&gt; – just wipe it with a damp cloth or wash it under running water.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aesthetic design and functionality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The greatest advantage of this mat is &lt;strong&gt;the 4 built-in magnets&lt;/strong&gt;, which allow metal tools such as clippers or scissors to be safely deposited during work. They keep tools in one place, &lt;strong&gt;providing easy access and preventing them from accidentally moving&lt;/strong&gt; or falling. The mat is &lt;strong&gt;flexible, soft and easily returns to its original shape&lt;/strong&gt;. Thanks to strong grip and non-slip texture, the mat guarantees &lt;strong&gt;safety and comfort of work&lt;/strong&gt;, protecting tools against falling. The attractive &lt;strong&gt;camouflage pattern&lt;/strong&gt; adds an aesthetic appeal to the workplace.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Photos for illustration purposes only. The product is sold without contents.&lt;br&gt;Material: rubber&lt;br&gt;Dimensions: 45×30 cm&lt;br&gt;Thickness: 7 mm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
