<description>&lt;p&gt;For many years, the &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVESHOP &lt;/strong&gt;brand has been offering a wide range of products that are suitable for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment, you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to specialized equipment, such as cosmetic furniture.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Combination of style and functionality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The elegant&lt;strong&gt; Loft NN-09 bamboo hairdressing comb&lt;/strong&gt; combines modern design with natural elements, giving everyday use a unique character. &lt;strong&gt;Lightweight and handy&lt;/strong&gt;, made with attention to detail, it &lt;strong&gt;provides excellent functionality&lt;/strong&gt; and also looks extremely aesthetically pleasing. &lt;strong&gt;It is ideal for both hair salon work and everyday use at home&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unique design and eco-friendliness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ergonomically profiled &lt;/strong&gt;back gives the comb a modern look, while ensuring &lt;strong&gt;lightness and comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;. Bamboo is an excellent material – &lt;strong&gt;eco-friendly and durable&lt;/strong&gt;, more resistant to moisture than wood. The gentle bend guarantees &lt;strong&gt;a secure grip and precise maneuvering during styling&lt;/strong&gt;, which allows you to achieve professional effects. The comb is equipped with small, narrowly spaced teeth in shades of black, &lt;strong&gt;facilitating combing&lt;/strong&gt;. The teeth are gentle on the hair, &lt;strong&gt;minimize the risk of damage&lt;/strong&gt; and give the strands smoothness and shine.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Color: shades of wood and black&lt;br&gt;Dimensions: 14,5×5,5 cm&lt;br&gt;Tooth spacing: 1 mm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
