<item>
<sku>149388</sku>
<name>Barber hairdressing cape with elastic band J-455</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;For many years, the &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVESHOP &lt;/strong&gt;brand has been offering a wide range of products that are suitable for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment, you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to specialized equipment, such as cosmetic furniture.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cleanliness during treatments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The J-455 hairdressing cape&lt;/strong&gt; is an essential element of the equipment of every hairdressing or barbering salon. &lt;strong&gt;It helps maintain high standards of cleanliness&lt;/strong&gt;, effectively protecting the client's body and clothing against splashing during hair treatments. It will also be used in other specialized practices, including beauty salons. The decorative pattern on the front adds character to the cape.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Versatility and functionality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;It is &lt;strong&gt;perfect for all services offered in beauty salons&lt;/strong&gt;, including care and coloring treatments. Professionally &lt;strong&gt;protects clothing against contamination&lt;/strong&gt; with products used during treatments. It will also be useful when hair cutting hair both dry and wet – it prevents the cut hair from getting under clothes.&lt;strong&gt; The elastic band around the neck reduces the chance of hair getting under the cape&lt;/strong&gt; and perfectly protects against it, ensuring even better protection. In beauty salons, it will be used especially when applying make-up or henna treatments.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take care of the customer's comfort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The product is &lt;strong&gt;made of black waterproof material&lt;/strong&gt;, which allows for trouble-free cleaning and adequately protects against all types of splashes. Thanks to their &lt;strong&gt;universal size and the possibility of adjustment &lt;/strong&gt;thanks to snaps at the neck, they will work for every client, regardless of their height, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring comfort&lt;/strong&gt; during the procedures.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Color: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;</description>
