<sku>149654</sku>
<name>Actuator for 210 Basic cosmetic chairs</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;For many years, the &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVESHOP &lt;/strong&gt;brand has been offering a wide range of products that are suitable for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment, you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to specialized equipment, such as cosmetic furniture.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Easy to adjust the height of the hairdressing chair&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The practical &lt;strong&gt;hydraulic actuator adapted to the Basic 210 cosmetic chairs&lt;/strong&gt; allows you to freely adjust the height of the chair at any time and without using your hands. This guarantees &lt;strong&gt;ergonomic work&lt;/strong&gt;, thanks to the possibility of freely adjusting the seat level to the height of both the client and the practitioner. &lt;strong&gt;It allows the height of the chair to be changed within a range of +/- 14 centimetres&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elegance and functionality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid construction&lt;/strong&gt; and careful workmanship ensure long, quiet and trouble-free operation. The actuator is&lt;strong&gt; a spare part, its replacement is simple&lt;/strong&gt;. The product is made of durable materials that are &lt;strong&gt;easy to clean and ensure long use&lt;/strong&gt;. The polished finish gives it an elegant look.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
