<name>Glove and Towel Holder for Pro Ink 720 Tattoo Armrest</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148445/EN_148445_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;PRO INK&lt;/strong&gt; brand responds to the specific needs of the tattoo industry. It offers professional equipment and accessories dedicated to tattoo parlors. The brand's assortment includes products such as tattoo chairs, assistants and supports that significantly facilitate work.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148445/EN_148445_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Convenient organizer to facilitate the tattoo artist's work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Designed for the Pro Ink 720 tattoo armrest, &lt;strong&gt;the holder with space for gloves and a paper towel&lt;/strong&gt; is a practical solution, perfectly in line with the high standards of the tattoo industry. The holder, which is also a convenient organizer, was designed &lt;strong&gt;for maximum efficiency in the tattoo studio&lt;/strong&gt;. The ability to mount it on the armrest frame makes essential items such as gloves and paper towels &lt;strong&gt;always easily accessible&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148445/EN_148445_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Durability and functionality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The metal construction of the handle not only &lt;strong&gt;guarantees durability&lt;/strong&gt;, but also makes it easy to keep it in perfect condition thanks to the &lt;strong&gt;easy-to-clean surface&lt;/strong&gt;. An additional advantage is the aesthetic color in shades of black, which not only fits into the professional character of the tattoo studio, but also &lt;strong&gt;emphasizes the attention to detail and aesthetics&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Color: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;</description>
