<sku>148446</sku>
<name>Accessory tray for the Pro Ink 720 tattoo armrest</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148446/EN_148446_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;PRO INK&lt;/strong&gt; brand responds to the specific needs of the tattoo industry. It offers professional equipment and accessories dedicated to tattoo parlors. The brand's assortment includes products such as tattoo chairs, assistants and supports that significantly facilitate work.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148446/EN_148446_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ergonomic space for accessories&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The accessory tray&lt;/strong&gt; dedicated to the Pro Ink 720 tattoo armrest is &lt;strong&gt;a practical solution&lt;/strong&gt; that fits perfectly into the tattoo industry. It is not only functional, but also aesthetically pleasing, which is an important element in the context of the professional nature of the tattoo studio, &lt;strong&gt;raising the work standards&lt;/strong&gt;. The possibility of mounting it on the armrest frame means that &lt;strong&gt;the necessary tools are always at hand&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148446/EN_148446_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Durability and functionality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The metal construction of the holder not only &lt;strong&gt;guarantees durability&lt;/strong&gt;, but also makes it easy to keep it in perfect condition thanks to &lt;strong&gt;the easy-to-clean surface&lt;/strong&gt;. An additional advantage is the aesthetic color in shades of black, which not only fits into the professional character of the tattoo studio, but also emphasizes &lt;strong&gt;the attention to detail and aesthetics&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Color: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>19.51</price>
<category_subcategory>Tattoo studio equipment&gt;Tattoo armrests</category_subcategory>
