<description>&lt;p&gt;For many years, the &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVESHOP &lt;/strong&gt;brand has been offering a wide range of products that are suitable for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment, you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to specialized equipment, such as cosmetic furniture.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perfect protection and customer comfort&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Self-adhesive &lt;strong&gt;disposable paper collars &lt;/strong&gt;made of flexible and durable hygiene tissue paper ensure not only comfort, but also hygiene during each visit. The product is &lt;strong&gt;packed in the form of rolls&lt;/strong&gt; from which you can easily tear off the flexible hairdressing collars, ready for use. &lt;strong&gt;Practical and useful in everyday work&lt;/strong&gt;, they are gentle on the skin and at the same time extremely durable. They are &lt;strong&gt;perfect for all hairdressing services&lt;/strong&gt;, including cutting, coloring and care treatments.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;5 rolls included.&lt;br&gt;Color: shades of green&lt;/p&gt;</description>
