<description>&lt;div&gt;      &lt;div dir="auto"&gt;          &lt;div&gt;              &lt;div&gt;                  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CARTRIDGE EL CARTEL V2 123 Round Magnum 0.35 &amp;ndash; The Ideal Choice for Blackout and Blast Over&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;                  &lt;p&gt;Cartridge 123 Round Magnum 0.35 is an excellent tool for tattoo artists specializing in blackout and blast over techniques.&lt;/p&gt;                  &lt;p&gt;The 0.35 mm needles provide excellent ink coverage, allowing for quick and even coverage of large skin areas.&lt;/p&gt;                  &lt;p&gt;The solid construction and precise performance make them ideal for long sessions, while the built-in membrane protects the machine from ink and blood penetration, increasing safety and hygiene.&lt;/p&gt;                  &lt;p&gt;The versatility and compatibility with various machines make them a reliable choice for professional tattoo artists.&lt;/p&gt;              &lt;/div&gt;          &lt;/div&gt;      &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div&gt;      &lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;</description>
