<item>
<sku>149727</sku>
<name>Hairdresser head holder</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVESHOP &lt;/strong&gt;company has been offering for years a wide range of products that are suitable for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to professional equipment.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical holder for hairdressing head&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The universal training hairdressing head stand&lt;/strong&gt; is an excellent tool for those developing their skills in hairdressing. It will be&lt;strong&gt; ideal for practicing &lt;/strong&gt;different hairstyles, as it is &lt;strong&gt;compatible with all models of training heads&lt;/strong&gt;, making it an extremely universal tool. The holder is equipped with a &lt;strong&gt;solid handle that works like a vise&lt;/strong&gt;, which provides a stable attachment to the countertop, which guarantees safety and comfort during work. &lt;strong&gt;The head angle adjustment&lt;/strong&gt; allows you to precisely adjust the position of the head, which significantly increases&lt;strong&gt; the comfort of use and efficiency&lt;/strong&gt; of training.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wide range of adjustment possibilities &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The holder allows easy adjustment of the appropriate angle of the head for&lt;strong&gt; comfortable and precise maneuvering&lt;/strong&gt;. A solid handle that works like a vise allows the stand to be &lt;strong&gt;securely fastened to the countertop&lt;/strong&gt;, eliminating the risk of the hairdressing head shifting or falling. Its &lt;strong&gt;easy and intuitive usage&lt;/strong&gt; makes it perfect for both beginners and experienced stylists. &lt;strong&gt;The handle's universality&lt;/strong&gt; allows the stand to be used with any model of hairdressing head, making it a multipurpose tool for everyday work.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simple design and functionality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The minimalist design&lt;/strong&gt; of the stand makes it fit perfectly into the any hair salon or training space. Lightweight and durable construction made of durable synthetic material ensures &lt;strong&gt;mobility, durability and resistance &lt;/strong&gt;to mechanical damage. High quality materials used in production &lt;strong&gt;guarantee long term use&lt;/strong&gt; and the ergonomic design increases comfort of work. The stand is equipped with a handle operating like a vice with a maximum opening of 4,5 cm, which allows &lt;strong&gt;easy and stable attachment to most countertops&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;The measurements are given in a photo.&lt;br&gt;Color: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;  </description>
<price>1.73</price>
<category_subcategory>Hairdressing salon equipment&gt;Hairdressing heads and accessories</category_subcategory>
