<description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVESHOP &lt;/strong&gt;company has been offering for years a wide range of products that are suitable for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to professional equipment.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stylish and functional barbershop case&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The barber case&lt;/strong&gt; in an elegant gold and black finish is the perfect choice for professionals who value &lt;strong&gt;style and functionality&lt;/strong&gt;. Designed for convenience and safety, the case has a capacious compartment &lt;strong&gt;for easy organization of tools&lt;/strong&gt;. A specially designed divider with elastic bands allows &lt;strong&gt;for secure storage&lt;/strong&gt; of scissors, brushes and other small accessories, so everything is &lt;strong&gt;always easily accessible&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stylish and functional organizer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Made of high-quality materials, the case is characterized by &lt;strong&gt;long-lasting resistance to damage&lt;/strong&gt;. Modern gold and black finish with lacquered elements give &lt;strong&gt;unique, professional look&lt;/strong&gt; that attracts attention. &lt;strong&gt;Solid construction and aesthetics&lt;/strong&gt; result in a product that &lt;strong&gt;combines functionality with elegance&lt;/strong&gt;. The convenient handle makes it easy to carry, making it &lt;strong&gt;ideal for mobile barbers and hairdressers&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;The measurements are given in a photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Illustrative photos.&lt;/strong&gt; Case sold without contents.&lt;br&gt;The golden elements are lacquered. Mechanical damaged to the coating is not a subject to complaint.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
