<item>
<sku>149382</sku>
<name>Tattoo Armrest Pro Ink 721</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/149382/EN_149382_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PRO INK&lt;/strong&gt; brand responds to the specific needs of the tattoo industry. It offers professional equipment and accessories dedicated to tattoo salons. The brand's range includes products such as tattoo chairs, assistants or supports, which significantly simplify work.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/149382/EN_149382_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical and stylish armrest&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The ergonomic&lt;strong&gt; Pro Ink 721 tattoo armrest&lt;/strong&gt; is an irreplaceable part of tattoo salon’s equipment, where &lt;strong&gt;the client’s comfort and precision&lt;/strong&gt; of the service are a priority. The armrest&lt;strong&gt; combines functionality with aesthetics&lt;/strong&gt;, providing not only exceptional comfort, but also stylish design. Thanks to it, tattooing is more precise and comfortable.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/149382/EN_149382_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customization to individual needs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The height of the armrest can be adjusted &lt;strong&gt;from 69 to 95 centimeters&lt;/strong&gt;, which allows you to customize it according to the client’s needs and also &lt;strong&gt;guarantees stable support&lt;/strong&gt; during session. &lt;strong&gt;Adjustment of the armrest angle up to 180°&lt;/strong&gt; (90° each way), the ability to adjust he height of both sides independently thanks to the built-in gas lifts allow &lt;strong&gt;for optimal positioning of the armrest&lt;/strong&gt;. The wide range of adjustment increases the &lt;strong&gt;ergonomics of work and comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;. The metal footrest makes it easier for the tattoo practitioner or the client to take an &lt;strong&gt;ergonomic position&lt;/strong&gt;. In addition, the option to install an &lt;a href="https://activeshop.com.pl/eng/tacka-na-akcesoria-do-podlokietnika-do-tatuazu-pro-ink-720.html"&gt;accessory tray&lt;/a&gt; and a &lt;a href="https://activeshop.com.pl/eng/uchwyt-na-rekawiczki-i-recznik-do-podlokietnika-do-tatuazu-pro-ink-720.html"&gt;glove and towel holder&lt;/a&gt; on the frame increases the functionality of this model.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/149382/EN_149382_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An essential element of tattoo salon equipment &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The armrest not only &lt;strong&gt;simplifies the work&lt;/strong&gt; of the tattooist, but also creates a pleasant atmosphere in the salon. &lt;strong&gt;Modern design &lt;/strong&gt;enhances the interior design, emphasizing the character of the place. The contoured &lt;strong&gt;soft support panel&lt;/strong&gt; guarantees comfort even during longer sessions. &lt;strong&gt;A solid metal frame&lt;/strong&gt; in the shades of black &lt;strong&gt;ensures stability and durability &lt;/strong&gt;of the product, which is crucial in the tattooist’s work. Synthetic leather upholstery in the shades of black and strain-resistant foam padding provide &lt;strong&gt;easy cleaning and long-term durability&lt;/strong&gt;. The ergonomic &lt;strong&gt;combination of comfort, functionality and style&lt;/strong&gt; will surely satisfy demanding users – both professionals and clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/149382/EN_149382_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Detailed measurements shown in the photo&lt;br&gt;Color of upholstery: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Material of upholstery: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Frame color: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Frame material: metal&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>223.57</price>
<category_subcategory>Tattoo studio equipment&gt;Tattoo armrests</category_subcategory>
