<item>
<sku>147556</sku>
<name>Codos wireless hair trimmer CHC-339</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147556/EN_147556_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Codos&lt;/strong&gt; brand offers practical hair clippers, blades, and caps. It focuses on stylish, handy wireless models that guarantee significant freedom and ease of use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147556/EN_147556_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ergonomics and precision for a perfect cut&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Codos CHC-339 professional wireless clipper trimmer&lt;/strong&gt; is perfect for trimming hair and beards, providing high comfort. The properly shaped device &lt;strong&gt;fits well in the hand&lt;/strong&gt; and makes it easy to achieve a perfect haircut. The &lt;strong&gt;simplicity of use and ergonomic design&lt;/strong&gt; make the device &lt;strong&gt;perfect for both professional and home use&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing you to take control of your hair.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147556/EN_147556_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features for convenient use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Movable stainless-steel blades ensure &lt;strong&gt;durable sharpness and precise cutting&lt;/strong&gt;, and the detachable blade makes it easier to clean the device. The trimmer allows you to &lt;strong&gt;adjust the speed at three levels: 5000 RPM, 5500 RPM, and 6000 RPM&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing you to customize the device's operation to suit different users' needs and the types of cuts being made. Four comb attachments are included, allowing cutting from 1.5mm to 6mm, making the trimmer an &lt;strong&gt;extremely versatile&lt;/strong&gt; and precise tool. Additionally, the &lt;strong&gt;overcharge and over-discharge protection&lt;/strong&gt; feature increases the safety of use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147556/EN_147556_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intuitive control panel with clear display&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;control panel with a digital display&lt;/strong&gt; enhances user convenience, allowing for &lt;strong&gt;easy control and customization&lt;/strong&gt; of the trimmer's operation. The screen &lt;strong&gt;displays the battery percentage&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing you to monitor the remaining runtime in real-time. The &lt;strong&gt;three speed levels&lt;/strong&gt; displayed on the panel allow for easy adjustment to different cutting types. Thus, the control panel not only increases &lt;strong&gt;precision and efficiency&lt;/strong&gt; but also provides full control over the device.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147556/EN_147556_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable work thanks to a high-performance battery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The trimmer's &lt;strong&gt;high-performance lithium battery&lt;/strong&gt; ensures long-lasting, comfortable work, enabling &lt;strong&gt;over 2 hours of continuous use&lt;/strong&gt;. The lack of tangled cables significantly simplifies the hair-trimming process and &lt;strong&gt;increases freedom of movement&lt;/strong&gt;, resulting in more comfortable work. It takes &lt;strong&gt;only an hour&lt;/strong&gt; to fully charge the battery, allowing you to return to work quickly without long downtimes. This ensures that &lt;strong&gt;hairdressers can work without restrictions&lt;/strong&gt;, enjoying full mobility and convenience.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/147556/EN_147556_6.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elegant clipper trimmer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The ergonomically designed trimmer is made of &lt;strong&gt;matte gray plastic&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring not only durability but also easy cleaning. It sits perfectly in the hand, providing &lt;strong&gt;full control during a haircut&lt;/strong&gt;. The stylish panel adds elegance, emphasizing its modern character. &lt;strong&gt;Intuitively placed buttons&lt;/strong&gt; make using the trimmer extremely comfortable. This &lt;strong&gt;combination of functionality and style&lt;/strong&gt; makes the trimmer a perfect choice for users who value both practicality and elegant design.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Included:&lt;/strong&gt; trimmer, four plastic caps (1,5mm; 3mm; 4,5mm; 6mm), power adapter, cleaning brush, bottle of oil for maintenance.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Color: shades of gray&lt;br&gt;Width of blades: 4 cm&lt;br&gt;Full charging time: 1 h&lt;br&gt;Operating time after full charge: 150 min (~2.5 h)&lt;br&gt;Power: 7 W&lt;br&gt;Voltage: 100-240 V&lt;br&gt;Battery type: LiFePo4&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>48.17</price>
<category_subcategory>Hairdressing salon equipment&gt;Hair clippers</category_subcategory>
<qty>37</qty>
<weight>0.5200</weight>
<brand>CODOS</brand>
<tax>23%</tax>
<EAN>6956540103395</EAN>
