<item>
<sku>152006</sku>
<name>Podoland preparation PodoIntensive specialist mask for feet and hands 100 ml</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;PodoIntensive&lt;br /&gt;Specialised mask for feet and hands&lt;br /&gt;A multi-ingredient product in the convenient form of a mask, ideally suited as a cosmetic for the regeneration of severely dry skin all over the body. The combination of natural butters, oils and expertly selected components enhances the natural renewal capacity of cells, increases moisture retention and helps reduce even the deepest epidermal cracks. Thanks to its unique content of babassu nut powder, it reduces foot perspiration and provides a mattifying effect without leaving an unpleasant film on the skin.&lt;br /&gt; - moisturises and restores the elasticity of the skin&lt;br /&gt; - prevents the formation of calluses and cracks&lt;br /&gt; - regenerates, moisturises and promotes the renewal of the epidermis&lt;br /&gt; - reinforces the skin's natural ability to regenerate itself&lt;br /&gt; - regulates sebum and sweat production. &lt;br /&gt;Active ingredients:&lt;br /&gt;Avocado oil - regenerates cracks, soothes and moisturises.&lt;br /&gt;Collagen - promotes skin cell renewal&lt;br /&gt;Macadamia oil - nourishes and conditions the skin&lt;br /&gt;Shea butter - improves elasticity, smooths&lt;br /&gt;Mexican aloe vera juice - promotes epidermal protection and the skin's ability to regenerate itself&lt;br /&gt;Babassu nut powder - controls sebum secretion, thus reducing foot perspiration&lt;br /&gt;Manufacturer: Podoland&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>19.31</price>
