<item>
<sku>150898</sku>
<name>Depilflax 100 Mauve with titanium dio</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Depilflax &lt;/strong&gt;is a brand specializing in hair removal products, offering a wide range of waxes pre- and post-treatment cosmetics which meet the high expectations of professionals. The innovative formulas are based on natural ingredients, emphasizing the brand's concern for the skin and the environment.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional hair removal product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Vegan &lt;strong&gt;wax in beads Depilflax Ultraflex Mauve&lt;/strong&gt; is a product suitable for all skin types, especially to delicate and sensitive skin. It provides &lt;strong&gt;high comfort and safety&lt;/strong&gt; of the depilation procedure. Perfect choice for professional beauty salons and people who value efficiency and comfort during depilation. &lt;strong&gt;Specially selected active substances&lt;/strong&gt; guarantee optimal and gentle depilation. Using this type of wax makes the treatments &lt;strong&gt;even more effective and less painful&lt;/strong&gt;. The product is based on natural ingredients and carefully selected active substances ensure &lt;strong&gt;optimal and gentle depilation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hard wax for special tasks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; High elasticity&lt;/strong&gt; facilitates application in thin layers, which shortens the treatment time. The form of beads helps to measure necessary amount of product and &lt;strong&gt;ensures precise and effective depilation&lt;/strong&gt;. The low melting level of the wax causes it to quickly dissolve and be ready for use, which &lt;strong&gt;speeds up the depilation process&lt;/strong&gt;. Using this type of wax makes depilation even more effective and gentle. Thanks to its special formula, the wax &lt;strong&gt;perfectly catches hair, regardless of the direction of their growth &lt;/strong&gt;and allows easy removal. It can be used to removing body and facial hair.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;• Place the wax in the heater and heat on the maximum temperature until the wax melts completely,&lt;br&gt;• Reduce the temperature to medium and wait until wax reaches the application temperature (about 65-70°C),&lt;br&gt;• Thoroughly clean and dry the skin in the treatment area,&lt;br&gt;• Apply the wax with a spatula, making sure the edges are thin to increase efficiency,&lt;br&gt;• Let the wax sit for a few seconds until it begins to harden. Stretch the skin and quickly remove the wax by pulling firmly in the opposite direction to the application.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients:&lt;/strong&gt; hydrogenated polydicyclopentadiene paraffin, ethylene vinyl acetate copolymer, microcrystalline wax, liquid paraffin, PEG-3 Dioleate, synthetic fluorophlogopite, vinylpyrrole don-vinyl acetate copolymer, titanium dioxide, dyes, tin oxide.&lt;br&gt;Weight: 1 kg&lt;br&gt;Manufacturer: MayStar&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>19.51</price>
<qty>29</qty>
<weight>1.0000</weight>
<brand>DEPILFLAX</brand>
<tax>23%</tax>
