<description>&lt;h2&gt;EL CARTEL RM-W – Maximum Coverage, Triple Power&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model: RM-W (Round Magnum Wide)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;EL CARTEL RM-W&lt;/strong&gt; cartridges are the answer for artists who demand &lt;strong&gt;maximum ink saturation and full coverage&lt;/strong&gt;. Unlike standard RM (Round Magnum) cartridges with &lt;strong&gt;2 rows of needles&lt;/strong&gt;, the RM-W model features &lt;strong&gt;3 rows&lt;/strong&gt;, creating a wider spread and a larger working surface.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;h3&gt;Features:&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;ul&gt;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Three rows of needles&lt;/strong&gt;: more coverage, faster work, deeper and more even saturation&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rounded profile (Round)&lt;/strong&gt;: better adaptation to body contours&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Blur effect&lt;/strong&gt;: the special needle layout allows for soft tonal transitions and smooth gradients&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perfect for realism&lt;/strong&gt;: ideal for creating textures, details, and deep shading&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stable membrane&lt;/strong&gt;: safety and precise ink flow control&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compatibility&lt;/strong&gt;: fits most machines and cartridge grips&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;/ul&gt;    &lt;h3&gt;Applications:&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;ul&gt;    &lt;li&gt;Large fill-ins and color packing&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;Shading large areas&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;Realism, textures, blur effects&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;Styles: realism, graphic, dotwork, blackwork&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;/ul&gt;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trust the power of the third row. EL CARTEL RM-W – more coverage, fewer passes, and full shading control.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  </description>
