<item>
<sku>150122</sku>
<name>4Rico swivel chair QS-GW01G pink</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150122/EN_150122_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;4Rico &lt;/strong&gt;furniture combines functionality and comfort. The hockers and make-up chairs available in their offer are distinguished by a wide selection of patterns, colors and upholstery materials. They will be a sophisticated accent of any space – both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150122/EN_150122_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stylish, functional chair&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The elegant&lt;strong&gt; 4Rico QS-GW01G chair&lt;/strong&gt; with an intriguing braiding on the backrest and polished elements in shades of gold, upholstered with a pleasant-to-the-touch material, will fit into any interior. The furniture&lt;strong&gt; is distinguished by elegance&lt;/strong&gt; and is extremely versatile –&lt;strong&gt; it is perfect for professional salons&lt;/strong&gt;, including a beauty salon, nail salon, office or elegant reception area. It is also perfect for home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150122/EN_150122_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant adjustment possibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The efficient gas lift&lt;/strong&gt; allows for easy and smooth adjustment of the seat height&lt;strong&gt; between 41-57 cm&lt;/strong&gt;. This makes it possible to adjust the chair to individual needs and the services performed, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring high comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt; – whether during makeup, eyebrow styling or other activities. &lt;strong&gt;The full rotation mechanism&lt;/strong&gt; improves the efficiency and comfort of work. &lt;strong&gt;A properly profiled backrest &lt;/strong&gt;provides comfortable seating, back support and &lt;strong&gt;facilitates proper shoulder positioning&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150122/EN_150122_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elegant design for comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The finish makes the furniture eye-catching&lt;/strong&gt;. The pleasant-to-the-touch, velvet upholstery in shades of pink gives it a unique character. The base in shades of gold adds elegance, perfectly matching the velvet. &lt;strong&gt;Functional wheels provide mobility&lt;/strong&gt;, making it easier to move the chair and move around the salon while working. Careful workmanship, comfort of use and aesthetically interwoven material on the profiled backrest make the chair &lt;strong&gt;will meet the requirements of even the most demanding users&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150122/EN_150122_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The exact dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes:&lt;/strong&gt; seat, base with actuator, assembly kit.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: velvet&lt;br&gt;Actuator: gas lift&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of pink&lt;br&gt;Base color: shades of gold&lt;/p&gt;</description>
