<sku>150974</sku>
<name>EL CARTEL VISPA tattoo machine black</name>
<description>&lt;P&gt;&lt;IMG src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150974/EN_150974_01.jpg"&gt;&lt;/P&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;El Cartel&lt;/strong&gt; is a brand of professional tattoo products that offers iconic cartridges, machines and other essential tattoo accessories. It is characterized by high quality, precision and unique design. It guarantees comfort and meets the highest standards required in the tattoo industry. It enjoys interest and is gaining more and more popularity, which is confirmed by positive opinions of users.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;P&gt;&lt;IMG src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150974/EN_150974_02.jpg"&gt;&lt;/P&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;EL CARTEL VISPA&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The El Cartel cordless rotary machine with adjustable stroke is the perfect choice for beginners and professional tattooists. It is characterized by its lightness, fluidity and stable operation. In addition, it has replaceable batteries and an adapter for working on a cable, making it extremely versatile and convenient to use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;P&gt;&lt;IMG src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150974/EN_150974_03.jpg"&gt;&lt;/P&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Lightweight and ergonomic&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;El Cartel VISPA is a design with comfort in mind.. Its lightweight aluminum case (weight of the device + battery: 225 g) and replaceable grips (profiled and straight) make it fit perfectly in the hand, which minimizes fatigue even during long work.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;P&gt;&lt;IMG src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150974/EN_150974_04.jpg"&gt;&lt;/P&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Become an even better artist&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Its great advantage is its adjustable stroke from 2.4 to 4.2 mm, changeable via a ring (as many as 7 settings) to accommodate a variety of tattoo styles and techniques. It is equipped with a powerful coreless motor, whose voltage is also adjustable and safe. It features a smooth and stable operation from 4 to 12 volts, giving you maximum control over the tattooing process.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;P&gt;&lt;IMG src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150974/EN_150974_05.jpg"&gt;&lt;/P&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Treat yourself to comfort&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The razor has a replaceable 1800 mAh polymer-lithium battery that provides up to 7 hours of operation (depending on the power setting) and a built-in USB-C port for quick and easy charging. The kit comes with an extra battery and an RCA adapter that allows the razor to be used traditionally on a cable.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;P&gt;&lt;IMG src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150974/EN_150974_06.jpg"&gt;&lt;/P&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Comfort first&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The device is equipped with a color digital LED display with the ability to change colors (blue, green, pink, red, teal, white, yellow) and rotate the layout from vertical to horizontal. Such a solution will certainly facilitate work and affect the comfort of use according to personal preferences. Operation is extremely easy thanks to three buttons. The interface is simple and intuitive. It shows information such as battery level, current voltage and frequency, operating time and one of the three selected modes (M1, M2, M3), which you can save thanks to the built-in memory.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;P&gt;&lt;IMG src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150974/EN_150974_07.jpg"&gt;&lt;/P&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Bet on design and functionality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Our VISPA rotary razors work on the basis of an electric motor that sets the needle in motion. Such an application makes the work quiet and, above all, smooth, giving the possibility of both accurate contouring, perfect shading and filling larger areas of the tattoo. Their versatility is not all - they are made of high quality materials, are comfortable to use, light and efficient, making them an uncompromising product of this type on the market.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set includes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;1x DEVICE&lt;br&gt;2x GRIPS&lt;br&gt;2x BATTERIES&lt;br&gt;1x RCA ADAPTER&lt;br&gt;1x USB-C / USB-A CABLE&lt;br&gt;1x RCA-CINCH / JACK 6.35 mm CABLE&lt;br&gt;2x IMBUS KEYS&lt;br&gt;1x INSTRUCTIONS&lt;br&gt;1x BOX&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;PRODUCER: EL CARTEL&lt;br&gt;TYPE: rotary&lt;br&gt;APPLICATION: universal / on cartridge&lt;br&gt;MATERIAL: aluminum&lt;br&gt;COLOR: shades of black&lt;br&gt;DEVICE WEIGHT: 165 g&lt;br&gt;BATTERY WEIGHT: 60 g&lt;br&gt;GRIP WIDTH: 60 g&lt;br&gt;MOTOR TYPE: coreless&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;OPERATING VOLTAGE: 4-12 V DC&lt;br&gt;STARTING VOLTAGE: 0.3 seconds at 9 V&lt;br&gt;STROKE: adjustable&lt;br&gt;STROKE VALUE: 2.4 / 2.7 / 3.0 / 3.3 / 3.6 / 3.9 / 4.2 mm&lt;br&gt;BATTERY TYPE: polymer-lithium.&lt;br&gt;CHARGING: built-in USB-C type jack&lt;br&gt;CHARGING TIME: up to 60 minutes&lt;br&gt;BATTERY LIFE: up to 7 hours&lt;br&gt;BUILT IN MEMORY: ability to store 3 POWER MODES (M1 / M2 / M3)&lt;br&gt;BUILT IN LED DISPLAY in English&lt;br&gt;WARRANTY: 12 months&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>264.03</price>
<category_subcategory>Tattoo studio equipment&gt;Tattoo Machine</category_subcategory>
