<name>4Rico swivel chair QS-BL12G black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/151018/EN_151018_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;4Rico &lt;/strong&gt;furniture combines functionality and comfort. The hockers and make-up chairs available in their offer are distinguished by a wide selection of patterns, colors and upholstery materials. They will be a sophisticated accent of any space – both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/151018/EN_151018_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stylish chair with a unique style&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The elegant&lt;strong&gt; 4Rico QS-BL12B chair&lt;/strong&gt;, upholstered in a pleasant-to-the-touch fabric with decorative quilting, &lt;strong&gt;will fit perfectly into unique interiors&lt;/strong&gt;. The furniture is distinguished by its timeless elegance and &lt;strong&gt;is extremely versatile&lt;/strong&gt;. Perfect for specialist salons, beauty and nail salons, offices and elegant reception area. It will also be perfect for home use,&lt;strong&gt; adding a sophisticated touch to the interior&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/151018/EN_151018_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant adjustment possibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The chair is equipped with &lt;strong&gt;a full rotation mechanism&lt;/strong&gt;, which significantly affects the ergonomics of work. &lt;strong&gt;The efficient gas lift&lt;/strong&gt; allows for easy adjustment of the seat height &lt;strong&gt;within 42-52 cm&lt;/strong&gt;. This allows the chair to be tailored to individual needs and the services performed, thus&lt;strong&gt; increasing work efficiency&lt;/strong&gt; – regardless of the activities performed. The profiled backrest &lt;strong&gt;provides adequate back support&lt;/strong&gt;, which guarantees high comfort of use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/151018/EN_151018_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elegance and comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The luxurious finish&lt;/strong&gt; makes the furniture eye-catching. The pleasant-to-the-touch, velvet upholstery in shades of black and decorative quilting give it &lt;strong&gt;a unique character&lt;/strong&gt;. A stable, round base in shades of black &lt;strong&gt;adds elegance&lt;/strong&gt;, perfectly matching the velvet. Aesthetics of workmanship, comfort of use, ergonomically profiled backrest and aesthetic quilting make the chair&lt;strong&gt; meet the requirements of even the most demanding users&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/151018/EN_151018_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The exact dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes:&lt;/strong&gt; seat, base with actuator, assembly kit.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: velvet&lt;br&gt;Actuator: gas lift&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Base color: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;</description>
