<description>&lt;p style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:15px;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;'&gt;EL CARTEL was established to provide high quality needles for most demanding tattoo artists. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:15px;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUALITY MATTERS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; Thanks to new technology , high quality materials and very strict quality control - EL CARTEL created next-gen tattoo cartridges .&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:15px;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;'&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SAFETY FIRST&lt;/strong&gt;. For safety and hygienic reasons EL CARTEL uses elastic and durable membranes in cartridges to prevent any leakage from ink or blood to machine .&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:15px;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;'&gt;New shape of tube helps to store more ink leading to increased efficiency&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:15px;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;'&gt;Thanks to high quality materials our needles guarantee smooth ink injection and remains sharp during long tattoo sessions.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;margin-left:0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:15px;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;'&gt;All cartridges are sterile with shelf life time up to 5 years. These cartridges work with any machine with cartridge grip.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
