<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150119/EN_150119_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;4Rico&lt;/strong&gt; brand furniture combines functionality and comfort. The hockers and makeup chairs available in their offer are distinguished by a wide selection of patterns, colors, and upholstery materials. They will be a sophisticated accent to any space – both in professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150119/EN_150119_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An Elegant Element of the Beauty Salon&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hocker 4Rico QS-B15&lt;/strong&gt; combines high quality with functionality and &lt;strong&gt;impresses with its luxurious design&lt;/strong&gt;. It will be perfect for services such as makeup or eyebrow styling. It will also be an elegant element of the reception desk in a beauty salon, &lt;strong&gt;emphasizing the exclusive character of the interior&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150119/EN_150119_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Height Adjustment with a Gas Lift&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;solid gas lift&lt;/strong&gt; allows easy and smooth height adjustment &lt;strong&gt;within 60-80 cm&lt;/strong&gt; and guarantees safety of use. This enables you to &lt;strong&gt;easily adjust the furniture to individual needs&lt;/strong&gt; and the treatments being performed, ensuring &lt;strong&gt;high comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt; – whether for makeup, eyebrow styling, or other activities.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150119/EN_150119_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features for Comfort of Use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The furniture is equipped with &lt;strong&gt;ergonomic foot support&lt;/strong&gt; and a properly contoured backrest. These features provide &lt;strong&gt;excellent body support&lt;/strong&gt;, which reduces muscle tension, allowing for long and pleasant beauty sessions. Additionally, the &lt;strong&gt;free rotation of the hocker&lt;/strong&gt; allows easy position changes, significantly increasing work efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150119/EN_150119_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stylish Finish&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The hocker is distinguished by &lt;strong&gt;pleasant-to-touch velvet upholstery&lt;/strong&gt; in shades of pink, which gives it an exclusive character. The &lt;strong&gt;round base with non-slip rubber&lt;/strong&gt; ensures stability, while the &lt;strong&gt;minimalistic design&lt;/strong&gt; allows it to fit perfectly into any interior. The golden base adds elegance, harmoniously matching the velvet material. Thanks to the &lt;strong&gt;ergonomic shape of the seat and backrest&lt;/strong&gt; and adjustable height, this hocker is an ideal choice for those who appreciate style and comfort.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The exact dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; Gold elements are lacquered. Mechanical damage to the coating is not subject to complaint.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cylinder: gas&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: velvet&lt;br&gt;Color of upholstery: shades of pink&lt;br&gt;Frame color: shades of gold&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>75.20</price>
