<item>
<sku>150181</sku>
<name>Roll Speed stool wheel black press-on set of 5 pieces</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;For many years, the &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVESHOP&lt;/strong&gt; brand has been offering a wide range of products that work well for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150181/EN_150181_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical set of wheels&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Single Roll Speed casters&lt;/strong&gt; guarantee comfortable use. Professional ABEC-7 class bearings make the wheels &lt;strong&gt;move extremely smoothly&lt;/strong&gt;, which allows easy maneuvering of stools and cosmetic aids. The product is ideal for salons &lt;strong&gt;requiring reliable&lt;/strong&gt; and aesthetic accessories.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150181/EN_150181_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid construction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The set in shades of black not only looks elegant but also stands out for its exceptional build quality and functionality. Casters with iron core and PU coating ensure not only smooth movement but also high resistance to intensive use, which translates into trouble-free use for a long time.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;5 pieces included.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Bearings: ABEC-7&lt;br&gt;Material: PU, iron&lt;br&gt;Color: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;  </description>
<price>16.26</price>
