<item>
<sku>150186</sku>
<name>Rain shower mixer</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150186/EN_150186_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano&lt;/strong&gt; is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality, and aesthetics of workmanship and high comfort of use. It offers a wide selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, hairdressing washers, and infrazons.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150186/EN_150186_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An indispensable part of a hairdresser's wash station&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The mixer rain shower faucet&lt;/strong&gt;, designed for hairdressing salons, is an indispensable part of professional salon equipment. It facilitates &lt;strong&gt;convenient connection of water to the wash station&lt;/strong&gt; and provides comfort to both the hairdresser and the client. Thanks to the included steel-braided connection hoses, the faucet is characterized by &lt;strong&gt;high durability and resistance to abrasion&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150186/EN_150186_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Two modes of operation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The faucet is equipped with &lt;strong&gt;two handsets&lt;/strong&gt;, providing versatility of use. The classic showerhead is ideal for standard hair washing, &lt;strong&gt;providing a precise stream of water&lt;/strong&gt;. The rain shower, on the other hand, offers a &lt;strong&gt;wide, even stream&lt;/strong&gt; that gently but effectively rinses the hair, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring customer comfort&lt;/strong&gt; during washing.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150186/EN_150186_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elegant design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The Gabbiano rain shower faucet is available in an elegant &lt;strong&gt;black and chrome finish&lt;/strong&gt;, making it suitable for &lt;strong&gt;modern and stylish salon interiors&lt;/strong&gt;. The standard faucet is designed to be installed at the bowl of a hairdresser's basin and is &lt;strong&gt;compatible with most models available on the market&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Colors: shades of black and chrome&lt;/p&gt;  </description>
<price>81.30</price>
