<item>
<sku>150187</sku>
<name>Waterfall Battery</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150187/EN_150187_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano&lt;/strong&gt; is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship and high comfort of use. It offers a wide selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, hairdressing washers and infrazons.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150187/EN_150187_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An indispensable part of a hairdresser's wash station&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Waterfall faucet&lt;/strong&gt; with mixer, designed for hairdressing washers, is an indispensable part of professional salon equipment. It facilitates convenient connection of water to the car wash and provides comfort to both the hairdresser and the client. Thanks to the included steel braided connection hoses, the faucet is characterized by &lt;strong&gt;high durability and resistance to abrasion&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150187/EN_150187_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Two modes of operation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The mixer is equipped with &lt;strong&gt;two handsets&lt;/strong&gt;, providing versatility of use. The classic shower handset, ideal for standard hair washing, provides a &lt;strong&gt;precise and even stream of water&lt;/strong&gt;. Enriched with &lt;strong&gt;tourmaline beads with filtration and adsorption properties&lt;/strong&gt;, it offers extra protection for hair and scalp. On the other hand, the waterfall handset with an opening of 16 cm provides a &lt;strong&gt;wide stream of water&lt;/strong&gt; that is gentle yet effective, &lt;strong&gt;guaranteeing exceptional comfort&lt;/strong&gt; when washing hair.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150187/EN_150187_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elegant design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The Gabbiano waterfall faucet is available in an &lt;strong&gt;elegant finish in shades of black and chrome&lt;/strong&gt;. Its stylish design blends in perfectly with modern hair salon interiors. The standard size allows for &lt;strong&gt;easy installation&lt;/strong&gt; at the bowl of the hairdressing basin and is &lt;strong&gt;compatible with most models available on the market&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Colors: shades of black and chrome&lt;/p&gt;  </description>
