<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/149712/EN_149712_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano&lt;/strong&gt; is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality, and aesthetics of workmanship and high comfort of use. It offers a wide selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, hairdressing washers, and infrazons.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/149712/EN_149712_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical solution for hairdressing salons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hairdresser’s helper Gabbiano Trix&lt;/strong&gt; is an elegant and functional piece of furniture that &lt;strong&gt;facilitates work organization&lt;/strong&gt; in a hairdressing salon. Equipped with &lt;strong&gt;two capacious drawers and an open shelf&lt;/strong&gt;, it allows convenient storage of necessary products and tools. On the upper part, there are &lt;strong&gt;two holders for a hairdryer&lt;/strong&gt; – suitable for most models available on the market – or other equipment, providing easy access to the tools during services.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/149712/EN_149712_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stylish design and durability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;modern black design with a matte finish&lt;/strong&gt; makes the helper an &lt;strong&gt;eye-catcher&lt;/strong&gt; and a perfect match for elegant, professional interiors. &lt;strong&gt;Polished metal elements in shades of gold and a solid wood panel construction in shades of black&lt;/strong&gt; highlight the elegance of the interior. The golden legs not only add style but also &lt;strong&gt;make it easy to keep the unit clean underneath&lt;/strong&gt;, which is essential in every professional salon.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/149712/EN_149712_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The exact dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;Gold elements are lacquered. Mechanical damage to the coating is not subject to complaint.&lt;br&gt;Color: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;  </description>
