 plastic sheath that keeps the blades of the tool joined together after use. This allows the scissors to be stored safely and prevents dulling.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warning.&lt;/strong&gt; Store in a dry and safe place. Keep out of the reach of children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade length: 20 mm&lt;br&gt;Diameter of handle opening: 1,6-2,5 cm&lt;br&gt;Total length: 102,5 mm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
