<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA &lt;/strong&gt;offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools, which significantly enhance the daily lives of beauty customers. The brand's aim is to effectively meet the needs of consumers by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150205/EN_150205_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Precision manicure accessory&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA KD.43 professional cosmetic scissors&lt;/strong&gt; will prove themselves during various beauty treatments, including manicures and cutting cuticles.&lt;strong&gt; The ergonomic shape ensures comfortable use&lt;/strong&gt;, so the tool will find its use both in beauty salons and in home beauticians.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;High working comfort&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The slim, slightly curved 22 mm long blades&lt;/strong&gt; ensure smooth and precise cutting, making it easy to access even those hard to reach areas. This makes the tool &lt;strong&gt;ideal for carefully trimming the cuticles around the nails&lt;/strong&gt; for a professional result. The sturdy riveted joint, decorated with a subtle ornament on one side &lt;strong&gt;, increases stability and enables smooth, comfortable use,&lt;/strong&gt; which further enhances the convenience of work. The tool significantly improves the quality of the treatment, &lt;strong&gt;making it more effective and satisfying&lt;/strong&gt; for both professionals and clients.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150205/EN_150205_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Durability and functionality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The asymmetrical positioning of the finger holes &lt;strong&gt;provides comfort and ergonomics&lt;/strong&gt; when working, adapting to the natural hand layout. The smooth, polished finish &lt;strong&gt;makes it easy to keep the tool clean&lt;/strong&gt;, which is key to maintaining the highest standards of hygiene. The scissors are made &lt;strong&gt;from high quality stainless steel&lt;/strong&gt;, making them extremely durable and resistant to damage and dulling. They are fully &lt;strong&gt;autoclavable&lt;/strong&gt;. An additional advantage is the flexible blade sheath, which keeps the blades together after use. This allows the scissors to be stored safely while protecting the blades from damage and dulling. The entire product &lt;strong&gt;is packaged in an elegant, magnetic packaging&lt;/strong&gt; that emphasises the professional nature of the product.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warning.&lt;/strong&gt; Store in a dry and safe place. Keep out of the reach of children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/6OeLYXEV-0g" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade length: 22 mm&lt;br&gt;Diameter of handle opening: 1,9-2,5 cm&lt;br&gt;Total length: 108 mm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
