<item>
<sku>150206</sku>
<name>Nghia export cuticle NIPPERS CL.209 12mm</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA &lt;/strong&gt;offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools, which significantly enhance the daily lives of beauty customers. The brand's aim is to effectively meet the needs of consumers by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150206/EN_150206_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Precision tool for perfect cuticles&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The NGHIA Export CL.209 professional cuticle nippers&lt;/strong&gt; with long blades are made of high-quality stainless steel, making them &lt;strong&gt;highly resistant to damage and dulling&lt;/strong&gt;. They are perfect for manicure and pedicure, especially for cutting cuticles. The nippers &lt;strong&gt;are suitable for sterilisation in the autoclave&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Solutions for high working comfort&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A double spring&lt;/strong&gt; connects the arms of the nippers, ensuring excellent feel and precision cutting. Its careful design allows for &lt;strong&gt;comfortable, quiet and smooth operation&lt;/strong&gt;. The way it is shaped and the size of the arms ensure that &lt;strong&gt;the nippers lie firmly in the hand&lt;/strong&gt;, guaranteeing complete comfort of use. The matt finish makes them look elegant, and the passivated surface makes them more resistant and &lt;strong&gt;easier to keep clean&lt;/strong&gt;. This makes them the ideal tool for both professionals and lovers of nail care at home.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150206/EN_150206_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Perfectly shaped blades&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The 12mm long blades&lt;/strong&gt; are perfect for intricate manicure treatments. The straight bevel profile and the right size make it easy to carry out intricate treatments. The jaws of the nippers are joined using the &lt;strong&gt;Lap Joint&lt;/strong&gt; method, so they make perfect contact during use, ensuring an accurate cut. The nippers have a matching blade guard made of durable plastic.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Maintenance:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;- After use, remove cuticle, dust, nail residue with acetone;&lt;br&gt;- Dip the tool in disinfectant liquid;&lt;br&gt;- Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil;&lt;br&gt;- Apply a cover to protect the tool from chipping;&lt;br&gt;- Never put the nippers with the blade facing downwards;&lt;br&gt;- Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Caution.&lt;/strong&gt; Store in a dry and safe place. Keep out of the reach of children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade length: 12 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length of nippers: 12 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
