<sku>150211</sku>
<name>Nghia export angle podiatric metal file P-15</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA &lt;/strong&gt;offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools that significantly enhance the daily lives of beauty customers. The brand's aim is to effectively meet the needs of consumers by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150211/EN_150211_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Practical nail tool&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The multifunctional&lt;strong&gt; double-sided NGHIA P-15 angle podiatric file for ingrown nail with file&lt;/strong&gt; is a practical tool that is perfect for both podiatrists and beauty salons. It enables &lt;strong&gt;effective care of ingrown toenails&lt;/strong&gt;, removal of dead skin and precise modelling of the nail plate. The tool is distinguished by &lt;strong&gt;its extraordinary functionality and careful workmanship&lt;/strong&gt;, which guarantees reliability during even the most demanding treatments.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;How to use the ingrown nail file?&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The probe has &lt;strong&gt;two functional tips with files&lt;/strong&gt; of different shapes, which can be used as required.&lt;br&gt;- &lt;strong&gt;The elongated straight file&lt;/strong&gt; is perfect for smoothing the edges of the nail and gently removing calluses without disturbing the structure of the plate.&lt;br&gt;- &lt;strong&gt;The file with a slightly curved tip&lt;/strong&gt; makes it easier to clean hard-to-reach areas and to shape ingrown nails.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150211/EN_150211_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Functional and aesthetic&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The grooving on the surface of the handle&lt;/strong&gt; provides a secure and stable grip, preventing the tool from slipping during precision work. The aesthetically pleasing design of the probe, with attention to detail, gives the tool a professional appearance that fits perfectly with the standards of modern surgeries. The tool is made &lt;strong&gt;from high-quality stainless steel&lt;/strong&gt;, making it durable, damage-resistant and easy to keep clean. &lt;strong&gt;It can be sterilised in an autoclave&lt;/strong&gt;, making it an ideal choice for repeated use in professional settings.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Overall length: 16 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
