<item>
<sku>150212</sku>
<name>Nghia export metal podiatry probe P-17</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA &lt;/strong&gt;offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools, that significantly enhance the daily lives of beauty customers. The brand's aim is to effectively meet the needs of consumers by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150212/EN_150212_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;A practical tool in podiatry and cosmetology&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The multifunctional &lt;strong&gt;podiatry probe NGHIA P-17&lt;/strong&gt; is a reliable tool that is perfect for both podiatry surgeries and beauty salons. It enables &lt;strong&gt;effective care of problem nails&lt;/strong&gt;, their cleaning and precise application of tamponade. Equipped with a thin, curved working tip, the probe is ideal for removing dead cells from under the free edge of the nail and from peri-nail shafts. &lt;strong&gt;It is distinguished by its high functionality and precise&lt;/strong&gt; workmanship, which guarantee comfort and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;How to use the nail probe?&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The double-sided podiatry probe is a &lt;strong&gt;precise and multifunctional tool&lt;/strong&gt;, ideal for working on hard-to-reach areas at the nail. The curved tips are designed to &lt;strong&gt;clean the space under the nail&lt;/strong&gt;, care for peri-nail shafts, remove debris and &lt;strong&gt;apply tamponade&lt;/strong&gt;. The tips, which are curved in different directions, provide &lt;strong&gt;versatility and precision&lt;/strong&gt;, perfect for specialist podiatry treatments.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150212/EN_150212_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Functionality and aesthetics&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The grooving on the surface of the handle&lt;/strong&gt; provides a secure and stable grip, preventing the tool from slipping during precision treatments. The aesthetically pleasing design of the hoof, with attention to detail, gives the tool a professional appearance that fits perfectly with the standards of modern surgeries. The tool is made &lt;strong&gt;from high-quality stainless steel&lt;/strong&gt;, making it durable, damage-resistant and easy to keep clean. &lt;strong&gt;It can be autoclaved for sterilisation&lt;/strong&gt;, making it an ideal choice for repeated use in professional settings.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Overall length: 15 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
