<item>
<sku>150225</sku>
<name>Nghia export nail nippers N-111</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA &lt;/strong&gt;offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools, which significantly enhance the daily lives of beauty customers. The brand's aim is to effectively meet the needs of consumers by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150225/EN_150225_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Precision tools for perfect nails&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The&lt;strong&gt; NGHIA Export N-111&lt;/strong&gt; professional&lt;strong&gt; nail nippers&lt;/strong&gt; are made of high-quality carbon steel, making them practical and durable. They are perfect for manicures and pedicures, especially &lt;strong&gt;for shortening the nail plate&lt;/strong&gt;. The nail nippers can be disinfected at low temperatures.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Solutions for high working comfort&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A single spring&lt;/strong&gt; connects the arms of the nippers, ensuring &lt;strong&gt;feel and precision cutting&lt;/strong&gt;. The careful design of the spring allows for &lt;strong&gt;comfortable work&lt;/strong&gt;. The shape and size of the arms ensure that the nippers lie firmly in the hand, &lt;strong&gt;guaranteeing comfortable use&lt;/strong&gt;. The polished finish makes them look elegant, and the chrome-plated surface increases their resistance and makes them &lt;strong&gt;easy to keep clean&lt;/strong&gt;. This makes them the ideal tool for both professionals and home nail care.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150225/EN_150225_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Perfectly shaped blades&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The 14mm long blades&lt;/strong&gt; are perfect for intricate manicure treatments. The bevel &lt;strong&gt;profile&lt;/strong&gt; and the right size make it easy to perform intricate treatments. The jaws of the nippers are joined by the &lt;strong&gt;Lap Joint&lt;/strong&gt; method, so that they make perfect contact during use, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring an accurate cut&lt;/strong&gt;. The nippers have a matching blade guard made of durable plastic.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Maintenance:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;- After use, remove cuticle, dust, nail residue with acetone;&lt;br&gt;- Dip the tool in disinfectant liquid;&lt;br&gt;- Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil;&lt;br&gt;- Apply a cover to protect the tool from chipping;&lt;br&gt;- Never put the nippers with the blade facing downwards;&lt;br&gt;- Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Caution.&lt;/strong&gt; Store in a dry and safe place. Keep out of the reach of children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade length: 14 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length of nippers: 11.5 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: carbon steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
