ake perfect contact during use, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring an accurate cut&lt;/strong&gt;. The nippers have a matching blade guard made of durable plastic.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Maintenance:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;- After use, remove cuticle, dust, nail residue with acetone;&lt;br&gt;- Dip the tool in disinfectant liquid;&lt;br&gt;- Lubricate the inside of the blade with machine oil;&lt;br&gt;- Apply a cover to protect the tool from chipping;&lt;br&gt;- Never put the nippers with the blade facing downwards;&lt;br&gt;- Always store in a horizontal position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Caution.&lt;/strong&gt; Store in a dry and safe place. Keep out of the reach of children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade length: 13 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length of nippers: 11.5 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: carbon steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
