<name>Nghia export tweezers N-425 RED</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA &lt;/strong&gt;offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools that significantly enhance the daily lives of beauty customers. The brand's aim is to effectively meet the needs of consumers by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150234/EN_150234_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Precision tool&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The elegant &lt;strong&gt;NGHIA N.425 angled tweezers&lt;/strong&gt; are made of high-quality stainless steel, which makes the tweezers &lt;strong&gt;durable and dull-resistant&lt;/strong&gt;, as well as suitable for disinfection and autoclave sterilisation. It is ideal for cosmetic procedures &lt;strong&gt;requiring precision&lt;/strong&gt;, such as eyebrow adjustment. Removing unwanted hair with these tweezers will be a pleasure both in the beauty salon and at home.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Comfortable to work with&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The narrow gripping surface makes the tool &lt;strong&gt;very precise&lt;/strong&gt; - using it you can easily reach the unwanted hair. The carefully shaped arms with non-slip elements guarantee &lt;strong&gt;comfortable and precise manoeuvring&lt;/strong&gt;, while the bevelled blade ensures versatility - &lt;strong&gt;allowing you to comfortably grip even the finest hairs&lt;/strong&gt; and shape your eyebrows with precision. The stylish design of the tweezers, with a metallic finish in shades of red, gives the tool &lt;strong&gt;an elegant and unique character&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150234/EN_150234_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Durability and functionality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The tweezers are equipped with &lt;strong&gt;a practical stopper&lt;/strong&gt; that keeps the arms of the tool joined together after use. This ensures safe storage and &lt;strong&gt;protects the tips from accidental damage&lt;/strong&gt; or dulling. In this way, the tweezers retain their precision and effectiveness for longer and their use remains &lt;strong&gt;comfortable and reliable&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dimensions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tip width: 3 mm&lt;br&gt;Length of tweezers: 9 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;br&gt;Colour: shades of red&lt;/p&gt;</description>
