<item>
<sku>150241</sku>
<name>Nghia export metal hoof P-12</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA &lt;/strong&gt;offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools, which significantly enhance the daily lives of beauty customers. The brand's aim is to effectively meet the needs of consumers by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150241/EN_150241_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Practical nail tool&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The multifunctional double-sided NGHIA P-12 hoof&lt;/strong&gt; is a great tool that will prove its worth during manicure and pedicure treatments. Among the most important functions of this universal tool, you &lt;strong&gt;can push back cuticles or remove remnants of previous nail styling&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;How to use the cuticle helper?&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The cuticle hoof has &lt;strong&gt;two functional tips&lt;/strong&gt; with different shapes, used as required.&lt;br&gt;- &lt;strong&gt;The rounded narrow spatula&lt;/strong&gt; is perfect for pushing back cuticles. Its small size will also allow you to reach the harder-to-reach areas. The profiled tip is ground in such a way as to remove the cuticle effectively without damaging the nail plate.&lt;br&gt;- &lt;strong&gt;The cutter&lt;/strong&gt;, on the other hand, perfectly removes cuticles from the sides of the nail. The good profiling facilitates efficient and precise work.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150241/EN_150241_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Functional and aesthetic&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The grooving on the surface of the handle&lt;/strong&gt; provides a secure and stable grip, preventing the tool from slipping during precision work. &lt;strong&gt;The aesthetic design of the hoof&lt;/strong&gt; pick, with attention to detail, gives the tool a professional appearance that fits perfectly with the standards of modern surgeries. The tool is made&lt;strong&gt; from high-quality stainless steel&lt;/strong&gt;, making it durable, damage-resistant and easy to keep clean.&lt;strong&gt; It can be sterilised in an autoclave&lt;/strong&gt;, making it an ideal choice for repeated use in professional settings.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/g5g6QTZVrdE" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Blade width: 7 mm&lt;br&gt;Blade width: 13 mm&lt;br&gt;Overall length: 13,5 cm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>5.89</price>
<category_subcategory>Podiatry&gt;Tools and accessories&gt;NGHIA</category_subcategory>
