<item>
<sku>150243</sku>
<name>Nghia export metal hoof P-14</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA &lt;/strong&gt;offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools, that significantly enhance the daily lives of beauty customers. The brand's aim is to effectively meet the needs of consumers by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150243/EN_150243_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Practical nail tool&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The multifunctional&lt;strong&gt; double-sided NGHIA P-14 hoof&lt;/strong&gt; is a great tool that will prove its worth during manicure and pedicure treatments. The most important functions of this universal tool include &lt;strong&gt;pushing back cuticles or removal of remnants of previous nail styling&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;How to use the cuticle helper?&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The cuticle hoof has &lt;strong&gt;two functional tips &lt;/strong&gt;with different shapes, used as required.&lt;br&gt;-&lt;strong&gt; The cuticle cutter&lt;/strong&gt; perfectly removes cuticles from the sides of the nail. Its good contouring facilitates efficient and precise work.&lt;br&gt;- &lt;strong&gt;The hoof pick &lt;/strong&gt;, on the other hand, is perfect for removing cuticles from the sides of the nail. The good contouring facilitates efficient and precise work.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150243/EN_150243_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Functional and aesthetic&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The grooving on the surface of the handle&lt;/strong&gt; provides a secure and stable grip, preventing the tool from slipping during precision work. The aesthetic design of the hoof, with attention to detail, gives the tool a professional appearance that fits perfectly with the standards of modern surgeries. The tool is made &lt;strong&gt;from high-quality stainless steel&lt;/strong&gt;, making it durable, damage-resistant and easy to keep clean. &lt;strong&gt;It can be sterilised in an autoclave&lt;/strong&gt;, making it an ideal choice for repeated use in professional settings.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/BL9ivIzoXV8" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Blade width: 13 mm&lt;br&gt;Hoof width: 4 mm&lt;br&gt;Overall length: 14 cm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
