<item>
<sku>150244</sku>
<name>Nghia export nail clipper B.999</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA &lt;/strong&gt;offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools, that significantly enhance the daily lives of beauty customers. The brand's aim is to effectively meet the needs of consumers by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150244/EN_150244_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Handy tool&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The practical&lt;strong&gt; NGHIA B.999 nail clipper&lt;/strong&gt; is a small, elegant tool that is suitable for both the beauty salon and the home beautician. It is used to cut fingernails and toenails, and thanks to &lt;strong&gt;the contoured blade&lt;/strong&gt;, the nail gets a smooth edge after cutting. The handy dimensions, ergonomic shape and contoured blades ensure &lt;strong&gt;precision work&lt;/strong&gt; and make it much easier to reach hard-to-reach areas.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Comprehensive nail care&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The curved blade adapts perfectly to the natural curve of the nail&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing you to quickly and effectively create the correct length. Thanks to the carefully designed joints, the tool &lt;strong&gt;runs smoothly&lt;/strong&gt;. The nail clipper is distinguished by its ergonomic shape, which ensures a comfortable grip and precision during use. &lt;strong&gt;The handy design&lt;/strong&gt; makes the clipper easy to store and perfect for daily care.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150244/EN_150244_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Durability and functionality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The product is made &lt;strong&gt;of high-quality stainless steel&lt;/strong&gt;, which provides exceptional resistance to damage and dulling. &lt;strong&gt;It is suitable for autoclave sterilisation&lt;/strong&gt;, making it hygienic and safe to use. The smooth, semi-matte finish in gold tones gives it &lt;strong&gt;a unique look&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Attention. Store in a dry and safe place. Keep out of the reach of children.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Details:&lt;br&gt;Blade width: 11 mm&lt;br&gt;Overall length: 8 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;br&gt;Colour: shades of gold&lt;/p&gt;</description>
