<item>
<sku>150936</sku>
<name>Nghia kit for schools</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150936/EN_150936_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA &lt;/strong&gt;offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools, which significantly enhance the daily lives of beauty customers. The brand's aim is to effectively meet the needs of consumers by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150936/EN_150936_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Perfect manicure set&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The NGHIA professional manicure kit&lt;/strong&gt; is a set of tools that will provide excellent results when preparing the nail plate. It consists of &lt;strong&gt;precise cuticle nipper and a versatile hoof&lt;/strong&gt;, which is the perfect combination of functionality, quality and style. The entire set is packaged in &lt;strong&gt;a luxurious magnet-lockable box&lt;/strong&gt;. This is not only a practical way to store the tools, but also a unique piece that makes the set perfect for a gift.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150936/EN_150936_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Tools for comprehensive cuticle preparation&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The nippers are designed for &lt;strong&gt;easy and safe cuticle removal&lt;/strong&gt;. Their ergonomic shape provides a comfortable grip, while the extremely sharp blades allow for &lt;strong&gt;precise cutting without the risk of damaging the skin&lt;/strong&gt;. Made from high-quality stainless steel, they are &lt;strong&gt;corrosion-resistant and easy to disinfect&lt;/strong&gt;. The double-sided hoof is a versatile tool that allows &lt;strong&gt;both gentle pushing back of cuticles and their effective removal&lt;/strong&gt;. One tip is a rounded pusher, ideal for &lt;strong&gt;shaping and pushing back cuticles without irritation&lt;/strong&gt;. On the other side is the tip in the form of a bevelled triangular cutter, which allows you to &lt;strong&gt;precisely remove stubborn, keratinised sections of the epidermis&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150936/EN_150936_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;High quality and functionality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Made from the highest quality stainless steel, both tools are characterised by&lt;strong&gt; durability and resistance &lt;/strong&gt;to intensive use. They can be sterilised in an autoclave, making them&lt;strong&gt; an ideal choice&lt;/strong&gt; in professional settings. The ergonomic design makes them &lt;strong&gt;comfortable and convenient to&lt;/strong&gt; work with, even during long procedures.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nippers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Blade length: 5 mm&lt;br&gt;Total length of the pliers: 11 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hoof:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Length: 12,5 cm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;/p&gt;</description>
