<item>
<sku>150919</sku>
<name>Ocho Hoof Pick with Eyelet</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OCHO PRO&lt;/strong&gt; is a unique brand that produces high-quality, innovative and best-in-class tools for the beauty industry. The offer includes products such as specialised tweezers, hoof picks and nippers. The brand's mission is to create and continuously improve accessories that help in performing treatments and daily care.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150919/EN_150919_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Specialist manicure tool&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The multifunctional double-sided &lt;strong&gt;OCHO PRO hoof pick with eyelet&lt;/strong&gt; is a practical tool that will &lt;strong&gt;prove useful during manicure and pedicure treatments&lt;/strong&gt;. Among the most important functions of this universal tool are &lt;strong&gt;pushing back cuticles or removing remnants of previous nail styling&lt;/strong&gt;. Thanks to high-quality materials, the tool &lt;strong&gt;can be safely sterilized in an autoclave&lt;/strong&gt;, which guarantees full hygiene during use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;How to use the hoof pick?&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The hoof pick is equipped &lt;strong&gt;with two precise tips&lt;/strong&gt; of different shapes:&lt;br&gt;• &lt;strong&gt;The rounded hoof&lt;/strong&gt; designed to push back cuticles and gently lift them ensures efficient and precise work.&lt;br&gt;• The precise &lt;strong&gt;ring-shaped eyelet&lt;/strong&gt; allows for precise cleaning of the space between the nail and the cuticles and removal of small imperfections.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150919/EN_150919_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Functionality and aesthetics&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The tool stands out not only for its functionality, but also for its aesthetic design. &lt;strong&gt;The grooved handle&lt;/strong&gt; prevents the tool from slipping in the hand, which increases comfort and safety of work. The use of stainless steel makes the hoover &lt;strong&gt;resistant to dulling, durable and easy to keep clean&lt;/strong&gt;. This is an excellent choice for people who value quality, precision and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Total length: 14,3 cm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
