<item>
<sku>152023</sku>
<name>Splitter adapter for remote control and foot controller of the KATE cosmetic chair</name>
<description>&lt;h2&gt;Convenient control of chairs with foot drive&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The splitter adapter&lt;/strong&gt; enables the connection of an additional foot drive (available in our offer &lt;a href="https://activeshop.com.pl/eng/foot-drive-for-kate-and-basic-4-motors.html"&gt;under the code 133026&lt;/a&gt;) to Kate podiatry chairs. It provides &lt;strong&gt;convenient control of the chair's functions&lt;/strong&gt; using both the remote control and the foot drive, increasing the comfort of use in cosmetic and podiatry salons. &lt;strong&gt;An ideal option for expanding the existing control system&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Thoughtful design&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The cables are approximately 150 cm long each, which gives &lt;strong&gt;a total length of over 3 meters&lt;/strong&gt;. The construction of the cable &lt;strong&gt;has been designed in a thoughtful way&lt;/strong&gt; – there is a connection at the central point, from which three sections spread: two in one direction (to the foot drive and remote control) and one in the opposite direction (to the chair). &lt;strong&gt;Each section is terminated with a dedicated plug&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Cable length: 3,2 m&lt;/p&gt;</description>
