<item>
<sku>148135</sku>
<name>Codos cordless hair trimmer CHC-318 BARBER MASTER</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148135/EN_148135_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Codos &lt;/strong&gt;brand offers practical hair clippers, blades and attachments. It focuses on stylish, handy cordless models that guarantee considerable freedom and ease of use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148135/EN_148135_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Handy hair trimmer&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Codos CHC-318 BARBER MASTER cordless hair trimmer&lt;/strong&gt; ensures comfort of work and ease of achieving a perfect hairstyle. Thanks to its &lt;strong&gt;simple operation and ergonomic design&lt;/strong&gt;, the device is suitable for both professional hairdressing salons and home use. &lt;strong&gt;It ensures comfort of work&lt;/strong&gt; and facilitates the creation of perfect hairstyles.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148135/EN_148135_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Functionalities for ease of use&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The hair clipper has been designed&lt;strong&gt; for maximum user convenience&lt;/strong&gt;. The fixed metal blade covered with titanium is distinguished by &lt;strong&gt;exceptional durability and precision&lt;/strong&gt;, while minimising the risk of skin irritation. The device allows for&lt;strong&gt; smooth adjustment of the blade speed on two levels – 6000 rpm and 7000 rpm&lt;/strong&gt; – using an ergonomic slider placed within the reach of the thumb, which allows for an intuitive change of the operating mode. &lt;strong&gt;The built-in screen&lt;/strong&gt; informs about the battery charge level and the selected speed, &lt;strong&gt;providing full control over the device&lt;/strong&gt; and reminding you to charge at the right time.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148135/EN_148135_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Comfort of work without limiting cables&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The efficient 1600 mAh lithium-ion battery &lt;/strong&gt;provides up to 3 hours of uninterrupted use, &lt;strong&gt;guaranteeing freedom of movement and comfort of work&lt;/strong&gt;. The wireless design eliminates the problem of tangled cables, which &lt;strong&gt;significantly facilitates hair styling&lt;/strong&gt;. Additionally, the device is equipped with an &lt;strong&gt;overcharge protection function&lt;/strong&gt;, increasing the safety and durability of the battery.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148135/EN_148135_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Elegant design of the hair trimmer&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The trimmer with a fashionable, ergonomic shape&lt;/strong&gt; is made of matte plastic in titanium shades. This &lt;strong&gt;ensures the durability of the equipment and affects the ease of cleaning&lt;/strong&gt;. The stylish, polished panel adds elegance to the device, and the thoughtful location of the slider under the thumb &lt;strong&gt;makes the operation of the clipper exceptionally comfortable&lt;/strong&gt;. In addition, the profiled casing not only emphasises the aesthetics, but also prevent the device from slipping in the hand, which allows &lt;strong&gt;for even greater precision of cutting&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148135/EN_148135_6.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Included:&lt;/strong&gt; trimmer, charger, cleaning brush, bottle of maintenance oil.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Color: shades of titanium&lt;br&gt;Blade width: 4 cm&lt;br&gt;Full charge time: 2 h&lt;br&gt;Operating time after full charge: 3 h&lt;br&gt;Power: 7 W&lt;br&gt;Voltage: 100-240 V&lt;br&gt;Battery: lithium-ion&lt;br&gt;Battery capacity: 1600 mAh&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/eiQ9g0dsCQo" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;</description>
<price>81.09</price>
<category_subcategory>Hairdressing salon equipment&gt;Hair clippers</category_subcategory>
<qty>19</qty>
<weight>0.8000</weight>
<brand>CODOS</brand>
<tax>23%</tax>
