<item>
<sku>148172</sku>
<name>Codos cordless hair clipper CHC-618 BARBER MASTER</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148172/EN_148172_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Codos &lt;/strong&gt;brand offers practical hair clippers, blades and attachments. It focuses on stylish, handy cordless models that guarantee considerable freedom and ease of use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148172/EN_148172_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Practical hair clipper&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Codos CHC-618 BARBER MASTER cordless hair clipper&lt;/strong&gt; combines comfort of use with &lt;strong&gt;high efficiency&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing easy and precise creation of the perfect hairstyle. Thanks to its ergonomic shape and lightweight design, the device is &lt;strong&gt;exceptionally handy&lt;/strong&gt;, which makes it great for both professional hairdressing salons and home use. Thanks to the efficient lithium-ion battery, the device provides &lt;strong&gt;up to 3,5 hours of continuous use&lt;/strong&gt;, offering maximum comfort and independence from cables.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148172/EN_148172_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Functionalities for ease of use&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The fixed&lt;strong&gt; titanium-coated blade&lt;/strong&gt; guarantees exceptional durability, precision and softness, &lt;strong&gt;minimising the risk of skin irritation&lt;/strong&gt;. The clipper is equipped with an advanced mechanism that allows for &lt;strong&gt;precise control of the cutting length&lt;/strong&gt;, adapting to the individual user's needs. The kit includes a &lt;strong&gt;set of ten comb-shaped attachments&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing for cutting at lengths from 1,5 mm to 25 mm. Additionally, the device offers &lt;strong&gt;two-stage blade speed regulation – 6000 rpm and 7000 rpm&lt;/strong&gt; – ensuring optimum performance for every cut.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148172/EN_148172_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Innovative adjustment method&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The clipper is equipped with an &lt;strong&gt;innovative cutting length adjustment system&lt;/strong&gt; based on a regulating key. The ergonomically placed lever &lt;strong&gt;allows for precise setting of one of five lengths&lt;/strong&gt;: 1,0 mm, 1,2 mm, 1,4 mm, 1,6 mm and 1,8 mm. This solution &lt;strong&gt;guarantees full control over styling&lt;/strong&gt; and allows to achieve perfect results with every cut.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148172/EN_148172_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Comfort of work without limiting cables&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The clipper is distinguished by a powerful, durable motor, and its &lt;strong&gt;battery charges in just 3 hours&lt;/strong&gt;, providing up to 210 minutes of effective work. The efficient 2200 mAh lithium-ion battery &lt;strong&gt;guarantees over 3 hours of uninterrupted operation&lt;/strong&gt;, providing freedom of movement and comfort of use. The cordless design eliminates the problem of tangled cables, which &lt;strong&gt;significantly facilitates precise hair trimming&lt;/strong&gt;. The device features overcharging and over-discharge protection, &lt;strong&gt;increasing the safety and durability&lt;/strong&gt; of the equipment. Additionally, &lt;strong&gt;the clear screen shows the charge level and speed set&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing you to constantly monitor the status of the device.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148172/EN_148172_6.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Elegant design of the hair clipper&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The clipper with a &lt;strong&gt;modern, ergonomic shape&lt;/strong&gt; is made of matte plastic in shades of titanium, which &lt;strong&gt;ensures durability and makes it easier to keep it clean&lt;/strong&gt;. The stylish, polished panel adds elegance to the device, and the intuitively placed slider and lever, perfectly matched to the natural position of the fingers, &lt;strong&gt;guarantee comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;. The profiled housing not only emphasize the aesthetic appearance of the clipper, but also &lt;strong&gt;provide a secure grip&lt;/strong&gt;, minimizing the risk of the device slipping in the hand and &lt;strong&gt;enabling precise haircutting&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148172/EN_148172_7.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Included:&lt;/strong&gt; clipper, charger, set of attachments (from 1,5 mm to 25 mm), cleaning brush, bottle of maintenance oil.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Colour: shades of titanium&lt;br&gt;Housing material: plastic&lt;br&gt;Blade width: 4,5 cm&lt;br&gt;Full charging time: 3 h&lt;br&gt;Operating time after full charge: 210 min (3,5 h)&lt;br&gt;Power: 7 W&lt;br&gt;Voltage: 100-240 V&lt;br&gt;Rechargeable battery: lithium-ion&lt;br&gt;Battery capacity: 2200 mAh&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/X76_KwPyZ0w" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;</description>
<price>97.15</price>
<category_subcategory>Hairdressing salon equipment&gt;Hair clippers</category_subcategory>
