<item>
<sku>149681</sku>
<name>OCHO NAILS dual forms almond</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;OCHO NAILS&lt;/strong&gt; is a unique brand focusing on professional products for nail stylists. Its assortment includes hybrid nail polishes, nail gels, specialized lamps and nail care accessories. The OCHO NAILS products will meet the requirements of experienced users and those just beginning their adventure with manicures.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/149681/EN_149681_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Perfect accessory for nail extensions&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The transparent dual forms almond&lt;/strong&gt; for nail extensions by Ocho Nails are a modern alternative to traditional templates. They allow you to&lt;strong&gt; quickly and precisely achieve the perfect almond shape&lt;/strong&gt;, giving your nails symmetry and a perfect look. This is a &lt;strong&gt;great solution &lt;/strong&gt;for both experienced stylists and people who are just starting their adventure with nail styling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Why choose Ocho Nails dual forms?&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The almond-shaped dual forms are &lt;strong&gt;distinguished by their exceptional flexibility and durability&lt;/strong&gt;, which allows for comfortable work without worrying about damaging them. &lt;strong&gt;The auxiliary lines&lt;/strong&gt; make it easy to give your nails the selected length, and &lt;strong&gt;the transparent material&lt;/strong&gt; ensures effective curing in a UV/LED lamp. &lt;strong&gt;The 12 sizes &lt;/strong&gt;allow for a perfect fit of the dual form to the natural nail plate, which makes it easier to &lt;strong&gt;obtain a perfect effect&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The pack contains 120 pieces in 12 different sizes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/149681/EN_149681_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Directions for use:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;1. Before starting the procedure, thoroughly disinfect your and the client's hands using an antiseptic liquid and prepare the workplace accordingly.&lt;br&gt;2. Use a file with the appropriate gradation to give the nails the desired shape, gently buff the plate with a polishing block, and if necessary, work on the cuticles.&lt;br&gt;3. Apply gel or acrylic gel to the concave part of the form.&lt;br&gt;4. Press the dual form onto the nail, ensuring it is positioned correctly.&lt;br&gt;5. Cure in a UV/LED lamp, adjusting the time to the product used.&lt;br&gt;6. Carefully remove the form, file the nail and finish the design with a selected hybrid nail polish or top coat.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>2.64</price>
<category_subcategory>Nails&gt;Gel forms</category_subcategory>
