<item>
<sku>153290</sku>
<name>Disposable fitted sheet folded 5 pieces</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quickepil&lt;/strong&gt; is a brand of the renowned Spanish company MayStar, which offers hair removal products, such as hard waxes, waxes in a roll and in a can, wax heaters, cosmetics and accessories. Their waxes are among the best in the world – they are non-allergenic, safe and meet the customers' expectations.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional hygienic pads&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A universal &lt;strong&gt;sheet with elastic band&lt;/strong&gt; will work well in all specialist offices, including beauty, medical and massage offices, where it is &lt;strong&gt;important to maintain high hygiene standards&lt;/strong&gt;. Pads made of soft non-woven fabric are extremely easy to use – they have &lt;strong&gt;an elastic band&lt;/strong&gt;, which ensures easy use, can be adapted to many professional furniture and prevents them from slipping off the equipment. They will be used &lt;strong&gt;to protect cosmetic chairs&lt;/strong&gt;, medical couches, massage beds, gynecological chairs and many other professional equipment where &lt;strong&gt;isolating the body from the surface&lt;/strong&gt; of the furniture is important.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where are disposable fitted sheets useful?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Disposable hygienic pads &lt;strong&gt;guarantee cleanliness during treatments&lt;/strong&gt;, in any place that &lt;strong&gt;requires hygiene&lt;/strong&gt;. They are perfect for covering chairs or couches on which a client or patient sits during various cosmetic or medical treatments. &lt;strong&gt;Each sheet is packed separately&lt;/strong&gt; for storage and transport, ensuring cleanliness, hygiene and safety of future users.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Color: shades of white&lt;br&gt;Material: synthetic fibers&lt;br&gt;Universal size&lt;br&gt;Dimensions: 220 x 90 cm*&lt;br&gt;The pack contains 5 pieces.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;*The dimensions given are approximate – the product is stretchable due to the elastic band, universal size.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>5.27</price>
