<item>
<sku>154243</sku>
<name>Valera Steel Master Chrome Hair Dryer</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Valera &lt;/strong&gt;is a brand with over 60 years of tradition, appreciated by professionals around the world. Hair styling devices, including hair dryers and straighteners, combine advanced technology and care for the condition of the hair. They will work well both in the salon and in home styling.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154243/EN_154243_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Professional hair dryer&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Valera Steel Master Chrome hair dryer&lt;/strong&gt; is a combination of classic design, &lt;strong&gt;modern technologies and reliable functionality&lt;/strong&gt;, created with the most demanding users in mind. Made of premium chrome-plated steel, it impresses with its &lt;strong&gt;elegant appearance and exceptional durability&lt;/strong&gt;. It is the perfect choice for a professional hair salon, where &lt;strong&gt;style and performance &lt;/strong&gt;are both important.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154243/EN_154243_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Advanced technologies for healthy and shiny hair&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The innovative Smart AirFlow technology&lt;/strong&gt; combined with the ionization function makes drying hair &lt;strong&gt;even more efficient and safer&lt;/strong&gt;. The intelligently designed airflow system&lt;strong&gt; distributes heat evenly&lt;/strong&gt;, which speeds up drying and minimizes the risk of hair dryness. By emitting negative ions, the dryer &lt;strong&gt;effectively reduces frizz&lt;/strong&gt;, eliminates static and smooths strands. &lt;strong&gt;As a result, hair is soft, smooth, full of shine and easier to style&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154243/EN_154243_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Precise regulation and maximum user comfort&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Full control over the styling process is provided by a &lt;strong&gt;three-stage temperature regulation and two levels of airflow strength&lt;/strong&gt;. The ability to adjust the settings makes the dryer perfect for different hair types and styling techniques.&lt;strong&gt; The cold air button &lt;/strong&gt;allows you to fix the hairstyle, &lt;strong&gt;giving the hair smoothness and a long-lasting effect&lt;/strong&gt;. An additional advantage is quiet operation –&lt;strong&gt; the noise level does not exceed 70 dB(A)&lt;/strong&gt;, which ensures greater comfort for both the stylist and the client.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154243/EN_154243_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Power and efficiency in a lightweight design&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The dryer is equipped with &lt;strong&gt;a professional AC PERFORMANCE LIGHT motor&lt;/strong&gt;, it offers reliability and long service life, while remaining lightweight, which &lt;strong&gt;makes everyday work easier &lt;/strong&gt;both in the hairdressing salon and at home. &lt;strong&gt;The THERMO-CONTROL heating element &lt;/strong&gt;with a wavy wire is responsible for &lt;strong&gt;precise temperature control&lt;/strong&gt;, which guarantees even heating, minimizing the risk of hair overheating. Thanks to this, &lt;strong&gt;the strands remain healthy, shiny and resistant to heat damage&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154243/EN_154243_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Safety and durability&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The built-in safety thermostat protects the device from overheating&lt;/strong&gt; – if the temperature reaches too high, the dryer automatically switches off and resumes operation after cooling down, which &lt;strong&gt;extends its life and increases the safety of use&lt;/strong&gt;. For even greater convenience and hygiene, the dryer is equipped with a &lt;strong&gt;removable metal filter&lt;/strong&gt; that effectively retains dust and dirt, preventing them from entering the device. The filter can be easily rinsed under running water, which allows for &lt;strong&gt;regular cleaning and maintaining optimal dryer performance&lt;/strong&gt; for a long time. Thanks to the Cool Touch Steel Body technology, &lt;strong&gt;the surface of the device does not heat up during operation&lt;/strong&gt;, which increases the comfort and safety of use.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Stylish and functional accessories&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The hair dryer comes with &lt;strong&gt;carefully selected accessories &lt;/strong&gt;that increase the versatility of the device and allow you to achieve professional styling results. &lt;strong&gt;The air concentrator precisely directs the air flow to the selected area of the hair&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing for quick drying and precise styling. On the other hand,&lt;strong&gt; the diffuser is ideal for emphasizing the natural curl of the hair&lt;/strong&gt;, adding volume to the hairstyle and improving its texture. Additionally, the included &lt;strong&gt;elegant case&lt;/strong&gt; not only ensures safe storage of the device, but also &lt;strong&gt;makes it easy to transport&lt;/strong&gt;, protecting the dryer from damage during travel or storage.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Elegance and the highest quality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The Steel Master Chrome model &lt;strong&gt;combines elegant design with modern technology&lt;/strong&gt;, ideal for demanding users. The premium chrome-plated steel housing stands out for its &lt;strong&gt;resistance to damage &lt;/strong&gt;and does not heat up during operation. The solid construction &lt;strong&gt;ensures durability and resistance to intensive use&lt;/strong&gt;. The lightweight and ergonomic form guarantees comfort even during long-term use, and&lt;strong&gt; the SuperFlex cable with the rotatable Rotocord system&lt;/strong&gt; prevents the cable from tangling, ensuring freedom of movement.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Product manufactured in Switzerland.&lt;br&gt;Please read the instructions before use. The cable is ± 3 meters long. The exact dimensions of the device are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;The set includes: hair dryer, air concentrator, diffuser, carrying cover, instructions.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Colour: shades of grey&lt;br&gt;Temperature adjustment: three-stage&lt;br&gt;Flow control: two-stage&lt;br&gt;Sound intensity: &amp;lt;70 dB(A)&lt;br&gt;Power: 2100 W&lt;br&gt;Voltage: 220-240 V&lt;br&gt;Warranty: 12 months&lt;br&gt;Package dimensions: 29×23×11 cm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>117.68</price>
<category_subcategory>Hairdressing salon equipment&gt;Hair dryers</category_subcategory>
<qty>4</qty>
