<item>
<sku>154244</sku>
<name>Valera Pulsecare straightener – new</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154244/EN_154244_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Valera &lt;/strong&gt;is a brand with over 60 years of tradition, appreciated by professionals around the world. Hair styling devices, including hair dryers and straighteners, combine advanced technology and care for the condition of the hair. They will work well both in the salon and in home styling.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154244/EN_154244_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Modern technology and styling comfort&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Valera Pulsecare straightener&lt;/strong&gt; combines innovative technologies with care for the condition of the hair, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring excellent results&lt;/strong&gt; both in the salon and at home. With fast heating and precise temperature control, styling becomes easy and safe, and &lt;strong&gt;ionization eliminates frizz and static on strands&lt;/strong&gt;. The ergonomic design and long, rotating cable&lt;strong&gt; increase the comfort of work&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing for free movement and convenient use every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154244/EN_154244_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Precise temperature regulation&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The straightener offers&lt;strong&gt; five temperature levels: 120°C, 150°C, 180°C, 210°C and 230°C&lt;/strong&gt;, which allows for perfect adjustment of settings to different hair types and styling. Lower temperatures will work well for thin, delicate strands, &lt;strong&gt;minimising the risk of their weakening&lt;/strong&gt;, while higher temperatures will allow for &lt;strong&gt;effective smoothing of thick and difficult to style hair&lt;/strong&gt;. Thanks to the memory function, the device &lt;strong&gt;automatically saves the last selected temperature&lt;/strong&gt;, which eliminates the need to adjust the settings each time and facilitates everyday styling.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;PULSE CARE – precise temperature control&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The device uses the advanced &lt;strong&gt;PULSE CARE temperature control system&lt;/strong&gt;, which monitors the heat up to 200 times per second, maintaining it &lt;strong&gt;at a constant level throughout the styling process&lt;/strong&gt;. This protects hair from overheating. The stable temperature allows &lt;strong&gt;for safe straightening and curling hair &lt;/strong&gt;without the risk of dryness or damage. Additionally, the device's rapid heating allows you to start styling almost immediately, which is particularly convenient in everyday use.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154244/EN_154244_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Ceramic tourmaline coating and ionisation&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The straightener plates are made of ceramic enriched with tourmaline, which &lt;strong&gt;ensures even heat distribution&lt;/strong&gt; and reduces the risk of hair damage. As a result, the strands remain smooth and healthy. Additionally, &lt;strong&gt;the ionisation technology emits a stream of negatively charged ions&lt;/strong&gt; throughout the entire operation of the device, &lt;strong&gt;reducing frizz and eliminating static&lt;/strong&gt;. The result is silky-smooth, &lt;strong&gt;shiny strands with a healthy appearance&lt;/strong&gt;, without uncontrolled curling or dullness.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Ergonomic design for comfort and safety&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The sleek, rounded design&lt;/strong&gt; of the straightener has been designed with versatility in mind – &lt;strong&gt;the device works perfectly for both straightening and curling&lt;/strong&gt;. The non-heating COOL TIPS ensure &lt;strong&gt;greater safety during use&lt;/strong&gt;, minimising the risk of burns. Additionally, the 3-meter swivel cable &lt;strong&gt;provides full freedom of movement&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing comfortable work without restrictions.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154244/EN_154244_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Functions that increase safety of use&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The straightener is equipped with &lt;strong&gt;an automatic switch&lt;/strong&gt; that deactivates the device after 60 minutes of non-use. The HOT system alerts about the straightener being turned off with &lt;strong&gt;an audible signal&lt;/strong&gt; and also allows the plates to cool down to a safe temperature, which &lt;strong&gt;minimises the risk of burns&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Storage and accessories&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The set includes a&lt;strong&gt; silicone cover and a protective case&lt;/strong&gt;, which ensure safe storage and &lt;strong&gt;convenient transport of the straightener&lt;/strong&gt;. The cover protects the plates, &lt;strong&gt;keeping them in a stable position&lt;/strong&gt; and protecting the heating surface from damage. The case additionally &lt;strong&gt;protects the device from scratches&lt;/strong&gt; and other mechanical damage, which &lt;strong&gt;guarantees the durability of the straightener &lt;/strong&gt;both in the salon and during transport.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/12FOr4Q8UsU" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Product manufactured in Switzerland.&lt;br&gt;Please read the instructions before use. The cable is ± 3 meters long. The exact dimensions of the device are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Included:&lt;/strong&gt; straightener, case, instructions.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Color: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Power: 92-156 W&lt;br&gt;Voltage: 100-240 V&lt;br&gt;Warranty: 12 months&lt;br&gt;Package dimensions: 32×10.5×9.5 cm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>95.33</price>
<category_subcategory>Hairdressing salon equipment&gt;Hair straighteners</category_subcategory>
