<item>
<sku>152270</sku>
<name>Gabbiano Head Spa 017B hair washing bed beige</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152270/EN_152270_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano &lt;/strong&gt;is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship and high comfort of use. It offers a wide selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, hairdressing washers and infrazons.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152270/EN_152270_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Modern SPA bed for complete care and relaxation&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The elegant &lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano Head Spa 017B cosmetic bed with integrated wash unit&lt;/strong&gt; is an innovative SPA bed,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;designed &lt;strong&gt;for professional care and relaxation treatments&lt;/strong&gt;. It is ideal for treatments of &lt;strong&gt;the luxurious Japanese Head SPA&lt;/strong&gt;, offering a wide range of therapies for the scalp and hair. It allows you to combine hydrotherapy techniques, water jet massage, aromatherapy and light therapy, providing &lt;strong&gt;a holistic care experience&lt;/strong&gt;. The advanced technologies and ergonomic design provide not only&lt;strong&gt; unparalleled comfort &lt;/strong&gt;for customers, but also &lt;strong&gt;facilitate the work of specialists&lt;/strong&gt; in the beauty &amp;amp; wellness industry. The Gabbiano Head Spa 017 is a unique &lt;strong&gt;combination of tradition and modernity&lt;/strong&gt;, which provides deep relaxation, nourishment and hydration of the scalp and hair. Additionally, it &lt;strong&gt;can be used for body massage&lt;/strong&gt;, offering versatile therapeutic and relaxing possibilities.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152270/EN_152270_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;What is Japanese Head SPA?&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The Japanese Head SPA is a unique treatment that&lt;strong&gt; combines tradition with a modern approach&lt;/strong&gt;. It is a luxurious and &lt;strong&gt;relaxing service for the care of the scalp&lt;/strong&gt;, hair and face, which aims to improve the condition of the skin by &lt;strong&gt;stimulating blood circulation, relaxing muscles&lt;/strong&gt; and providing the skin with essential nutrients. During the treatment, specialist cosmetics are used, such as scrubs, masks, essences and essential oils, which aim to: &lt;strong&gt;cleanse the scalp&lt;/strong&gt; of excess sebum, impurities and remnants of cosmetics, stimulate circulation, &lt;strong&gt;deeply moisturise the scalp and hair&lt;/strong&gt;, relax and reduce stress through massage techniques that improve well-being. The effect of the treatment is not only to &lt;strong&gt;prevent hair loss&lt;/strong&gt;, but also a significantly improve the condition of the hair –&lt;strong&gt; the hair becomes stronger, more moisturised and resistant to damage&lt;/strong&gt;, which effectively prevents it from dryness and breakage. The key role is also played by the &lt;strong&gt;stimulation of microcirculation and stimulation of hair roots&lt;/strong&gt;, which contributes to better hair growth. In addition to intensive care therapy, &lt;strong&gt;the treatment provides deep relaxation&lt;/strong&gt;, making clients eager to return.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152270/EN_152270_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Luxury Waterfall Head SPA water massage&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The golden arc with an adjustable angle of inclination&lt;/strong&gt;, designed for the Waterfall Head SPA, is an innovative solution that &lt;strong&gt;allows for holistic care of the scalp&lt;/strong&gt;. The water jets act as a natural massage, improving blood circulation, reducing tension and stress. The precisely controlled water flows &lt;strong&gt;support hair regeneration&lt;/strong&gt; and intensively moisturise the skin. The waterfall arc with the possibility of adjusting the angle ensures deep cleansing of the scalp and relaxation, &lt;strong&gt;bringing relief &lt;/strong&gt;from ailments such as headaches or stiff neck. Thanks to &lt;strong&gt;an intelligent closed-loop system&lt;/strong&gt;, the arc draws water from the bowl and reuses it, providing an uninterrupted water massage. This is a combination of technology and relaxation that&lt;strong&gt; supports hair health and well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152270/EN_152270_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Effective steam therapy&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The revolutionary care treatment &lt;strong&gt;uses the properties of steam to regenerate and moisturise hair&lt;/strong&gt;. The set includes a specialised steam-generating device and a &lt;strong&gt;dedicated basin cover&lt;/strong&gt;, &amp;nbsp;that allows it to be precisely directed at the hair. This allows the active ingredients contained in masks, ampoules and other care products&lt;strong&gt; to be absorbed more effectively&lt;/strong&gt;, supporting hair recovery and strengthening. Steam therapy&lt;strong&gt; improves hair structure, increases resistance to damage and restores a healthy shine&lt;/strong&gt;, making them softer, more flexible and full of life.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152270/EN_152270_6.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Touch control panel&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The intuitive touch panel&lt;/strong&gt; provides full control over the wash unit functions. It allows you to adjust the operating time and water temperature, as well as monitor their current values. Thanks to&lt;strong&gt; the built-in display&lt;/strong&gt;, you can check how long the device has been working at any time. The panel also allows you to &lt;strong&gt;activation of the light therapy function, i.e. illumination of the bowl&lt;/strong&gt;, creating an atmosphere of relaxation and luxury. Additionally, &lt;strong&gt;the steam therapy device is equipped with a remote control&lt;/strong&gt;, enabling convenient remote operation.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152270/EN_152270_7.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Functionalities for versatile treatments&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The adjustable headrest with &lt;strong&gt;the possibility of extending and changing the angle of inclination&lt;/strong&gt; ensures a perfect fit to the user's needs, increasing comfort during treatments. The set also includes &lt;strong&gt;ergonomic pillows&lt;/strong&gt;, including a headrest with an opening for the face, which allows you to perform not only &lt;strong&gt;scalp care procedures&lt;/strong&gt;, but also massages and&lt;strong&gt; various body and face treatments&lt;/strong&gt;. With these practical solutions, the lounger becomes &lt;strong&gt;a versatile element of beauty &amp;amp; wellness salon equipment&lt;/strong&gt;, guaranteeing comfort and effectiveness of any therapy.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152270/EN_152270_8.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Comfortable use&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The deep ceramic bowl &lt;/strong&gt;in shades of white effectively &lt;strong&gt;prevents splashing of water and products&lt;/strong&gt; used during treatments, ensuring cleanliness and comfort of work. Its &lt;strong&gt;unique bend&lt;/strong&gt; not only facilitates access for the practicioner, but also adds an elegant, modern character to the wash unit. Made of durable material, the bowl is &lt;strong&gt;resistant to discoloration, scratches and damage&lt;/strong&gt;, and its smooth surface &lt;strong&gt;makes keeping it clean exceptionally easy&lt;/strong&gt;. The combination of functionality and aesthetics &lt;strong&gt;raises the standard of any professional space&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Thoughtful amenities and accessories&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The hair wash unit is equipped with a mixer tap, which allows &lt;strong&gt;easy adjustment of the temperature to the customer's preferences&lt;/strong&gt;. A dedicated place for the shower head makes work easier, and a &lt;strong&gt;chrome plug with a special strainer &lt;/strong&gt;allows you to control the water flow and &lt;strong&gt;maintain high hygiene standards&lt;/strong&gt; in the salon. The water connection is placed inside the base, which allows for&lt;strong&gt; efficient hiding of all pipes&lt;/strong&gt;. The lounger is profiled in such a way as to provide comfort during various treatments. &lt;strong&gt;The combination of functionality and amenities&lt;/strong&gt; makes work in a hairdressing salon or SPA even more comfortable. The set also includes&lt;strong&gt; a comfortable pouffe&lt;/strong&gt;, which ensures comfort for the staff, which makes the hair wash bed an even &lt;strong&gt;more versatile solution for SPA salons&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152270/EN_152270_9.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Stability and comfort in an elegant edition&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The Head Spa 017 SPA lounger is a combination of functionality and modern design. Equipped with &lt;strong&gt;a solid stainless steel frame&lt;/strong&gt;, it guarantees stability and durability. The ergonomically profiled lounger is covered with soft synthetic leather in shades of beige, ensuring &lt;strong&gt;maximum comfort&lt;/strong&gt; during treatments. In addition, the space with sliding door under the lounger allows for&lt;strong&gt; convenient storage&lt;/strong&gt; of cosmetics and accessories, making it an &lt;strong&gt;excellent choice for professional beauty &amp;amp; wellness salons&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Video presentation of the Gabbiano Head Spa 017 model – Head Spa bed version without doors:&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/TvUahNFi1QA" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Dimensions are shown in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Included:&lt;/strong&gt; lounger wash, wash bowl cover (steam hood), steamer, two-piece cushion, pouffe.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of beige&lt;br&gt;Bowl color: shades of white&lt;br&gt;Fittings color: shades of chrome&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Bowl material: ceramic&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>1788.62</price>
