<item>
<sku>152033</sku>
<name>E40 Cosmetic Table</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152033/EN_152033_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Giovanni is a brand specializing in practical equipment for beauty and cosmetic salons, offering among other things cosmetic furniture and vapozones. High durability, ergonomics, and functionality of the products provide convenience and comfort of use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152033/EN_152033_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Practical, compact helper&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Giovanni E40 cosmetic table&lt;/strong&gt; is a functional piece of furniture, ideal for beauty and SPA salons. &lt;strong&gt;The stable, yet lightweight construction&lt;/strong&gt; ensures work comfort and easy maneuverability. &lt;strong&gt;Three glass shelves&lt;/strong&gt; enable convenient organisation of cosmetics, accessories and equipment necessary for treatments. &lt;strong&gt;The minimalist finish&lt;/strong&gt; emphasizes the professional character of the table.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152033/EN_152033_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Design for maximum functionality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The simple construction, a &lt;strong&gt;frame made of durable aluminum&lt;/strong&gt; in shades of white and glass shelves combine elegance with practicality, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring the durability and stability of the furniture&lt;/strong&gt;. The smooth surfaces make it easy to keep the table clean, and &lt;strong&gt;four wheels allow it to be moved freely&lt;/strong&gt;, which increases the comfort of work in the salon. The elegant finish&lt;strong&gt; emphasises the professional character of the interior&lt;/strong&gt;. There is a special place on the frame of the table, which allows for &lt;strong&gt;easy mounting of a professional magnifying lamp&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The dimensions are shown in the photo.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Color: shades of white&lt;/p&gt;</description>
