<item>
<sku>148376</sku>
<name>Depilation kit iWax single roll F-0 40W white + roll + strips</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;iWAX&lt;/strong&gt; brand aims to provide multifunctional tools for cosmetic wax and paraffin treatments, such as modern wax heaters for depilation. It focuses on interesting design, versatility of products and ease of use, so that the &lt;strong&gt;iWAX&lt;/strong&gt; range is aimed at both professional and home use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A complete set for smooth skin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The hair removal kit&lt;/strong&gt; with a single heater for wax rolls allows for effective and fast epilation. A professional heater is &lt;strong&gt;an irreplaceable device for removing unnecessary hair&lt;/strong&gt;, and depilation with wax in a rolls works well for both thin as well as thick and strong hair. The set also includes a roll of azulene wax and a pack of fleece depilation strips.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective hair removal device&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The cartridge wax warmer with roller&lt;/strong&gt; is very easy to use and &lt;strong&gt;ensures safety and speed of operation&lt;/strong&gt;, so it is suitable for both cosmetic salons and home use. A special window in the casing &lt;strong&gt;allows the amount of remaining wax to be monitored&lt;/strong&gt; at any time. The device is ready to work within 20 – 30 minutes.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gentle wax roll&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Precise removal of unwanted hair is possible with properly selected products. &lt;strong&gt;Azulene wax in a roll&lt;/strong&gt; has a soothing and anti-inflammatory effect. It is recommended &lt;strong&gt;especially for sensitive skin&lt;/strong&gt;, prone to irritation, but is suitable for all skin types. Application using &lt;strong&gt;a narrow roller&lt;/strong&gt; makes it ideal for depilation of the face – such as moustache or eyebrows – and more inaccessible areas of the body.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective depilation strips&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;During hair removal treatments, &lt;strong&gt;interlining depilation strips&lt;/strong&gt; work much better than their cotton counterparts. The wax sticks better to them, which means that &lt;strong&gt;it is peeled off more evenly&lt;/strong&gt;. This minimizes discomfort during the treatment, reducing the likelihood of irritation. The set includes &lt;strong&gt;a package of 20 pieces&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Heater power: 40 W&lt;br&gt;Heater voltage: 220-240V&lt;br&gt;Wax roll capacity: 110 g&lt;br&gt;The set includes 20 interlining strips.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>7.12</price>
<category_subcategory>Epilation&gt;Depilation kits</category_subcategory>
