<item>
<sku>152012</sku>
<name>Hairdresser's case</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;For many years, the &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVESHOP &lt;/strong&gt;brand has been offering a wide range of products that work well for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment, you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Functionality and mobility&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A hairdresser's suitcase on wheels&lt;/strong&gt; is the perfect solution for professionals who value comfort and tidiness. &lt;strong&gt;Equipped with a telescopic handle and easy-to-remove wheels&lt;/strong&gt;, it ensures comfortable transport. The spacious interior and a set of four organizers&lt;strong&gt; make it easy to segregate and store &lt;/strong&gt;essential cosmetic accessories. Modern design, &lt;strong&gt;mobility and practicality&lt;/strong&gt; make this suitcase an irreplaceable tool for every professional in the beauty industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Durability and elegant design&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The suitcase is made of durable, water-resistant nylon, making it&lt;strong&gt; resistant to damage and easy to clean&lt;/strong&gt;. The universal black colour gives it an elegant look, while the numerous pockets, including a &lt;strong&gt;large main compartment with adjustable dividers&lt;/strong&gt; and space for four organizers (two smaller, two larger), provide maximum functionality. The well-thought-out design &lt;strong&gt;makes it easy to organize cosmetics and accessories&lt;/strong&gt;, helping to maintain order. Modern design, mobility and practicality &lt;strong&gt;make the suitcase an irreplaceable tool for beauty professionals&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The exact dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;The set includes 4 organizers in two sizes.&lt;br&gt;Colour: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>81.30</price>
