<description>&lt;p&gt;For many years, the &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVESHOP &lt;/strong&gt;brand has been offering a wide range of products that work well for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment, you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Comfort when cutting children's hair&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The children's hairdressing cape CJ-03&lt;/strong&gt; ensures comfort and hygiene during haircutting. It effectively &lt;strong&gt;protects the body and clothing&lt;/strong&gt; of the young client from hair and splashes, &lt;strong&gt;eliminating the problem of irritating strands falling on the neck&lt;/strong&gt;. It is also perfect for the application of cosmetics that could stain clothes.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Colourful attraction for the youngest&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The cape is &lt;strong&gt;made of waterproof material&lt;/strong&gt; that is easy to keep clean and impervious to moisture, protecting clothes from getting wet. &lt;strong&gt;The adjustable, comfortable fastening &lt;/strong&gt;allows for a perfect fit. The dimensions and effortless folding make storage much easier. Additionally, &lt;strong&gt;the dinosaur print&lt;/strong&gt; makes the cape not only a practical accessory, but also &lt;strong&gt;an interesting attraction&lt;/strong&gt; that will make a visit to the hairdresser more pleasant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
