<item>
<sku>152217</sku>
<name>GLOW eyelash lamp FX07 white</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152217/EN_152217_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;GLOW &lt;/strong&gt;brand products are professional lighting that improves the performance of services both in beauty salons and medical offices. It offers a wide selection of specialist lamps, including UV/LED and treatment lamps, necessary for precise work.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152217/EN_152217_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Shadowless cosmetic lamp&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The GLOW eyelash treatment lamp&lt;/strong&gt; with a unique arc-shaped head with adjustable angles &lt;strong&gt;provides excellent lighting during treatments requiring precision&lt;/strong&gt;. It is ideal &lt;strong&gt;for all specialist practices&lt;/strong&gt;, where the right light can significantly affect the quality of services performed. &lt;strong&gt;Perfect for eyelash extensions or thickening&lt;/strong&gt;, tattoos, beauty treatments or make-up.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152217/EN_152217_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Movable, arched head&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The characteristic shape of the lamp &lt;/strong&gt;head is not only a modern design, but above all a functional solution. The wide, arched panel, divided into two parts &lt;strong&gt;filled with 308 LEDs&lt;/strong&gt;, provides even, shadowless lighting of the treatment area, increasing work comfort. It is also perfect for photographing the effects of treatments, &lt;strong&gt;precisely exposing them&lt;/strong&gt;. The surface of the panel effectively disperses light, minimising the glare effect. Thanks to&lt;strong&gt; the ability to adjust the colour and intensity of light&lt;/strong&gt;, the lamp provides excellent reproduction of colours seen and &lt;strong&gt;minimises eye fatigue&lt;/strong&gt;, even during prolonged use. Additionally,&lt;strong&gt; the rotating head and the widely adjustable frame &lt;/strong&gt;allow the angle of light to be precisely adjusted. What's more, &lt;strong&gt;both panels can be adjusted independently within a range of 90 degrees&lt;/strong&gt;, which provides even greater freedom in adapting the lighting to individual needs.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152217/EN_152217_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Wide range of adjustment&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The tripod can be easily adjusted&lt;strong&gt; in the range of 155-195 cm&lt;/strong&gt; using a locking screw located on the arm. This allows&lt;strong&gt; for precise adjustment of the head position to the individual needs&lt;/strong&gt; of the user and various types of cosmetic chairs, beds and treatment tables, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring optimal lighting of the work area&lt;/strong&gt;. The colour and intensity of light can be adjusted &lt;strong&gt;using two remote controls&lt;/strong&gt; – one, located on the cable is always at hand, and the other allows remote control of settings. Additionally, thanks to &lt;strong&gt;the built-in magnet&lt;/strong&gt;, it can be conveniently attached in a selected place.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152217/EN_152217_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Adjustment to individual needs&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The adjustment option includes &lt;strong&gt;three levels of colour temperature (3000-6000 K) and seven levels of light intensity&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing the lighting to be precisely tailored to individual needs. &lt;strong&gt;The full mobility of the head and the rotating arm of the tripod&lt;/strong&gt; allow the position of the lamp to be precisely adjusted. &amp;nbsp;However, the best stability is achieved by setting it along the base. Additional stability is guaranteed by a &lt;strong&gt;lockable hinge&lt;/strong&gt;, which allows the angle of the lamp to be precisely adjusted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152217/EN_152217_6.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Convenience of sharing work effects&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The set includes &lt;strong&gt;a phone holder&lt;/strong&gt;, which allows you to stably and aesthetically document the effects of your work. It also &lt;strong&gt;makes it easier to record videos while performing services&lt;/strong&gt;, so that you can later share the footage on social media. The holder can be placed at different angles &lt;strong&gt;to achieve interesting and varied shots&lt;/strong&gt;. The wide adjustment range of the clamp &lt;strong&gt;makes it suitable for many phone models&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Modern and functional design&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The lamp is distinguished by its &lt;strong&gt;elegant, minimalist design&lt;/strong&gt;, which perfectly matches the interiors of beauty salons, aesthetic medicine offices and spaces for professional eyelash and nail styling. The slim, adjustable stand combined with the stable base &lt;strong&gt;ensure comfort of use and aesthetic&lt;/strong&gt; that do not overwhelm the space. The subtle, white finish gives it &lt;strong&gt;a modern feel&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/1nklW4rYnYw" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Detailed dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;Note. Before use, carefully read the instructions and assemble the product correctly.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Included: &lt;/strong&gt;lamp, stand elements, base, phone holder, wireless remote control, power supply and power cable, instructions.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Input voltage: 220-240 V&lt;br&gt;Power: 31 W&lt;br&gt;Light colour: 3000-6000 K&lt;br&gt;CRI: RA &amp;gt; 90&lt;br&gt;Luminous flux: 4000 LM&lt;br&gt;Frame colour: shades of white&lt;br&gt;Warranty: 12 months&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>101.62</price>
<category_subcategory>Cosmetic devices&gt;Cosmetic lamps&gt;Ring and other make-up lamps</category_subcategory>
