<item>
<sku>154450</sku>
<name>Cosmetic chair QS-OF211G gold light grey</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154450/EN_154450_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;For many years, the &lt;strong&gt;ACTIVESHOP &lt;/strong&gt;brand has been offering a wide range of products that are suitable for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment, you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to specialized equipment, such as cosmetic furniture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/148167/EN_148167_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elegant and functional chair&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The stylish &lt;strong&gt;QS-OF211G chair &lt;/strong&gt;will fit into any interior. Whether it's a professional salon like a beauty or nail salon, an office space, or an elegant reception area, this chair offers &lt;strong&gt;functionality and aesthetic appeal&lt;/strong&gt;. Moreover, its design makes it equally &lt;strong&gt;suitable for everyday use&lt;/strong&gt; in homes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154450/EN_154450_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant adjustment possibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The efficient gas lift&lt;/strong&gt; allows for easy and smooth &lt;strong&gt;adjustment of the seat height between 51-60 cm&lt;/strong&gt;. This allows the piece of furniture to be tailored to individual needs and services, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring high comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt; – both when applying makeup, eyebrow styling, and during other activities. The &lt;strong&gt;full rotation mechanism&lt;/strong&gt; improves work efficiency and comfort. &lt;strong&gt;The metal armrests&lt;/strong&gt; are at the right height, allowing for proper shoulder positioning.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154450/EN_154450_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimalist design for comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The pleasant-to-the-touch&lt;/strong&gt;, synthetic leather upholstery in shades of grey gives the furniture a unique character. &lt;strong&gt;The elegant finish&lt;/strong&gt; makes it a real eye-catcher. The frame in shades of gold adds elegance, perfectly matching simple shapes. &lt;strong&gt;Functional castors &lt;/strong&gt;provide significant mobility, making it easier to move the chair and move around the salon while working. &lt;strong&gt;The aesthetics of workmanship, comfort of use and ergonomically profiled backrest&lt;/strong&gt; make the chair meet the requirements of even the most demanding users.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The product dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;Gold elements are coated with lacquer. Mechanical damage to the coating is not subject to complaint.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Actuator: gas&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of grey&lt;br&gt;Frame color: shades of gold&lt;/p&gt;</description>
