<item>
<sku>154378</sku>
<name>Apis Protective Face and Body Mist SPF 50 150 ml</name>
<description>&lt;h2&gt;Apis Protective Face and Body Mist SPF 50 150 ml&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Can you protect your skin from the sun while giving it a refreshing boost? Yes! This mist combines a lightweight, refreshing formula with a photostable, microencapsulated filter that effectively shields against UVA and UVB radiation. Its formula includes hydrating coconut water, refreshing aloe vera juice, and marine plankton, which enhances skin hydration. Additionally, bamboo extract helps regulate sebum production, while panthenol soothes and regenerates the skin.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Indications: &lt;/strong&gt;Suitable for all skin types.  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contraindications:&lt;/strong&gt; Allergy to any of the product’s ingredients. Perform an allergy test before use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;How to use: Shake well and spray onto the face and body from a distance of 20 cm. Avoid contact with eyes. The mist can be reapplied over makeup.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients/INCI:&lt;/strong&gt; Cocos Nucifera Water, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate, Ethylhexyl Triazone, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Propanediol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Lecithin, Aqua, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, D-panthenol, Glycerin, Plankton Extract, Bambusa Vulgaris Shoot Extract, Parfum, Propylene Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Caprylyl Glycol, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
