<item>
<sku>154379</sku>
<name>Apis Protective Face Cream SPF 50 50 ml</name>
<description>&lt;h2&gt;Apis Protective Face Cream SPF 50 50 ml&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Are you looking for a lightweight, year-round cream that effectively protects your skin from UVA and UVB radiation? Pure Sun Care cream not only provides high sun protection with a next-generation microencapsulated filter but also intensely hydrates and nourishes the skin. Thanks to carefully selected ingredients, it has antioxidant and regenerative properties. It contains moisturizing hyaluronic acid and beta-glucan, soothing panthenol and marine plankton extract, nourishing ceramides, and protective jojoba oil.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Indications:&lt;/strong&gt; Suitable for all skin types.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contraindications:&lt;/strong&gt; Allergy to any of the product’s ingredients. Perform an allergy test before use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to use:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply the cream evenly to the face and neck about 10-20 minutes before sun exposure. To maintain effective protection, reapply regularly every 2-3 hours. Works perfectly under makeup.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients/INCI:&lt;/strong&gt; Aqua, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate, Ethylhexyl Triazone, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Propanediol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Lecithin, Sodium Acrylates Copolymer, Glycerin, Plankton Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Sorbitol, Glucose, Carnitine, Ceramide 6 II, D-panthenol, Simmondsia Chinensis Seed Oil, Glycerin, Avena Sativa (Oat) Bran Extract, Beta-Glucan, Xanthan Gum, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Trilaureth-4-Phosphate, Parfum, Phenoxyethanol, Caprylyl Glycol, Citric Acid.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
