<item>
<sku>154380</sku>
<name>Apis Protective Face Cream SPF 30 50 ml</name>
<description>&lt;h2&gt;Apis Protective Face Cream SPF 30 50 ml&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Discover the perfect cream for year-round protection against UVA and UVB radiation. It features a next-generation microencapsulated UV filter that leaves no white traces and, thanks to its exceptional lightness, ensures comfort throughout the day. With the inclusion of beta-glucan and marine plankton, it neutralizes the effects of free radicals. Hyaluronic acid deeply hydrates, while D-panthenol, jojoba oil, and ceramides support the regeneration of the hydrolipidic barrier, nourish, and soothe irritations.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Indications:&lt;/strong&gt; Suitable for all skin types.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contraindications:&lt;/strong&gt; Allergy to any of the product’s ingredients. Perform an allergy test before use.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to use:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply the cream evenly to the face and neck about 10-20 minutes before sun exposure. To maintain effective protection, reapply regularly every 2-3 hours. Works perfectly under makeup.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients/INCI:&lt;/strong&gt; Aqua, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate, Ethylhexyl Triazone, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Propanediol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Lecithin, Sodium Acrylates Copolymer, Glycerin, Plankton Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Sorbitol, Glucose, Carnitine, Ceramide 6 II, D-panthenol, Simmondsia Chinensis Seed Oil, Glycerin, Avena Sativa (Oat) Bran Extract, Beta-Glucan, Xanthan Gum, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Trilaureth-4-Phosphate, Parfum, Phenoxyethanol, Caprylyl Glycol, Citric Acid.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
