<item>
<sku>154381</sku>
<name>Apis Protective Body Oil SPF 30 150 ml</name>
<description>&lt;h2&gt;Apis Protective Body Oil SPF 30 150 ml&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Do you love the satiny glow that body oils provide but worry about greasy residue on your skin? We have the perfect solution for you! The Pure Sun Care body oil not only offers SPF 30 protection but also moisturizes and gives your skin a healthy, golden glow. Buriti oil and sea buckthorn extract are rich in carotenoids that have antioxidant properties and help even out skin tone. Jojoba and avocado oils prevent dryness and roughness, and they also help prolong your tan. Aloe extract provides hydration and soothes irritation, while vitamin E helps delay the aging process.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Indications:&lt;/strong&gt; Suitable for all skin types.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contraindications:&lt;/strong&gt; Allergy to any of the ingredients. Perform a patch test before use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to use:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply an appropriate amount to the skin and gently massage in. Reapply regularly while sunbathing.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients/INCI:&lt;/strong&gt; Isopropyl Myristate, Coco/Caprylate-Caprate, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Simmondsia Chinensis Seed Oil, Persea Gratissima Oil, Mauritia Flexuosa Fruit Oil, Ethylhexyl Salicylate, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Tocopherol, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Hippophae Rhamnoides (Seabuckthorn) Fruit Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Parfum, Polycitronellol, Phenoxyethanol, Caprylyl Glycol, Propylene Glycol.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
