<item>
<sku>154383</sku>
<name>Apis Protective Body Emulsion SPF 30 200 ml</name>
<description>&lt;h2&gt;Apis Protective Body Emulsion SPF 30 200 ml&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;We present to you the ideal waterproof body emulsion—lightweight yet nourishing. It effectively protects the skin from the harmful effects of UVA and UVB radiation while giving it a healthy tone. Its unique formula combines photostable sunscreens with nourishing ingredients such as cocoa butter, buriti oil, and sea buckthorn extract, which not only care for the skin but also have antioxidant properties. Additionally, hyaluronic acid provides intense hydration, panthenol soothes, marine plankton extract supports regeneration, and squalane strengthens the skin's protective barrier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Indications:&lt;/strong&gt; Suitable for all skin types.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contraindications:&lt;/strong&gt; Allergy to any of the product's ingredients. Perform an allergy test before use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to use: &lt;/strong&gt;Apply the emulsion to the skin at least 15–20 minutes before sun exposure. Reapply every 2–3 hours. Apply regularly for effective protection against UVA/UVB radiation.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients/INCI:&lt;/strong&gt; Aqua, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate, Ethylhexyl Triazone, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Propanediol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Lecithin, Mauritia Flexuosa Fruit Oil, Theobroma Cacao Seed Butter, Squalane, Sodium Acrylates Copolymer, Glycerin, Plankton Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, D-panthenol, Cetearyl Alcohol &amp;amp; Ceteareth 20, Hippophae Rhamnoides (Seabuckthorn) Fruit Extract, Polycitronellol, Parfum, Phenoxyethanol, Caprylyl Glycol, Propylene Glycol, Xanthan Gum, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
