<item>
<sku>154384</sku>
<name>Apis Protective Body Emulsion SPF 50 200 ml</name>
<description>&lt;h2&gt;Apis Protective Body Emulsion SPF 50 200 ml&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Looking for a body care product that offers high sun protection while deeply moisturizing and nourishing your skin? This body emulsion is the perfect combination of skincare and UVA/UVB protection, thanks to photostable filters that don’t leave white residue or weigh down the skin. Cocoa butter and buriti oil provide deep hydration and nourishment. Sea buckthorn and marine plankton extracts help protect the skin from free radicals. Additionally, hyaluronic acid, panthenol, and squalane support regeneration, soothe irritation, and ensure long-lasting moisture.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Indications:&lt;/strong&gt; Suitable for all skin types.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contraindications:&lt;/strong&gt; Allergy to any of the ingredients. Perform a patch test before use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to use:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply the emulsion to your skin at least 15–20 minutes before sun exposure. Reapply every 2–3 hours. Use regularly for effective UVA/UVB protection.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients/INCI:&lt;/strong&gt; Aqua, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate, Ethylhexyl Triazone, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Propanediol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Lecithin, Mauritia Flexuosa Fruit Oil, Theobroma Cacao Seed Butter, Squalane, Sodium Acrylates Copolymer, Glycerin, Plankton Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, D-panthenol, Cetearyl Alcohol &amp;amp; Ceteareth 20, Hippophae Rhamnoides (Seabuckthorn) Fruit Extract, Polycitronellol, Parfum, Phenoxyethanol, Caprylyl Glycol, Propylene Glycol, Xanthan Gum, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
