<item>
<sku>154385</sku>
<name>Apis Soothing After Sun Body Balm 200 ml</name>
<description>&lt;h2&gt;Apis Soothing After Sun Body Balm 200 ml&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;After sun exposure, your skin needs intensive regeneration and hydration. That’s why we created this nourishing and restorative after sun balm that restores comfort and supports a healthy appearance. Its formula is based on effective soothing and moisturizing ingredients that replenish lipid deficiencies and reduce oxidative stress caused by sun radiation. It contains calming panthenol, regenerating borage seed oil, protective squalane, and an extract from the green alga Enteromorpha Compressa, known for its intensely soothing and moisturizing properties. We've also enriched the balm with nourishing buriti oil, shea butter, hyaluronic acid, and aloe vera extract. Thanks to the sea buckthorn extract, your skin maintains good condition and a radiant, golden tone. It’s the perfect skin support after a sun-filled day!&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Indications: &lt;/strong&gt;Suitable for all skin types.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contraindications:&lt;/strong&gt; Allergy to any of the ingredients. Perform a patch test before use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to use:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply an appropriate amount of balm to the skin and gently massage until fully absorbed.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients/INCI:&lt;/strong&gt; Aqua, Mauritia Flexuosa Fruit Oil, Borago Officinalis Seed Oil, D-panthenol, Butyrospermum Parkii Butter, Propanediol, Sodium Acrylates Copolymer &amp;amp; Lecithin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Squalane, Glycerin, Plankton Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Hippophae Rhamnoides (Seabuckthorn) Fruit Extract, Propanediol, Enteromorpha Compressa Extract, Silybum Marianum Fruit Extract, Ocimum Sanctum Leaf Extract, Cetearyl Alcohol &amp;amp; Ceteareth 20, Polycitronellol, Xanthan Gum, Phenoxyethanol, Caprylyl Glycol, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Propylene Glycol, Parfum, Citric Acid.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
