<item>
<sku>153445</sku>
<name>Barber chair Gabbiano President green</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153446/EN_153446_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano&lt;/strong&gt; is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship, as well as high comfort of use. The offer includes a large selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, washers and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153446/EN_153446_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Elegant barber chair&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The stylish &lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano President barber chair&lt;/strong&gt; is a practical piece of furniture equipped with &lt;strong&gt;a durable hydraulic lift and an adjustable footrest and backrest&lt;/strong&gt;. Wide possibilities of adjusting the position allow you to adjust the chair to the treatments performed, which significantly&lt;strong&gt; increases the comfort of services&lt;/strong&gt;. The aesthetic finish makes the chair a decoration of any interior, and its high functionality ensures&lt;strong&gt; comfort and efficiency of work&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153446/EN_153446_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Wide adjustment possibilities&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The efficient hydraulic lift&lt;/strong&gt; allows you to freely adjust the seat height &lt;strong&gt;within 54-67 cm&lt;/strong&gt;, even when the client is sitting on the chair. This guarantees &lt;strong&gt;more ergonomic operation&lt;/strong&gt; and allows the seat level to be adjusted to suit the height of both the client and the person performing the treatment. The chair has &lt;strong&gt;a reclining backrest and an adjustable footrest&lt;/strong&gt;, thanks to which it is possible to place the client in &lt;strong&gt;a convenient, semi-reclining position&lt;/strong&gt;. This setting guarantees better access during certain services. Additionally, the headrest, which &lt;strong&gt;extends by 20 cm&lt;/strong&gt;, provides excellent head support, thanks to the possibility of adjusting it to individual needs.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153446/EN_153446_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Facilities for comfort of work&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A comfortable, wide seat&lt;/strong&gt; guarantees the customer comfort during a variety of services. The profiled backrest allows to take a convenient position, &lt;strong&gt;providing excellent back support&lt;/strong&gt;, which is especially important during longer treatments. Equipping the chair with &lt;strong&gt;a full rotation mechanism&lt;/strong&gt; makes work more effective and comfortable. Upholstered armrests placed at the appropriate height allow &lt;strong&gt;the client's shoulders to be positioned correctly&lt;/strong&gt; – this ensures that the client does not bury his head in his shoulders or hunch over – significantly facilitating the performance of precise treatments. &lt;strong&gt;The opening left between the backrest and the seat&lt;/strong&gt; makes it easier to keep the salon clean, allowing you to easily sweep hair from every nook and cranny of the chair. This facilitates the preparation of the workstation between clients.&lt;strong&gt; A towel holder&lt;/strong&gt; that can be placed under the armrest significantly affects work efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153446/EN_153446_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Sophisticated design with high functionality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The solid construction of the base&lt;/strong&gt; ensures stability and high comfort of use. The seat filling is made of durable, deformation-resistant foam and the upholstery is made of pleasant-to-touch synthetic leather with a semi-matte finish, ensuring &lt;strong&gt;the durability of the furniture and its comfortable use for a long time&lt;/strong&gt;. They also make the equipment &lt;strong&gt;resistant to moisture, durable and easy to clean&lt;/strong&gt;. The covering in shades of green with quilting and decorative buttons gives it a unique character. The chair with a characteristic design, &lt;strong&gt;referring to the vintage style&lt;/strong&gt;, perfectly fits the atmosphere of barbershops, emphasizing their unique atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153446/EN_153446_6.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Detailed dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes:&lt;/strong&gt; seat, actuator with base, footrest, headrest.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lift: hydraulic&lt;br&gt;Base: round&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Color: shades of green&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/KMloQCr5h54" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;</description>
<price>691.05</price>
