s comfortable use for a long time&lt;/strong&gt;. They also make the equipment &lt;strong&gt;resistant to moisture, durable and easy to clean&lt;/strong&gt;. The covering in shades of green with quilting and decorative buttons gives it a unique character. The chair with a characteristic design, &lt;strong&gt;referring to the vintage style&lt;/strong&gt;, perfectly fits the atmosphere of barbershops, emphasizing their unique atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153445/EN_153445_6.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Detailed dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes:&lt;/strong&gt; seat, actuator with base, footrest, headrest.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lift: hydraulic&lt;br&gt;Base: round&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Color: shades of green&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/KMloQCr5h54" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;</description>
