<item>
<sku>153411</sku>
<name>Gabbiano barber chair Francesco Black black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153411/EN_153411_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano&lt;/strong&gt; is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship, as well as high comfort of use. The offer includes a large selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, washers and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153411/EN_153411_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unique barber chair&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The stylish &lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano Francesco barber chair&lt;/strong&gt; is a modern piece of furniture equipped with a hydraulic lift and &lt;strong&gt;adjustable footrest and backrest&lt;/strong&gt;. Significant customization options allow you to adjust the chair to the procedure being performed, which &lt;strong&gt;significantly increases the comfort of services&lt;/strong&gt;. The aesthetic finish will make the chair a decoration of every barber's salon, and its &lt;strong&gt;high functionality&lt;/strong&gt; will ensure comfort and efficiency of work.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153411/EN_153411_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wide adjustment possibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The durable hydraulic lift&lt;/strong&gt; allows the seat height to be &lt;strong&gt;adjusted within 54-67 cm&lt;/strong&gt;, even when the client is sitting in the chair. This guarantees &lt;strong&gt;more ergonomic operation&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring that the seat level can be adjusted to suit the height of both the client and the person performing the treatment. The chair has &lt;strong&gt;a reclining backrest and an adjustable footrest&lt;/strong&gt;, making it possible &lt;strong&gt;to place the client in a convenient, semi-reclining position&lt;/strong&gt;. This positioning guarantees better access during certain services. Additionally, &lt;strong&gt;the extendable headrest&lt;/strong&gt; provides excellent head support and can be adjusted to individual needs.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153411/EN_153411_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilities for comfort of work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A wide seat&lt;/strong&gt; filled with deformation-resistant foam guarantees the client comfort during treatments. &lt;strong&gt;The backrest is upholstered with synthetic leather&lt;/strong&gt; and allows you to take a convenient position, providing &lt;strong&gt;excellent support for the back&lt;/strong&gt;, which is especially important during longer treatments. Equipping the chair with &lt;strong&gt;a full rotation mechanism&lt;/strong&gt; makes the hairdresser's work more effective and comfortable. Upholstered armrests placed at the appropriate height &lt;strong&gt;allow the client's shoulders to be positioned correctly&lt;/strong&gt; – this means that he does not bury his head in his shoulders or slouch – significantly facilitating the performance of precise treatments. &lt;strong&gt;The solid, wide base&lt;/strong&gt; ensures excellent stability of the furniture during operation.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153411/EN_153411_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unique, old-school design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The stable construction of the base&lt;/strong&gt; with elements in shades of black ensures high comfort of use. Filling with &lt;strong&gt;durable, deformation-resistant foam&lt;/strong&gt; and upholstery made of &lt;strong&gt;pleasant-to-touch synthetic leather&lt;/strong&gt; ensure the durability of the furniture and its comfortable use for a long time. They also make the equipment &lt;strong&gt;resistant to moisture, durable and easy to clean&lt;/strong&gt;. The covering in shades of black along with original quilting and decorative buttons give it &lt;strong&gt;a unique character&lt;/strong&gt;. Designer decorative elements inspired by motorcycles, &lt;strong&gt;referring to the vintage style&lt;/strong&gt;, will perfectly fit the atmosphere of barbershops, creating their amazing aura.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/3wUlUTCerRM" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Detailed dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes:&lt;/strong&gt; seat, actuator with base, footrest, headrest.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lift: hydraulic&lt;br&gt;Base: round&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Color of upholstery: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Base colour: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  </description>
