<item>
<sku>150213</sku>
<name>Nghia export tweezers T-10</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NGHIA &lt;/strong&gt;offers stainless steel products, including professional manicure tools that significantly enhance the daily lives of beauty customers. The brand aims to effectively meet consumers' needs by offering the highest quality products.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150213/EN_150213_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Precision tool&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The elegant &lt;strong&gt;NGHIA T-10 point tweezers&lt;/strong&gt; are made of high-quality stainless steel, making them &lt;strong&gt;durable and dull-resistant&lt;/strong&gt;, as well as suitable for disinfection and autoclave sterilisation. It will be perfect for &lt;strong&gt;cosmetic procedures requiring precision&lt;/strong&gt;, especially when adjusting or styling eyebrows and removing ingrown nails. &lt;strong&gt;These tweezers will be a pleasure to work with&lt;/strong&gt;, both in the beauty salon and at home.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Comfortable to work with&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The narrow gripping surface makes the tool &lt;strong&gt;extremely precise&lt;/strong&gt; - using it, you can easily reach any unwanted hair. The carefully shaped arms guarantee&lt;strong&gt; comfortable and precise manoeuvring&lt;/strong&gt;, while the narrow blade allows you to comfortably grip even the finest hairs and shape your eyebrows with precision. The smooth finish gives the tool &lt;strong&gt;an elegant and unique character&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150213/EN_150213_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Durability and functionality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The tweezers are equipped with &lt;strong&gt;a practical stopper&lt;/strong&gt; that keeps the arms of the tool joined together after use. This ensures&lt;strong&gt; safe storage&lt;/strong&gt; and protects the tips from accidental damage or dulling. In this way, the tweezers &lt;strong&gt;retain their precision and effectiveness&lt;/strong&gt; for longer and their use remains comfortable and reliable.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dimensions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tweezer length: 116 mm&lt;br&gt;Material: stainless steel&lt;br&gt;Colour: shades of chrome&lt;/p&gt;  </description>
