<item>
<sku>132734</sku>
<name>Gabbiano Ankara hairdressing wash unit grey</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/132734/EN_132734_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano &lt;/strong&gt;is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship and high comfort of use. It offers a large selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, washers and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/132734/EN_132734_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Comfortable wash unit for modern salons&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The stylish &lt;strong&gt;Ankara hairdressing wash unit&lt;/strong&gt; with a geometrically shaped chair supports efficient performance of hair care and washing treatments. It was designed with functional equipment of hairdressing salons in mind. &lt;strong&gt;The integrated design&lt;/strong&gt; provides comfort for both hairdresser and client, and the careful workmanship with&lt;strong&gt; effective side stitching &lt;/strong&gt;makes it a decoration of any interior.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/132734/EN_132734_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Comfortable use&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The deep ceramic bowl&lt;/strong&gt; in shades of white effectively reduces splashing of water and preparations used during treatments. This promotes comfortable and precise performance of various hairdressing services. &lt;strong&gt;The movable construction of the bowl&lt;/strong&gt; allows for easy adjustment of the angle of inclination to individual needs. The material used is &lt;strong&gt;durable, resistant to discolouration and scratches&lt;/strong&gt;, and easy to keep clean. &lt;strong&gt;The appropriately profiled collar&lt;/strong&gt; provides comfortable head support during washing, while &lt;strong&gt;the comfortable plastic cover&lt;/strong&gt; in shades of black eliminates the feeling of coldness of the ceramic surface.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/132734/EN_132734_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Well-thought-out amenities and accessories&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The wash unit is equipped &lt;strong&gt;with a mixer tap&lt;/strong&gt; for convenient hot and cold water and easy temperature adjustment of the temperature to the client's needs. A practical place to put the shower handset &lt;strong&gt;makes it easier to organise work &lt;/strong&gt;and keep the station tidy. &lt;strong&gt;The plug with a strainer &lt;/strong&gt;allows you to control the water flow, while &lt;strong&gt;maintaining high hygiene standards&lt;/strong&gt;. The set includes complete fittings – a tap, shower handset and dedicated hoses, which &lt;strong&gt;create a ready-to-install set&lt;/strong&gt;. The water connection has been placed inside the base of the wash unit, &lt;strong&gt;enabling the installation to be aesthetically concealed&lt;/strong&gt;. In the base of the washer there are &lt;strong&gt;places to screw&amp;nbsp;it&lt;/strong&gt; to the ground - this solution increases the stability of the entire structure. The combination of functional solutions and well-thought-out details translates into &lt;strong&gt;the comfort of everyday work in the hairdressing salon&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/132734/EN_132734_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Functional furniture with an elegant touch&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ergonomically profiled chair&lt;/strong&gt;, filled with durable and deformation-resistant foam, &lt;strong&gt;provides high comfort of use &lt;/strong&gt;for both the client and the practitioner. Upholstered armrests &lt;strong&gt;with decorative side stitching&lt;/strong&gt; allow for a natural positioning of the arms and shoulders, &lt;strong&gt;supporting the correct posture &lt;/strong&gt;while sitting. The structure of the chair has been designed to provide comfort during various procedures, and &lt;strong&gt;the appropriately reclined backrest supports&lt;/strong&gt; the spine and increases the comfort of visits. The upholstery made of high-quality synthetic leather in shades of gray is distinguished by its elegant appearance, durability and ease of cleaning. The whole creates a &lt;strong&gt;modern, aesthetically pleasing piece of furniture&lt;/strong&gt; that fits perfectly into the decor of a professional salon, giving the interior a unique character.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/G-r_020FMsE" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Detailed dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Bowl material: ceramic&lt;br&gt;Bowl colour: shades of white&lt;br&gt;Upholstery colour: shades of gray&lt;br&gt;Base colour: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Fitting colour: shades of chrome and black&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>479.67</price>
<category_subcategory>Hairdressing salon equipment&gt;Hairdressing furniture&gt;Armchairs and hairdressing washes&gt;Ankara</category_subcategory>
<qty>12</qty>
<weight>56.0000</weight>
<brand>GABBIANO</brand>
<tax>23%</tax>
<EAN>5906717433498</EAN>
