<item>
<sku>153418</sku>
<name>Gabbiano hairdressing wash unit Sylvia black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153418/EN_153418_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano &lt;/strong&gt;is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship and high comfort of use. It offers a large selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, washers and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153418/EN_153418_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Professional hair wash with massage for full comfort&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Gabbiano Sylvia electric hairdressing wash unit with back massage function&lt;/strong&gt; is a combination of comfort, aesthetics and functionality. &lt;strong&gt;The fold-out, electrically adjustable footrest&lt;/strong&gt; allows easy adjustment of the position to suit the client's needs, increasing comfort during hair washing.&lt;strong&gt; Intuitive operation and ergonomic design&lt;/strong&gt; make working with the device not only convenient, but also exceptionally effective.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153418/EN_153418_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Adaptation to needs&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The electrically adjustable footrest&lt;/strong&gt;, controlled by buttons located on the back of the chair, allows for &lt;strong&gt;precise adjustment of the position to the client's needs&lt;/strong&gt;. Ergonomic body positioning helps reduce muscle tension, which &lt;strong&gt;significantly increases comfort&lt;/strong&gt; – especially during longer care treatments. This &lt;strong&gt;combination of convenience and functionality&lt;/strong&gt; means that the wash unit will meet the expectations of even the most demanding users.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153418/EN_153418_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Relaxing back massage&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The built-in back massage system&lt;/strong&gt; based on moving rollers is a real complement to the moment of relaxation while washing hair washing. The mechanism provides a &lt;strong&gt;precise and soothing massage&lt;/strong&gt; along the spine. The four rollers gently relax tense muscles, which promotes relaxation and improves well-being. This is the perfect complement to scalp massage – together they create a &lt;strong&gt;comprehensive care ritual &lt;/strong&gt;that customers will remember for a long time.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153418/EN_153418_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Tasteful washbasin for comfort of use&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The depth of the ceramic bowl of the basin bowl in shades of black allows for &lt;strong&gt;comfortable and effective&lt;/strong&gt; performance of a wide range of hairdressing services,&lt;strong&gt; preventing excessive splashing of water&lt;/strong&gt; and products used during the treatment. The material used makes the washbasin &lt;strong&gt;durable, resistant to discolouration and scratches&lt;/strong&gt;, and very easy to keep clean. The appropriately &lt;strong&gt;profiled collar and inclined backrest&lt;/strong&gt; provide support and comfort while washing hair, and thanks to &lt;strong&gt;the comfortable plastic overlay&lt;/strong&gt; in shades of black, the customer will not feel any discomfort associated with the cold ceramic surface.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153418/EN_153418_6.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Optimal amenities&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The wash unit is equipped &lt;strong&gt;with a mixer tap&lt;/strong&gt; that allows the water temperature to be easily adjusted to the customer's preference. &lt;strong&gt;A plug with a special strainer&lt;/strong&gt; controls the water flow and supports &lt;strong&gt;maintaining a high level of hygiene&lt;/strong&gt;. A dedicated place to hang up the handset makes everyday work easier, and the water connection hidden inside the column under the sink &lt;strong&gt;allows you to hide the installation&lt;/strong&gt; and maintain the aesthetics of the interior. The set includes a &lt;strong&gt;set of fittings&lt;/strong&gt; in black and chrome – a tap, a shower head and matching hoses – ready for immediate assembly and operation. The chair is profiled in such a way as to &lt;strong&gt;provide comfort&lt;/strong&gt; during various treatments, and the footrest guarantees excellent support for the legs. &lt;strong&gt;The combination of functionality and amenities&lt;/strong&gt; makes work in a hairdressing salon even more comfortable.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153418/EN_153418_7.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Modern design paired with functionality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The Gabbiano Sylvia hairdressing wash unit &lt;strong&gt;was created with maximum comfort for both the client and the stylist in mind&lt;/strong&gt; – it is ideal for care treatments, colouring or longer procedures. &lt;strong&gt;The simple, geometric form&lt;/strong&gt; and clearly defined lines of the seat and armrests give it a modern, elegant character. The backrest set at an optimal angle provides &lt;strong&gt;adequate support for the spine&lt;/strong&gt;, and stylish stitching adds aesthetics to the whole. The profiled seat is filled with durable foam, while the upholstered armrests allow &lt;strong&gt;for the correct positioning of the shoulders and arms&lt;/strong&gt;. The cover made of high-quality synthetic leather in shades of black is distinguished by its &lt;strong&gt;durability and ease of cleaning&lt;/strong&gt;. The wash unit looks elegant and modern, emphasizing the style of the salon.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VuhB0G-LEUA" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Actuator: electric&lt;br&gt;Bowl material: ceramic&lt;br&gt;Bowl colour: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Upholstery colour: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Fittings colour: shades of black and chrome&lt;br&gt;Power:&lt;br&gt;Warranty: 12 months&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>1016.26</price>
<category_subcategory>Hairdressing salon equipment&gt;Hairdressing furniture&gt;Armchairs and hairdressing washes&gt;Others</category_subcategory>
