<item>
<sku>153420</sku>
<name>Gabbiano Hairdressing wash unit Carmen black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153420/EN_153420_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano &lt;/strong&gt;is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship and high comfort of use. It offers a large selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, washers and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153420/EN_153420_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Essential element of a hairdressing salon&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Gabbiano Carmen hairdressing wash unit with an adjustable footrest&lt;/strong&gt; is a practical, stylish element of hairdressing salon equipment. It allows for &lt;strong&gt;comfortable performance of basic treatments&lt;/strong&gt;, such as washing, colouring or hair care. The integrated design provides comfort for both the stylist and the client, while the modern design emphasizes the character of the interior. &lt;strong&gt;The adjustable footrest &lt;/strong&gt;further enhances comfort during each treatment.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153420/EN_153420_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Practical washbasin&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A black ceramic bowl of appropriate depth effectively &lt;strong&gt;minimises splashing of water&lt;/strong&gt; and preparations used during treatments.&lt;strong&gt; The adjustable angle of inclination &lt;/strong&gt;makes it easy to adjust its positioning to individual needs, which translates into &lt;strong&gt;comfort and efficiency of work&lt;/strong&gt;. The high-quality material ensures &lt;strong&gt;durability, resistance to scratches and discolouration&lt;/strong&gt;, and also makes it easier to keep clean. The appropriately profiled collar provides &lt;strong&gt;optimal support &lt;/strong&gt;and comfort during hair washing, while &lt;strong&gt;the comfortable plastic cover &lt;/strong&gt;in shades of black ensures that the client will feel any discomfort associated with the cold ceramic surface.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153420/EN_153420_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Functional amenities for convenience&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A manually adjustable footrest&lt;/strong&gt;, operated by a lever, increases comfort during treatments. The wash unit is equipped &lt;strong&gt;with a mixer tap&lt;/strong&gt;, which allows you to easily adjust the water temperature to the client's preferences. &lt;strong&gt;A practical place for the handset&lt;/strong&gt; promotes better organisation of the station, and a &lt;strong&gt;plug with a strainer&lt;/strong&gt; allows you to control the water flow and supports hygiene. The water connection is hidden in the base, allowing the installation to be routed without visible pipes. &lt;strong&gt;The ergonomic form of the wash unit&lt;/strong&gt; guarantees comfort for both the client and the hairdresser, facilitating the implementation of various services. The whole creates a functional and &lt;strong&gt;comfortable solution for everyday use&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153420/EN_153420_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Functional piece of furniture with a modern design&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A contoured chair with durable foam padding provides &lt;strong&gt;adequate support for the lumbar region&lt;/strong&gt;, which translates into high comfort of use. Upholstered armrests allow&lt;strong&gt; the client's shoulders to be positioned correctly&lt;/strong&gt;, supporting a comfortable position during the treatment. Soft-to-the-touch synthetic leather in shades of black is distinguished by its &lt;strong&gt;durability, ease of cleaning and resistance to moisture&lt;/strong&gt;. The modern form of the wash unit adds a distinctive style to the interior. The set&lt;strong&gt; includes full fittings&lt;/strong&gt; in black – a faucet, a shower head and dedicated hoses – &lt;strong&gt;creating a ready set for everyday work&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/2iAnr4n09Yk" width="560" height="315" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Detailed dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Bowl material: ceramic&lt;br&gt;Bowl colour: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Upholstery colour: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Base colour: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Fitting colour: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;/p&gt;</description>
