<item>
<sku>154438</sku>
<name>Set of wheels 4pc. 8"</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;For many years, &lt;strong&gt;the ACTIVESHOP&lt;/strong&gt; brand has offered a wide range of products that work well for professional use in many industries. In the available assortment you can find items from various categories, from small essential accessories to specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Stability and smooth movement&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;set of four caster wheels&lt;/strong&gt; designed for installation in mobile furniture such as magnifying glass S4. They ensure smooth movement across various surfaces and precise maneuvering even in tight workspaces. The wheels are &lt;strong&gt;mounted using a threaded pin with a diameter of 8 mm&lt;/strong&gt; (M8), allowing for quick installation in furniture equipped with a compatible threaded hole.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Durable and functional&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The plastic used &lt;strong&gt;combines functionality with durability&lt;/strong&gt;, making it suitable for everyday use. The double-wheel design provides &lt;strong&gt;better weight distribution&lt;/strong&gt;, resulting in greater stability and longer service life of the entire set. Thanks to the thoughtful design, the wheels &lt;strong&gt;perform well in high-usage environments&lt;/strong&gt;—enhancing comfort, safety, and work ergonomics.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Set includes 4 pieces.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Material: plastic &lt;br&gt;Mount type: threaded pin &lt;br&gt;Pin diameter: 8 mm &lt;br&gt;Pin height: 14 mm&lt;/p&gt;</description>
