<item>
<sku>152013</sku>
<name>Gabbiano barber station for hair washing 5023</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152013/EN_152013_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano&lt;/strong&gt; is a luxurious brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics, as well as high comfort of use. The offer includes a large selection of functional salon equipment elements, such as armchairs, hair washes and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152013/EN_152013_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Functional barber wash station&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Gabbiano 5023 barber station&lt;/strong&gt; for hair washing is a practical solution designed for barbershops and intimate hairdressing salons. &lt;strong&gt;It combines work comfort with aesthetics&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing you to organise the space well and ensure the comfort of your customers.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152013/EN_152013_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Comfortable plastic bowl&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The deep black bowl&lt;/strong&gt; is made of durable plastic, which makes it &lt;strong&gt;resistant to damage and easy to keep clean&lt;/strong&gt;. Its well-thought-out design effectively &lt;strong&gt;reduces splashing of water&lt;/strong&gt; and preparations during washing. &lt;strong&gt;The ergonomic shape and profiled collar with a silicone cover&lt;/strong&gt; provide the client with a comfortable head position.&lt;strong&gt; A practical place for the shower handset&lt;/strong&gt; helps to better organize the station, and &lt;strong&gt;the plug with a strainer&lt;/strong&gt; makes it easier to control the water flow and maintain cleanliness and hygiene.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152013/EN_152013_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Practical details&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The side door&lt;/strong&gt; provides easy access to the installation and &lt;strong&gt;allows storage of the most necessary products&lt;/strong&gt; in a discreet way. The rear hole for the water connection allows &lt;strong&gt;for convenient and aesthetic connection of the station&lt;/strong&gt;, while at the same time making it possible to hide the pipes and drain, which &lt;strong&gt;promotes maintaining order&lt;/strong&gt; and a professional appearance of the station. &lt;strong&gt;The compact form of the furniture&lt;/strong&gt; makes it ideal for both large salons and smaller spaces.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/152013/EN_152013_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Style and durability&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The barber station is made of furniture panels in shades of deep black, which gives it &lt;strong&gt;an elegant and expressive character&lt;/strong&gt; – perfectly fitting into modern interiors. &lt;strong&gt;The set includes chrome fittings&lt;/strong&gt;: a faucet, a shower handset and flexible hoses, ensuring full functionality. The chrome accents perfectly match the matte surface of the construction, &lt;strong&gt;emphasizing the modern style&lt;/strong&gt; and professional finish of the furniture.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Bowl material: plastic&lt;br&gt;Bowl colour: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Base colour: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Fitting colour: shades of chrome&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>201.42</price>
