<item>
<sku>154221</sku>
<name>Sakura Prime 108 massage chair black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154221/EN_154221_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sakura &lt;/strong&gt;massage chairs ensure relaxation and high comfort of use. They are also an excellent way to take care of your health and well-being. A variety of functions and ease of use make the chairs of this brand an excellent choice for both massage parlours and home use. Made with attention to detail, they will become an aesthetic element of any space.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154221/EN_154221_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Deep massage for complete relaxation&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sakura Prime 108&lt;/strong&gt; is a comfortable massage chair that provides&lt;strong&gt; a comprehensive full-body massage&lt;/strong&gt;. Equipped with massage heads for the back and buttocks and airbags that perform pressure massage of various parts of the body, it &lt;strong&gt;promotes deep relaxation, muscle relaxation and improvement of general well-being&lt;/strong&gt;. The main benefits of using the chair include &lt;strong&gt;improved circulation, reduced muscle tension and reduced stress levels&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154221/EN_154221_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Control panel with LCD screen&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A clear control panel &lt;strong&gt;with an easy-to-read LCD screen&lt;/strong&gt; ensures intuitive operation of the chair. It can be conveniently placed in the handle on the right armrest or held in the hand. The display presents &lt;strong&gt;information about the body part currently being massaged&lt;/strong&gt;, intensity, session duration and selected program. Using the panel, you can easily adjust the position of the chair, select the preferred massage mode and &lt;strong&gt;set the treatment time – 15, 20, 25 or 30 minutes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154221/EN_154221_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Optional armrest controls&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;For even greater convenience, the chair is equipped &lt;strong&gt;with an additional set of control buttons located on the left armrest&lt;/strong&gt;. The built-in handy control allows quick access to the most important functions &lt;strong&gt;without having to reach for the main panel&lt;/strong&gt;. The user can easily &lt;strong&gt;change the type of massage, start the foot massage and activate the Zero Gravity function&lt;/strong&gt; – all with maximum comfort and relaxation in mind.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154221/EN_154221_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Automatic programs tailored to your needs&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Five automatic programs&lt;/strong&gt; have been designed with different user needs in mind – from intense regeneration to deep relaxation. Each of them &lt;strong&gt;uses carefully selected sequences&lt;/strong&gt; of massage heads, airbags, heating function and Zero Gravity mode.&lt;strong&gt; Simply select the appropriate program &lt;/strong&gt;on the control panel:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;• Kneading&lt;/strong&gt; – Medium intensity lower back massage, enriched with foot and buttock massage and activation of airbags on the entire body. Helps to relax muscles and reduce tension.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;• Tuina (Tui Na)&lt;/strong&gt; – Focused on the neck and shoulder area, a massage of medium intensity. Supports muscle regeneration, improves circulation and makes it easier to fall asleep.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;• Strong&lt;/strong&gt; – Intensive massage of the back, buttocks and feet with full activity of airbags. Ideal for people who need deep relaxation and stimulate circulation.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;• Leisure&lt;/strong&gt; – Default program covering the entire back, feet and buttocks. Medium intensity combined with full-body pressure massage improves circulation, relieves tension and has a positive effect on well-being.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;• Sleep&lt;/strong&gt; – Gentle massage with a swing mode. It calms the body, relaxes the muscles and facilitates falling asleep, ensuring complete relaxation.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154221/EN_154221_6.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Zero gravity mode&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Choosing the ZERO GRAVITY mode sets the chair&lt;strong&gt; in a position inspired by the position of the astronauts' bodies during rocket launch&lt;/strong&gt; – to minimize the impact of gravity on the body. In this position,&lt;strong&gt; the body weight is evenly distributed over the entire surface of the chair&lt;/strong&gt;, which significantly reduces the pressure on the spine, relaxes the muscles and promotes better blood and lymph circulation. This is considered&lt;strong&gt; the most beneficial position for massage&lt;/strong&gt; – providing maximum relaxation and comfort.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154221/EN_154221_7.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Precise back and foot massage&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The advanced massage mechanism &lt;strong&gt;effectively relaxes the muscles&lt;/strong&gt;, acting multidimensionally. &lt;strong&gt;Eight heads precisely massage the back, thighs and buttocks&lt;/strong&gt;, replicating manual massage techniques – kneading and pressing. This treatment improves the condition of the entire body, &lt;strong&gt;helps to relieve pain and reduce muscle tension&lt;/strong&gt;. After each session, a significant reduction in muscle tension is felt, and the body becomes relaxed and relieved. Additionally, &lt;strong&gt;the built-in foot massager uses acupressure &lt;/strong&gt;to effectively relax tired muscles, &lt;strong&gt;eliminate the feeling of heaviness and support overall well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154221/EN_154221_8.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Effective pressure massage using airbags&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;An effective complement to mechanical massage is &lt;strong&gt;compression massage provided by 18 airbags &lt;/strong&gt;placed in the area of feet, calves, hands, shoulders and head. Their rhythmic action &lt;strong&gt;stimulates lymph circulation, supports the detoxification process and improves blood flow&lt;/strong&gt;. This type of massage promotes muscle oxygenation, lowers blood pressure and contributes to deep relaxation. The range of action and intensity of the airbags &lt;strong&gt;can be easily adjusted to your own needs&lt;/strong&gt; using the control panel.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154221/EN_154221_9.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Additional functions increasing the comfort of the treatment&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The device is equipped with &lt;strong&gt;a back and calf heating function&lt;/strong&gt;, which supports muscle relaxation, improves circulation and &lt;strong&gt;increases the effectiveness of the massage&lt;/strong&gt;. The soothing heat relieves tension, &lt;strong&gt;promotes regeneration&lt;/strong&gt; and intensifies the feeling of relaxation. An additional advantage is &lt;strong&gt;the mechanically adjustable footrest&lt;/strong&gt;, which allows for precise adjustment of the position to the user's height. This allows each massage session to take place &lt;strong&gt;in maximum comfort&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154221/EN_154221_10.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Music for complete relaxation&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thanks to the built-in Bluetooth function&lt;/strong&gt;, it is possible to connect the chair to a mobile device and &lt;strong&gt;play your favourite music during the massage&lt;/strong&gt;. Calm sounds promote relaxation, improve mood and allow you to break away from everyday stimuli. &lt;strong&gt;Combining massage with sound therapy supports deep calm&lt;/strong&gt; and regeneration of body and mind.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154221/EN_154221_11.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Atmospheric backlighting&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The subtle backlighting of the side panels &lt;strong&gt;emphasises the modern design of the device&lt;/strong&gt; and adds elegance to it. The soft colour of the light &lt;strong&gt;promotes calm and relaxation&lt;/strong&gt;, while at the same time enhancing the aesthetics of the surroundings. It is a &lt;strong&gt;stylish decorative accent&lt;/strong&gt; that attracts attention and gives the interior a unique character.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154221/EN_154221_12.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Elegance and comfort in one&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Soft imitation leather in shades of black &lt;strong&gt;provides exceptional comfort of use and ease of cleaning&lt;/strong&gt;. This material is not only aesthetically pleasing, but also &lt;strong&gt;resistant to moisture&lt;/strong&gt;, which increases its functionality. The outer elements in silver combined with a structural finish in black tones give the chair &lt;strong&gt;a modern, stylish look&lt;/strong&gt;. The compact form and subdued colours make the model fit &lt;strong&gt;harmoniously into various interior designs&lt;/strong&gt;. Sakura Prime 108 is an excellent choice &lt;strong&gt;for people looking for everyday relaxation&lt;/strong&gt; – especially after an intense day or demanding physical effort.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/k_I-1gUl140" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Detailed dimensions of the chair are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes:&lt;/strong&gt; chair, footrest, remote control with LCD display, remote control holder, instructions.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Colour: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Seat filling: foam&lt;br&gt;Suggested massage time: 15 minutes&lt;br&gt;Working time adjustment: 15, 20, 25 and 30 minutes&lt;br&gt;Power: 90 W&lt;br&gt;Voltage: 220-240 V&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>648.37</price>
<category_subcategory>Massage equipment and appliances&gt;Massage chairs</category_subcategory>
