<item>
<sku>155361</sku>
<name>Sillon hydraulic cosmetic chair v2 210 cold white</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Sillon &lt;/strong&gt;brand was established as a response to the constantly increasing expectations of users. The equipment in their offer, such as functional cosmetic chairs, is distinguished by good quality and, at the same time, affordable price.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/155361/EN_155361_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity and functionality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A swivel cosmetic chair&lt;/strong&gt; equipped with a &lt;strong&gt;hydraulic actuator&lt;/strong&gt; is a practical piece of equipment that will be useful in many specialized salons, including beauty, massage or tattoo parlours. It will be suitable for those who are looking for &lt;strong&gt;a simple and functional&lt;/strong&gt; piece of cosmetic furniture.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/155361/EN_155361_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional solutions for comfortable work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The height of the seat can be adjusted in the range of &lt;strong&gt;62-75 cm&lt;/strong&gt; hands-free using a hydraulic pump. This allows for &lt;strong&gt;comfortable use of the equipment&lt;/strong&gt; for people of different heights and allows it to be adapted to the individual needs of both the client and the person performing the procedure. The mechanism used is &lt;strong&gt;very durable and reliable&lt;/strong&gt;. Thanks to the hole in the headrest hidden under a properly profiled cushion, the chair will also be &lt;strong&gt;perfect for treatments carried out on the back&lt;/strong&gt;, such as massages or tattoos.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/155361/EN_155361_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The chair can make &lt;strong&gt;a full rotation&lt;/strong&gt;, which allows you to adjust it to the treatment being performed at the moment. The actuator has a&lt;strong&gt; built-in locking system&lt;/strong&gt;, so that once the selected position is set, the equipment &lt;strong&gt;holds it stably&lt;/strong&gt;. The armrests guarantee &lt;strong&gt;adequate support&lt;/strong&gt;, and can be easily removed if necessary. These elements, divided in half, are movable, so &lt;strong&gt;they lay well&lt;/strong&gt; when changing the position of the backrest.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/155361/EN_155361_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manual adjustment of tilt angles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Using special levers, it is possible to&lt;strong&gt; steplessly adjust the angles&lt;/strong&gt; at which the footrest and backrest are located. This allows for &lt;strong&gt;optimal adjustment of the settings to individual needs&lt;/strong&gt;, for proper and comfortable performance of treatments and comfort of use. The chair can be unfolded up to &lt;strong&gt;the daybed position&lt;/strong&gt;, which significantly increases its functionality.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/155361/EN_155361_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern design and ergonomics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The chair is filled with foam of the right firmness and covered with &lt;strong&gt;semi-matte imitation leather&lt;/strong&gt; in shades of black. Thanks to the use of such material, the equipment is &lt;strong&gt;comfortable to use, resistant to moisture and easy to clean&lt;/strong&gt;. Properly profiled hems give the seat an &lt;strong&gt;ergonomic shape&lt;/strong&gt;. The solid construction guarantees &lt;strong&gt;durability and stability&lt;/strong&gt;. Simple design and classic colors allow it to fit into any interior.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/wQkkPZStH6E" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Exact dimensions are given in the photo. The colour of the product may vary from the actual colour due to individual monitor settings and lighting conditions.  &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes:&lt;/strong&gt; seat with backrest and footrest, set of armrests, hole cushion, base elements with actuator, assembly kit.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Type: hydraulic&lt;br&gt;Number of actuators: 1&lt;br&gt;Frame color: shades of white&lt;br&gt;Color of upholstery: shades of cool white&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Seat filling: foam&lt;br&gt;Length when fully extended: 184 cm&lt;br&gt;Warranty: 12 months&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>201.02</price>
<category_subcategory>Cosmetic furniture&gt;Cosmetic chairs</category_subcategory>
