<item>
<sku>154179</sku>
<name>Hair System barber chair BM88066B black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Hair System&lt;/strong&gt; brand offers a wide range of furniture and equipment for hair salons and barbershops. Among the assortment, you can find stylish reception desks, comfortable hair washers, and practical barber chairs that cater to users' needs.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154179/EN_154179_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Practical barber chair&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The elegant &lt;strong&gt;Hair System BM88066 barber chair&lt;/strong&gt; is a practical piece of furniture equipped with a &lt;strong&gt;durable hydraulic lift&lt;/strong&gt;, an adjustable footrest, and a reclining backrest. The &lt;strong&gt;extensive range of position adjustments&lt;/strong&gt; allows perfect customization of the chair to suit the performed treatments, which &lt;strong&gt;significantly enhances the comfort of the provided services&lt;/strong&gt;. Its aesthetic finish makes the chair &lt;strong&gt;a stylish addition to any interior&lt;/strong&gt;, while its high functionality ensures convenience and efficiency at work.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154179/EN_154179_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Wide range of adjustment possibilities&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;An efficient hydraulic lift allows &lt;strong&gt;the seat height to be freely adjusted between 55-68 cm&lt;/strong&gt;, even when the client is seated. This feature &lt;strong&gt;guarantees ergonomic operation&lt;/strong&gt; and makes it easy to adjust the seat level to suit the height of both the client and the service provider. The chair features a &lt;strong&gt;reclining backrest and an adjustable footrest&lt;/strong&gt;, enabling the client to be placed in a &lt;strong&gt;comfortable semi-reclining position&lt;/strong&gt;. This configuration ensures better access during certain treatments. Additionally, the &lt;strong&gt;20 cm extendable headrest&lt;/strong&gt; provides excellent head support.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154179/EN_154179_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Facilities for work comfort&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The comfortable seat &lt;strong&gt;ensures client relaxation&lt;/strong&gt; during various treatments. The ergonomic backrest, providing &lt;strong&gt;excellent back support&lt;/strong&gt;, allows for a comfortable position, which is particularly beneficial for longer treatments. The inclusion of a &lt;strong&gt;full swivel mechanism&lt;/strong&gt; makes the workflow &lt;strong&gt;more efficient and convenient&lt;/strong&gt;. Upholstered armrests positioned at the ideal height help &lt;strong&gt;correctly align the client's shoulders&lt;/strong&gt;, preventing slouching and maintaining proper posture.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154179/EN_154179_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Elegant design and high functionality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The chair's &lt;strong&gt;solid round base construction&lt;/strong&gt; ensures &lt;strong&gt;stability and excellent user comfort&lt;/strong&gt;. The seat filling, made of deformation-resistant foam, and the upholstery crafted from soft-touch synthetic leather with a matte finish &lt;strong&gt;ensure long-lasting durability&lt;/strong&gt; and comfort during prolonged use. &lt;strong&gt;Stylish stitching on the upholstery&lt;/strong&gt; adds character, evoking automotive design inspirations that &lt;strong&gt;enhance its elegant appearance&lt;/strong&gt;. This feature also makes the chair &lt;strong&gt;moisture-resistant, durable, and easy to clean&lt;/strong&gt;. The upholstery in black tones gives the chair a unique character, and its &lt;strong&gt;minimalist style&lt;/strong&gt; allows it to blend seamlessly with the decor of any barbershop.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/pa6owqyXNHc" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Detailed dimensions are provided in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Included:&lt;/strong&gt; seat, actuator with base, headrest.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lift: hydraulic&lt;br&gt;Base: round&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Frame color: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;</description>
