ead support.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154181/EN_154181_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Facilities for work comfort&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The comfortable seat &lt;strong&gt;ensures client relaxation&lt;/strong&gt; during various treatments. The ergonomic backrest, providing &lt;strong&gt;excellent back support&lt;/strong&gt;, allows for a comfortable position, which is particularly beneficial for longer treatments. The inclusion of a &lt;strong&gt;full swivel mechanism&lt;/strong&gt; makes the workflow &lt;strong&gt;more efficient and convenient&lt;/strong&gt;. Upholstered armrests positioned at the ideal height help &lt;strong&gt;correctly align the client's shoulders&lt;/strong&gt;, preventing slouching and maintaining proper posture.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154181/EN_154181_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Elegant design and high functionality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The chair's &lt;strong&gt;solid round base construction&lt;/strong&gt; ensures &lt;strong&gt;stability and excellent user comfort&lt;/strong&gt;. The seat filling, made of deformation-resistant foam, and the upholstery crafted from soft-touch synthetic leather with a matte finish &lt;strong&gt;ensure long-lasting durability&lt;/strong&gt; and comfort during prolonged use. &lt;strong&gt;Stylish stitching on the upholstery&lt;/strong&gt; adds character, evoking automotive design inspirations that &lt;strong&gt;enhance its elegant appearance&lt;/strong&gt;. This feature also makes the chair &lt;strong&gt;moisture-resistant, durable, and easy to clean&lt;/strong&gt;. The upholstery in burgundy tones gives the chair a unique character, and its &lt;strong&gt;minimalist style&lt;/strong&gt; allows it to blend seamlessly with the decor of any barbershop.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/pa6owqyXNHc" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Detailed dimensions are provided in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Included:&lt;/strong&gt; seat, actuator with base, headrest.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lift: hydraulic&lt;br&gt;Base: round&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of burgundy&lt;br&gt;Frame color: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;</description>
