<item>
<sku>155413</sku>
<name>Farmona UNIQUE SKIN Actively Strengthening Night Serum with Bioretinol 30 ml</name>
<description>&lt;h2&gt;Actively Strengthening Night Serum with Bioretinol&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;An active strengthening serum designed for all skin types requiring a strengthened epidermal barrier, including thin, sensitive, vascular, and irritated skin.&lt;br&gt;A highly concentrated formula designed for use with ultrasound or needle-free mesotherapy. This safe product delivers visible results.&lt;br&gt;It strengthens and tones the skin, soothes irritations, and nourishes the hydrolipid barrier of the epidermis, visibly improving skin condition. The serum has a very pleasant scent.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Active ingredients:&lt;/strong&gt; Bioretinol – Bakuchiol, Protective and Soothing Complex, Troxerutin, Horse Chestnut Extract, Agave Extract, Betaine&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to use: &lt;/strong&gt;Apply a small amount of serum evenly to the face, neck, and décolleté. Allow to absorb. Do not rinse off.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warnings:&lt;/strong&gt; For external use only. Do not use if you are hypersensitive to any of the cosmetic ingredients.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INCI:&lt;/strong&gt; Aqua (Water), Betaine, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Propanediol, Glycerin, Panthenol, Polysorbate 20, Maltose, Bakuchiol, Troxerutin, Agave Tequilana Leaf Extract, Aesculus Hippocastanum (Horse Chestnut) Seed Extract, Hesperidin Methyl Chalcone, Sodium Hyaluronate, Mannitol, Caprylyl Glycol, Folic Acid, Sorbitol, Glucose, Trilaureth-4 Phosphate, Lecithin, Propylene Glycol, Hydroxypropyl Methylcellulose, Microcrystalline Cellulose, Carbomer, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sodium Hydroxide, Citric Acid, Disodium EDTA, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Benzoate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Potassium Sorbate, Parfum (Fragrance), Acetyl Cedrene, Benzyl Salicylate, Citronellol, Citrus Aurantium Peel Oil, Citrus Limon Peel Oil, Hexamethylindanopyran, Hexyl Cinnamal, Limonene, Linalool, Linalyl Acetate, Pogostemon Cablin Oil, Tetramethyl Acetyloctahydronaphthalenes, CI 77491 (Iron Oxides), CI 16255.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>14.39</price>
