<item>
<sku>155414</sku>
<name>Farmona UNIQUE SKIN Instantly Illuminating Serum with Vitamin C 30 ml</name>
<description>&lt;h2&gt;Instantly Illuminating Serum with Vitamin C&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;This instantly illuminating serum is designed for all skin types requiring brightening, including dull skin, skin with uneven skin tone, and discoloration.&lt;br&gt;A highly concentrated formula that is safe yet delivers visible results. It instantly illuminates, improves skin tone, restores the skin's natural glow, evens out its fresh appearance, moisturizes, firms, and leaves a beautiful scent.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to use: &lt;/strong&gt;Apply a small amount of serum evenly to the face, neck, and décolleté. Allow to absorb. Do not rinse off.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warnings:&lt;/strong&gt; For external use only. Do not use if you are allergic to any of the ingredients.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INCI:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Aqua (Water), Niacinamide, Glycerin, Betaine, Propanediol, Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Xylitylglucoside, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Arctostaphylos Uva Ursi Leaf Extract, Citrus Limon (Lemon) Fruit Extract, Rubus Fruticosus (Blackberry) Fruit Extract, Caffeine, Panthenol, Malic Acid, Mannitol, Caprylyl Glycol, Methylsilanol Hydroxyproline Aspartate, Anhydroxylitol, Xylitol, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Propylene Glycol, Butylene Glycol, Hydroxypropyl Methylcellulose, Microcrystalline Cellulose, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sodium Hydroxide, Sodium Citrate, Citric Acid, Disodium EDTA, Trisodium EDTA, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Sorbic Acid, Parfum (Fragrance), Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Benzyl Salicylate, Hexamethylindanopyran, Hexyl Cinnamal, Linalool, Tetramethyl Acetyloctahydronaphthalenes, CI 19140, CI 16255, CI 77492 (Iron Oxides).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
