<name>Gabbiano barber chair Bruno with black frame Brown </name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153408/EN_153408_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano &lt;/strong&gt;is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship, as well as high comfort of use. The offer includes a large selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, washers and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153408/EN_153408_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Stylish barber chair&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Gabbiano Bruno barber chair&lt;/strong&gt; is a practical, elegant piece of furniture equipped with a durable hydraulic lift and adjustable footrest, backrest, and headrest. The wide range of adjustments allows for &lt;strong&gt;precise adjustment of the chair to the type of treatment&lt;/strong&gt; being performed, significantly improving comfort. Matte upholstery with &lt;strong&gt;decorative stitching &lt;/strong&gt;adds elegance to the chair, making it an aesthetically pleasing addition to the salon.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153408/EN_153408_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Wide range of adjustments&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The efficient hydraulic lift allows for smooth &lt;strong&gt;seat height adjustment from 56-68 cm&lt;/strong&gt;, even when the client is seated. This ensures &lt;strong&gt;ergonomic work&lt;/strong&gt; and allows the seat height to be adjusted to the height of both the client and the barber. &lt;strong&gt;The reclining backrest and adjustable footrest&lt;/strong&gt; allow you to adjust the chair to a semi-reclining position, &lt;strong&gt;providing optimal acces&lt;/strong&gt;s for services such as shaving or beard grooming. The headrest, which extends 20 cm, ensures &lt;strong&gt;stable head support&lt;/strong&gt;, regardless of the client's height.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153408/EN_153408_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Solutions for comfort&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The ergonomic seat design and &lt;strong&gt;carefully profiled backrest&lt;/strong&gt; ensure client comfort even during longer treatments. Upholstered armrests mounted at the optimal height allow &lt;strong&gt;for proper client's arm positioning&lt;/strong&gt;, preventing tension in the neck and shoulder area. &lt;strong&gt;The full rotation mechanism&lt;/strong&gt; increases work flexibility and allows for easy adjustment of the chair to any position.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153408/EN_153408_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Elegance and durability for years to come&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The stable construction&lt;strong&gt; ensures safety and long-lasting durability&lt;/strong&gt;. The seat, filled with deformation-resistant foam, and upholstery made of soft, synthetic leather ensure &lt;strong&gt;durability and comfort&lt;/strong&gt;. The moisture-resistant materials are not only durable but also easy to clean. The brown upholstery combined with a black frame gives the chair a &lt;strong&gt;modern and professional look&lt;/strong&gt;, while its minimalist style allows it to fit into the décor of any barbershop.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ihv22tWd2OE" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Detailed dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Includes:&lt;/strong&gt; seat, actuator with base, headrest.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lift: hydraulic&lt;br&gt;Base: round&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Upholstery colour: shades of brown&lt;br&gt;Frame colour: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;</description>
