<name>Gabbiano 41 hairdressing head holder stand</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano &lt;/strong&gt;is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship, as well as high comfort of use. The offer includes a large selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, washers and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Practical stand for hairdressing heads&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Gabbiano 41 is a compact tripod designed for use with a training head&lt;/strong&gt; – ideal for learning, training, and daily practice. It fits most models of heads available on the market. It is suitable for both hairdressing schools and for individual practice. &lt;strong&gt;Attachment to the table top with a solid vice-type handle&lt;/strong&gt; ensures stability and safety during work.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Wide adjustment options&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A simple adjustment mechanism and sturdy clamps&lt;/strong&gt; allow for quick and convenient adjustment of the stand to the desired height. &lt;strong&gt;The adjustment range from 19 to 29 cm&lt;/strong&gt; allows for convenient adaptation to the user's needs and working conditions. Additionally,&lt;strong&gt; the adjustable head angle &lt;/strong&gt;allows for easy manoeuvring and precise styling. The tapered stem has a diameter of 2 cm at the narrowest point and 2,9 cm at the base. &lt;strong&gt;The simple, intuitive design &lt;/strong&gt;makes the stand suitable for both beginners and more experienced stylists.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Simple design and functionality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The minimalist design and &lt;strong&gt;durable steel construction&lt;/strong&gt; make the Gabbiano 41 stand &lt;strong&gt;resistant to damage &lt;/strong&gt;and comfortable for everyday use. The vise-type handle with a maximum opening of 6 cm &lt;strong&gt;allows for quick and secure attachment to most tabletops&lt;/strong&gt; – whether in a school or professional setting. &lt;strong&gt;The ergonomic form and high-quality materials &lt;/strong&gt;ensure durability and comfort.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Dimensions are shown in the photo.&lt;br&gt;Material: metal&lt;/p&gt;</description>
