<name>Gabbiano 44 hairdressing head holder stand</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano &lt;/strong&gt;is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship, as well as high comfort of use. The offer includes a large selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, washers and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Practical hairdressing head stand&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Gabbiano 44 is a stable and functional stand designed for working with a training head&lt;/strong&gt;. It's perfect for both professional training and for creating educational materials. &lt;strong&gt;It allows for the free execution of styling and technical exercises&lt;/strong&gt;, and thanks to its adjustable height and possibility to adjust the angle of the head, it allows for comfortable and ergonomic work tailored to the user's needs. The tripod is compatible with most head models available on the market, making it an &lt;strong&gt;exceptionally versatile solution&lt;/strong&gt; – for both hairdressing schools and training studios.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Wide adjustment options&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The height adjustment range is from 80 to 146 cm&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing the tripod to be easily adjusted to the height of the hairdresser and the type of styling being performed. &lt;strong&gt;The ability to adjust the angle of the head&lt;/strong&gt; allows for precise manoeuvring and convenient adjustment of the position to suit the particular working technique. The tapered stem has a diameter of 2 cm at the narrowest point and 2,9 cm at the base. Its simple design makes it &lt;strong&gt;easy to use, even for beginners&lt;/strong&gt;, and its versatility will be appreciated by experienced stylists.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Simple design and functionality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The stand's minimalist form makes it a&lt;strong&gt; perfect addition to any hairdressing salon&lt;/strong&gt; or training space. The lightweight yet robust steel construction guarantees &lt;strong&gt;durability, resistance to mechanical damage, and stability in everyday use&lt;/strong&gt;. The stability of the structure is ensured by a &lt;strong&gt;three-legged base &lt;/strong&gt;with additional supports, which strengthen the whole and increase work safety. An additional &lt;strong&gt;foot stabiliser &lt;/strong&gt;improves the comfort of use and the high quality materials used in production translate into a&lt;strong&gt; long life of the tripod&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Dimensions are shown in the photo.&lt;br&gt;Colour: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Material: metal&lt;/p&gt;</description>
