<item>
<sku>155252</sku>
<name>OCHO NAILS Hybrid nail polish Sorbet S01 -5 g</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The OCHO NAILS&lt;/strong&gt; is a unique brand focusing on professional products for nail stylists. Its assortment includes hybrid nail polishes, nail gels, specialized lamps and nail care accessories. &lt;strong&gt;The OCHO NAILS&lt;/strong&gt; products will meet the requirements of experienced users, as well as those who are just beginning their adventure with manicures.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/ocho_colors/baner-ocho-nails-sorbet-01-en.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Hybrid nail polishes – an aesthetic and durable way of decorating nails&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A hybrid manicure&lt;/strong&gt; is currently one of the most popular methods of nail styling, which provides &lt;strong&gt;considerable color fastness and resistance to chipping&lt;/strong&gt;. Among the advantages of hybrid nail polishes, the &lt;strong&gt;wide range of available colors&lt;/strong&gt;, the ease of making fancy decorations or strengthening the nail plate is worth mentioning. The OCHO NAILS hybrid nail polishes are characterized by &lt;strong&gt;appropriate density, intense pigmentation and ease of application&lt;/strong&gt;. With them you will get a beautiful manicure with intense shine and durability of up to three weeks.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/ocho_colors/cechy-ocho-nails-sorbet-01-en.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Summer colours on your nails&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The OCHO NAILS SORBET collection is a real treat for the senses – &lt;strong&gt;energetic, colorful, and full of life&lt;/strong&gt;, like a summer dessert on a hot afternoon. &lt;strong&gt;Cool turquoises, intense pinks, and juicy citrus shades&lt;/strong&gt; bring to mind fruity sorbets and carefree holidays. Perfect coverage and saturated colours make every manicure from this collection an &lt;strong&gt;instant eye-catcher&lt;/strong&gt;. It's the perfect choice for vacation trips, festivals, and sunny days – and &lt;strong&gt;a way to keep a little bit of summer around for longer&lt;/strong&gt;, regardless of the weather.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/XLkLQMW__Tw" width="560" height="315" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/ocho_colors/palettes-ocho-nails-sorbet.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;How to properly perform a hybrid manicure?&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;1. Before starting the procedure, thoroughly disinfect your and the client's hands with antiseptic fluid and prepare the workplace accordingly.&lt;br&gt;2. Use a file of the appropriate gradation to give the nails the desired shape, gently mat the plate with a polishing block, and if necessary prepare the cuticles.&lt;br&gt;3. Rinse the nail plate with a cotton pad soaked in a cleanser. In addition, you can use a primer.&lt;br&gt;4. Apply a thin layer of hybrid base and cure for 30 seconds in a LED lamp or 2 minutes in a UV lamp.&lt;br&gt;5. Spread the hybrid nail polish in the selected color on the hardened base and cure for 30 sec. in the LED lamp or 2 min. in the UV lamp. You can repeat the process for more intense color.&lt;br&gt;6. Then apply a thin layer of top coat and cure for 30 sec. in an LED lamp or 2 min. in a UV lamp. Depending on the type of top, it may be necessary to wash with a cleanser.&lt;br&gt;7. We recommend applying nourishing oil to the cuticles around the nails for better care.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/ocho_colors/buteleczki-ocho-nails-sorbet.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>4.06</price>
<category_subcategory>Hybrid manicure Ocho Nails&gt;Hybrid polishes</category_subcategory>
<qty>274</qty>
<weight>0.0380</weight>
<brand>OCHO NAILS</brand>
<tax>23%</tax>
<EAN>5906717468742</EAN>
