<item>
<sku>150966</sku>
<name>PRO INK 322F hydraulic tattoo chair black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150966/EN_150966_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PRO INK&lt;/strong&gt; brand responds to the specific needs of the tattoo industry. It offers professional equipment and accessories dedicated to tattoo salons. The brand's range includes products such as tattoo chairs, assistants or supports, which significantly simplify work.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150966/EN_150966_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Minimalist tattoo chair&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The versatile &lt;strong&gt;Pro Ink 322F tattoo chair with a hydraulic actuator&lt;/strong&gt; is designed for &lt;strong&gt;precision, comfort, and ergonomics&lt;/strong&gt; during multi-hour sessions. This practical solution significantly &lt;strong&gt;improves the comfort of work in a tattoo studio&lt;/strong&gt;. The chair's minimalist design blends seamlessly with a variety of interior designs, giving the space a &lt;strong&gt;modern and professional look&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150966/EN_150966_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Functionality tailored to the needs of the tattoo industry&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The chair is equipped with a hydraulic actuator that allows &lt;strong&gt;for smooth height adjustment from 60 to 73 cm&lt;/strong&gt;. Both the backrest and footrest have a &lt;strong&gt;manual angle adjustment&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing for a customized positioning to suit the type of procedure being performed.&lt;strong&gt; The movable, recessed armrests&lt;/strong&gt; are easy to remove and adjust. They allow for &lt;strong&gt;angle, height, and tilt adjustment&lt;/strong&gt;, providing comfortable, stable support and even greater freedom of work for the tattoo artist. All of these features &lt;strong&gt;increase client comfort and facilitate precise tattooing&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150966/EN_150966_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Comfort and versatility at the highest level&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The lockable full rotation mechanism&lt;/strong&gt; ensures maximum functionality and facilitates access to the client from all sides – even in smaller spaces. The chair can be easily unfolded &lt;strong&gt;into reclining position&lt;/strong&gt;, and an opening in the headrest, hidden under the cushion, &lt;strong&gt;allows for comfortable facial positioning&lt;/strong&gt; during procedures performed in a supine position.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150966/EN_150966_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Modern design and ergonomics&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The stable construction and solid base guarantee &lt;strong&gt;durability, safety, and the stability &lt;/strong&gt;necessary for precise tattooing. &lt;strong&gt;Wheels located on one side of the base &lt;/strong&gt;allow for easy movement of the chair without having to lift it. The foam padding with the appropriate density ensures &lt;strong&gt;comfort even during long sessions&lt;/strong&gt;. The black synthetic leather upholstery with a semi-matte finish is moisture-resistant and easy to clean. &lt;strong&gt;Decorative stitching on the seat and footrest &lt;/strong&gt;enhance the professional look of the furniture and give it a unique character. &lt;strong&gt;The classic colours and minimalist design &lt;/strong&gt;perfectly complement the aesthetics of tattoo studios.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150966/EN_150966_6.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Actuator: hydraulic&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Upholstery colour: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/JHToQlNPE8Y" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;</description>
<price>392.27</price>
