<item>
<sku>154564</sku>
<name>Depilflax 100 wax for hair removal can gold 500 ml </name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Depilflax &lt;/strong&gt;is a brand specializing in hair removal products, offering a wide range of waxes pre- and post-treatment cosmetics which meet the high expectations of professionals. The innovative formulas are based on natural ingredients, emphasizing the brand's concern for the skin and the environment.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Professional soft wax for precise hair removal&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Depilflax Gold hair removal wax&lt;/strong&gt; in a can is a product designed for professional beauty salons and demanding users. Suitable &lt;strong&gt;for all skin types, including sensitive skin&lt;/strong&gt;, it ensures effective hair removal while &lt;strong&gt;maintaining comfort and safety during the treatment&lt;/strong&gt;. Thanks to its special formula based on selected resins and mineral pigments, &lt;strong&gt;the wax is highly adhesive and flexible&lt;/strong&gt;, enabling precise hair removal even from hard-to-reach areas.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Low melting point and creamy consistency&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The wax&lt;strong&gt; melts at a low temperature&lt;/strong&gt;, making it safe even for people with circulation problems and those who are sensitive to high heat. Its creamy consistency &lt;strong&gt;facilitates thin application and even spreading of the product&lt;/strong&gt;. Once properly applied and set, it can be quickly and effectively removed using non-woven strips. The effects of the treatment last up to three weeks, &lt;strong&gt;leaving skin smooth, soft&lt;/strong&gt;, and free from irritation.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Ingredients with protective and brightening properties&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The wax formula is based on natural rosin derivatives, which are responsible &lt;strong&gt;for high hair removal effectiveness&lt;/strong&gt; and good skin tolerance. The presence of mica and iron oxide gives the wax an elegant, pearly-gold sheen and &lt;strong&gt;supports the skin smoothing effect&lt;/strong&gt;, while adding radiance and subtle illumination.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;How to use the wax for hair removal:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • Before starting hair removal, it is recommended to exfoliate the areas to be treated.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • Place the wax can in the heater and heat for approximately 20 minutes at 60-70°C.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • Stir until the desired consistency is achieved.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • Once the product has melted, lower the temperature to approximately 45-55°C.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • Thoroughly cleanse and dry the skin in the treatment area.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • Using a spatula, apply a thin layer of wax in the direction of hair growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • Apply the non-woven strip, press firmly, and then quickly peel it off in the opposite direction to the hair growth.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients:&lt;/strong&gt; diethylene glycol rosinate, triethylene glycol rosinate, glycerol rosinate, mica, titanium dioxide (CI 77891), iron oxides (CI 77491).&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Capacity: 500 ml&lt;br&gt;Manufacturer: MayStar&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>10.77</price>
<category_subcategory>Epilation&gt;Wax and sugar depilation DEPILFLAX&gt;Canned waxes</category_subcategory>
