<item>
<sku>154165</sku>
<name>Gabbiano hairdressing chair Sewilla Black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano &lt;/strong&gt;is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship, as well as high comfort of use. The offer includes a large selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, washers and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154165/EN_154165_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Elegant salon chair&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Gabbiano Sewilla hairdressing chair&lt;/strong&gt; combines functionality with timeless aesthetics. A durable hydraulic lift &lt;strong&gt;provides smooth height adjustment&lt;/strong&gt;, making it easy to adjust the position to the stylist's needs. &lt;strong&gt;The ergonomic seat, comfortable backrest, and strikingly shaped armrests &lt;/strong&gt;guarantee comfort even during longer treatments. &lt;strong&gt;The modern, minimalist design &lt;/strong&gt;makes the chair blend harmoniously with the décor of both classic and modern salons.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154165/EN_154165_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Ergonomics for work comfort&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The robust hydraulic lift allows for &lt;strong&gt;smooth seat height adjustment from 46 to 58 cm&lt;/strong&gt; – even when the client is sitting in the chair. This practical solution makes it easy to adapt the position to the height of both client and stylist,&lt;strong&gt; promoting ergonomic work&lt;/strong&gt;. The profiled backrest provides a comfortable position and&lt;strong&gt; stable back support&lt;/strong&gt;, which is especially important during longer treatments. An additional advantage is the &lt;strong&gt;full rotation mechanism&lt;/strong&gt;, which increases freedom of movement and facilitates access to the client from all sides.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154165/EN_154165_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Thoughtful design&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The seat has been designed with comfort in mind, even during long treatments. The armrests, positioned at an ergonomic height, &lt;strong&gt;support the client's correct posture&lt;/strong&gt;, facilitating precise cutting and styling. A practical advantage of the chair is &lt;strong&gt;the opening between the backrest and seat &lt;/strong&gt;– it facilitates cleaning, allowing for quick and effective removal of hair from hard-to-reach areas. This allows for &lt;strong&gt;efficient and hygienic &lt;/strong&gt;preparation of the station for the next client.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154165/EN_154165_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Minimalist design and functionality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The Gabbiano Sewilla hairdressing chair combines &lt;strong&gt;minimalist design&lt;/strong&gt; with the comfort of everyday use. The stable, round base in matte black gives it &lt;strong&gt;an elegant look&lt;/strong&gt;, while foam padding and soft-touch synthetic leather in shades of black with a semi-matte finish ensure high comfort. The materials used are &lt;strong&gt;durable, moisture-resistant, and easy to clean&lt;/strong&gt;. It will work perfectly in both modern and classic interiors, &lt;strong&gt;emphasizing the professional style of the interior&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/WIVamskY09Y" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Detailed dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Includes:&lt;/strong&gt; seat, actuator with base.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lift: hydraulic&lt;br&gt;Base: round&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Upholstery colour: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Base colour: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>223.57</price>
<category_subcategory>Hairdressing salon equipment&gt;Hairdressing furniture&gt;Armchairs and hairdressing washes&gt;Others</category_subcategory>
