 architecture, and cure in the lamp. Wash the dispersion layer, shape nail with a file, and then apply another layer of gel, leveling the surface with a thin brush. Cure in the lamp for at least 60 seconds.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;◦ Dual forms:&lt;/strong&gt; Fill the dual form with the construction gel and gently press it onto the nail plate. Cure in the lamp for at least 60 seconds. Then remove the form and file the nail.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 5. Give the nails their final shape with a file and level the surface with a polishing block.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 6. Apply the selected top coat and cure in the lamp. For a better effect and cuticle care, apply olive oil.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/ocho_gels/pojemnosc-ocho-nails-zele-konstrukcyjne.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
