<item>
<sku>154375</sku>
<name>OCHO NAILS Bonding Base for Gel 5g</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;OCHO NAILS&lt;/strong&gt; is a unique brand focusing on professional products for nail stylists. Its assortment includes hybrid nail polishes, nail gels, specialized lamps and nail care accessories. The OCHO NAILS products will meet the requirements of experienced users, as well as those who are just beginning their adventure with manicures.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/ocho_base/banner-ocho-nails-bases-en.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Gel base coat – the key to long-lasting nail designs&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OCHO NAILS Bonding Base for Gel&lt;/strong&gt; is a professional base coat with an acid-free formula that ensures &lt;strong&gt;excellent gel adhesion&lt;/strong&gt; to the natural nail plate. Thanks to its priming properties, it &lt;strong&gt;effectively minimises the risk of air pockets &lt;/strong&gt;and chipping, extending the durability of the design. This product is perfect as a first step in gel styling – whether you're building nails from scratch or doing a refill. It helps to maintain a&lt;strong&gt; perfect manicure&lt;/strong&gt; by protecting it from external factors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/ocho_base/features-ocho-nails-base-en.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Precise application and long-lasting results&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The base coat has&lt;strong&gt; an easy-to-apply, medium-thick consistency&lt;/strong&gt; that allows for precise and even application, including using the rubbing technique. It leaves &lt;strong&gt;a sticky dispersion layer&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring perfect adhesion for further styling steps. Its acid-free formula is gentle on the natural nail plate, and its&lt;strong&gt; universal properties&lt;/strong&gt; make it compatible with Ocho Nails construction gels. It's the perfect solution for stylists looking for a &lt;strong&gt;reliable base coat that extends the durability of gel designs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/1ZIx5fZ41sA" width="560" height="315" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;How to properly use the base coat?&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 1. Before starting the procedure, thoroughly disinfect your and your client's hands with an antiseptic solution and properly prepare the work area.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 2. Use a file with the appropriate grit to shape the nails, gently mattify the nail plate with a buffing block, and trim cuticles if necessary.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 3. Clean the nail plate with a cotton pad soaked in nail cleaner. Additionally, you can use an acid-free primer.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 4. Apply a thin layer of base coat and gently massage it into the nail plate, for example using a rubbing motion.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 5. Cure in an LED lamp for at least 60 seconds.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 6. Apply construction gel and proceed to the next styling steps.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
