<item>
<sku>154139</sku>
<name>Gabbiano hairdressing chair Porto gray black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano&lt;/strong&gt; is a luxurious Italian brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics, as well as high comfort of use. The offer includes a large selection of functional salon equipment elements, such as armchairs, hair washes and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154139/EN_154139_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A stylish element of hairdressing salon equipment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The elegant &lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano Porto hairdressing chair&lt;/strong&gt; is equipped with an efficient hydraulic lift, which ensures its functionality. This significantly translates into higher work efficiency and guarantees comfort for both hairdressers and users. &lt;strong&gt;An aesthetically made chair&lt;/strong&gt; will become the decoration of any hairdressing salon.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154139/EN_154139_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The durable hydraulic lift allows you to adjust the seat level within &lt;strong&gt;the range of 49-61 cm&lt;/strong&gt; - even when the client is sitting on the chair. It ensures &lt;strong&gt;more ergonomic work&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing you to adjust the seat level to the height of both the client and the hairdresser. &lt;strong&gt;The visually interesting backrest&lt;/strong&gt; allows you to take a convenient position, &lt;strong&gt;providing excellent back support&lt;/strong&gt;, which is especially important in the case of long-hour treatments. A big advantage of this model is &lt;strong&gt;the hole left between the backrest and the seat&lt;/strong&gt;. It makes it easier to keep the salon clean by allowing you to easily sweep hair from every nook and cranny of the chair. This allows you to streamline the preparation of the workstation between clients.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154139/EN_154139_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solutions to make your work easier&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The full rotation mechanism&lt;/strong&gt; of the chair makes the hairdresser's work &lt;strong&gt;more effective and comfortable&lt;/strong&gt;. A solid, flat, square-shaped base &lt;strong&gt;guarantees stability&lt;/strong&gt; during use. The matte-finished, smooth surface gives the element an elegant look and makes it&lt;strong&gt; easy to keep clean&lt;/strong&gt;. A comfortable seat with foam filling ensures &lt;strong&gt;high comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;, even during many hours of treatments. Geometric, metal armrests allow for &lt;strong&gt;the correct positioning of the client's shoulders&lt;/strong&gt; – this means that he does not bury his head in his shoulders or slouch – which &lt;strong&gt;makes it much easier to perform precise treatments&lt;/strong&gt;, including haircuts. A stylish footrest dedicated to this model provides stable support for the user's feet.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154139/EN_154139_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional furniture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Filling with durable, deformation-resistant foam and upholstery made of pleasant-to-touch synthetic leather &lt;strong&gt;ensure the durability of the furniture and its comfortable use&lt;/strong&gt; for a long time. It also makes the equipment &lt;strong&gt;resistant to moisture, durable and easy to clean&lt;/strong&gt;. The black covering gives it a unique character. The equipment is &lt;strong&gt;distinguished by a modern design&lt;/strong&gt;, which makes the chair look great in many professional salons.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/GesyFBw516U" width="560" height="315" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Detailed dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes:&lt;/strong&gt; seat, actuator with base, footrest.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hydraulic jack&lt;br&gt;Base: square&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Frame color: shades of gray&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>254.06</price>
<category_subcategory>Hairdressing salon equipment&gt;Hairdressing furniture&gt;Armchairs and hairdressing washes&gt;Porto</category_subcategory>
<qty>34</qty>
<weight>33.0000</weight>
<brand>GABBIANO</brand>
<tax>23%</tax>
