on between clients.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154140/EN_154140_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solutions to make your work easier&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The full rotation mechanism&lt;/strong&gt; of the chair makes the hairdresser's work &lt;strong&gt;more effective and comfortable&lt;/strong&gt;. A solid, flat, square-shaped base &lt;strong&gt;guarantees stability&lt;/strong&gt; during use. The matte-finished, smooth surface gives the element an elegant look and makes it&lt;strong&gt; easy to keep clean&lt;/strong&gt;. A comfortable seat with foam filling ensures &lt;strong&gt;high comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;, even during many hours of treatments. Geometric, metal armrests allow for &lt;strong&gt;the correct positioning of the client's shoulders&lt;/strong&gt; – this means that he does not bury his head in his shoulders or slouch – which &lt;strong&gt;makes it much easier to perform precise treatments&lt;/strong&gt;, including haircuts. A stylish footrest dedicated to this model provides stable support for the user's feet.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154140/EN_154140_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional furniture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Filling with durable, deformation-resistant foam and upholstery made of pleasant-to-touch synthetic leather &lt;strong&gt;ensure the durability of the furniture and its comfortable use&lt;/strong&gt; for a long time. It also makes the equipment &lt;strong&gt;resistant to moisture, durable and easy to clean&lt;/strong&gt;. The white covering gives it a unique character. The equipment is &lt;strong&gt;distinguished by a modern design&lt;/strong&gt;, which makes the chair look great in many professional salons.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/GesyFBw516U" width="560" height="315" frameborder="0" a