<item>
<sku>154145</sku>
<name>Gabbiano Porto hair wash unit grey grey</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154145/EN_154145_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano&lt;/strong&gt; is a luxury Italian brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship, as well as high comfort of use. The offer includes a large selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, washers and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154145/EN_154145_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stylish element for a hairdressing salon&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The elegant &lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano Porto hairdressing hair wash unit&lt;/strong&gt; was designed to provide practical equipment for a professional hairdressing salon. &lt;strong&gt;It facilitates basic hair treatments&lt;/strong&gt;, such as washing, coloring and regeneration.&lt;strong&gt; The integrated design ensures comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt; for both hairdressers and clients, and the visually interesting chair gives the interior a unique style.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154145/EN_154145_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tasteful washbasin for comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The appropriate depth of the white ceramic washbasin bowl &lt;strong&gt;prevents excessive splashing&lt;/strong&gt; of water or products used during treatments. This allows &lt;strong&gt;for comfortable and effective performance&lt;/strong&gt; of a wide range of services. The angle of the bowl can be adjusted, making it easy &lt;strong&gt;to adapt to individual needs&lt;/strong&gt;. The high quality of the materials used makes the washbasin &lt;strong&gt;durable, resistant to discoloration and scratches, and very easy to clean&lt;/strong&gt;. A properly profiled collar and inclined backrest&lt;strong&gt; provide support and comfort&lt;/strong&gt; when washing the hair, and thanks to &lt;strong&gt;the comfortable black plastic overlay&lt;/strong&gt;, the customer will not feel the unpleasantness of the cold ceramic surface.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154145/EN_154145_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amenities for convenience of use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The practical hair wash unit is equipped with a mixer faucet, which &lt;strong&gt;provides easy access to hot and cold water&lt;/strong&gt;. This makes it easier to adjust the temperature to the customer's individual preferences. A dedicated place to hang up the handset makes work easier, and the &lt;strong&gt;chrome-plated plug with a special strainer&lt;/strong&gt; allows you to control the water flow and maintain high hygiene standards in the salon. &lt;strong&gt;The water connection has been placed inside the base&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing the pipes to be easily hidden. A significant advantage of this model is &lt;strong&gt;the opening left between the backrest and the seat&lt;/strong&gt;, which makes it easier to keep the living room clean by allowing you to easily sweep dirt from every nook and cranny of the chair. The hair wash unit has been designed in such a way as to ensure comfort during various treatments, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring proper back support&lt;/strong&gt;. The combination of functionality and amenities makes working in a hairdressing salon&lt;strong&gt; even more comfortable&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154145/EN_154145_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional furniture with a modern design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The profiled chair &lt;strong&gt;provides adequate lumbar support&lt;/strong&gt; and, therefore, high comfort of use. Metal armrests in shades of gry with a geometric shape allow for &lt;strong&gt;the correct positioning of the customer's shoulders&lt;/strong&gt;. Filling with durable, deformation-resistant foam and upholstery made of pleasant-to-touch synthetic leather in shades of gray ensure&lt;strong&gt; the durability of the furniture, ease of cleaning and comfortable use for a long time&lt;/strong&gt;. The original, elegant appearance of the hair wash unit gives the interior a unique expression. The set includes &lt;strong&gt;complete fittings&lt;/strong&gt; in shades of black, including a faucet, a shower head and dedicated hoses to &lt;strong&gt;provide a complete set of tools for work&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Detailed dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Bowl material: ceramic&lt;br&gt;Bowl color: shades of white&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of gray&lt;br&gt;Color of metal elements: shades of gray&lt;br&gt;Base color: shades of white&lt;br&gt;Fittings color: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>508.13</price>
<category_subcategory>Hairdressing salon equipment&gt;Hairdressing furniture&gt;Armchairs and hairdressing washes&gt;Porto</category_subcategory>
<qty>4</qty>
<weight>49.0000</weight>
<brand>GABBIANO</brand>
<tax>23%</tax>
<EAN>5906717465161</EAN>
