<sku>154184</sku>
<name>Sakura Luxury 808 massage chair white and beige</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sakura &lt;/strong&gt;massage chairs ensure relaxation and high comfort of use. They are also an excellent way to take care of your health and well-being. A variety of functions and ease of use make the chairs of this brand an excellent choice for both massage parlours and home use. Made with attention to detail, they will become an aesthetic element of any space.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154184/EN_154184_01.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Comprehensive massage for complete relaxation&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Sakura Luxury 808 massage chair&lt;/strong&gt; provides a comprehensive massage and high comfort of use. &amp;nbsp;Its well-designed features create an intense yet relaxing experience. Precisely working &lt;strong&gt;massage heads and an airbag system &lt;/strong&gt;guarantee effective muscle relief and sense of tranquillity. It is perfect for both active and sedentary individuals, offering &lt;strong&gt;a daily dose of relaxation&lt;/strong&gt; at the highest level. Regular use of the massage chair helps&lt;strong&gt; improve circulation, relieves tension and muscle fatigue, and reduces stress levels&lt;/strong&gt;, contributing to an overall improvement in well-being and quality of life.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154184/EN_154184_02.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Long massage path&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The massage path in the Luxury 808 model &lt;strong&gt;extends over a length of 100 cm – from the neck to the upper legs&lt;/strong&gt;. It covers the entire back, including the thoracic and lumbar spine, waist, hips, buttocks, and thighs. This wide range of action allows &lt;strong&gt;for comprehensive relaxation of both the upper and lower body parts&lt;/strong&gt;. The massage stimulates blood circulation, reduces muscle tension, and&lt;strong&gt; effectively helps in regeneration&lt;/strong&gt; after prolonged sitting, an intense day, or physical exertion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154184/EN_154184_03.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Body detection system&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;When the chair is turned on, an &lt;strong&gt;automatic body scan is initiated&lt;/strong&gt; – the system recognizes height, shoulder position, and body shape, adjusting the massage rollers accordingly. During this detection, &lt;strong&gt;the rollers move up and down&lt;/strong&gt;, and a sound indicates the end of the process. At this stage, &lt;strong&gt;you can adjust the position using the UP and DOWN buttons&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154184/EN_154184_04.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Deep back and leg massage&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The 3D massage&lt;/strong&gt; covers the entire back area – from the neck to the upper thighs – &lt;strong&gt;providing deep relaxation &lt;/strong&gt;and effective relief of muscle tension. &lt;strong&gt;Four high-quality massage heads move up and down&lt;/strong&gt;, mimicking the movements of human hands. They use a variety of combined techniques: kneading, knocking, tapping and shiatsu, which&lt;strong&gt; support the body's regeneration&lt;/strong&gt; and pain reduction. After each session, a noticeable improvement can be seen – the body becomes relaxed and muscle tension is significantly reduced. A special massage element between the legs moves during the treatment, &lt;strong&gt;applying pressure to the calves and thoroughly massaging them&lt;/strong&gt;. Additionally, the built-in foot massager uses acupressure techniques, effectively relaxing the feet, &lt;strong&gt;eliminating fatigue &lt;/strong&gt;and improving overall well-being.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154184/EN_154184_05.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Effective compression massage using airbags&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The perfect complement to the massage heads is a compression massage &lt;strong&gt;based on the action of 32 airbags&lt;/strong&gt;. Their pulsating motion on the feet, calves, arms, and shoulders&lt;strong&gt; supports lymphatic drainage&lt;/strong&gt;, improves circulation, and accelerates body detoxification process. Among the effects, you'll notice improved muscle oxygenation and a &lt;strong&gt;feeling of pleasant relief &lt;/strong&gt;that lasts the rest of the day. The intensity of the airbags&lt;strong&gt; can be conveniently adjusted from the control panel&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154184/EN_154184_06.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Clear control panel with LCD screen&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The intuitive control panel makes operating the chair &lt;strong&gt;exceptionally simple and comfortable&lt;/strong&gt;. For added convenience, it can be placed in the holder on the right armrest or held comfortably in your hands. The easy-to-read LCD screen &lt;strong&gt;clearly displays all key information&lt;/strong&gt; – the body parts currently being massaged, the massage intensity, the treatment duration, and the selected program. Using the panel, you can easily select from available massage modes, adjust the chair's settings, regulate the intensity, and &lt;strong&gt;set the session time to 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, or 30 minutes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154184/EN_154184_07.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Automatic programs to meet the most common needs&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The chair features &lt;strong&gt;6 pre-programmed automatic massage modes&lt;/strong&gt;, designed to meet various needs of users – from regeneration to relaxation before bedtime. Each mode is a &lt;strong&gt;carefully designed sequence&lt;/strong&gt; combining the massage heads, airbag activity, angle adjustment, Zero Gravity position, and a heating option. This allows the massage to &lt;strong&gt;adapt to your current mood and expectations&lt;/strong&gt; – simply select the appropriate program from the control panel:&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • Classics&lt;/strong&gt; – An intense full-body massage using all the chair's functions. It combines kneading, tapping, and a variable tilt angle in the Zero Gravity position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • Recovery&lt;/strong&gt; – A regenerative program that starts with a shoulder massage gradually moves down the body and increases in intensity. All airbags are also used.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • Release&lt;/strong&gt; – A full-body massage with increasing intensity. The airbags knead the arms, legs, and feet, while the massage heads work from the neck to the buttocks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • Sleep&lt;/strong&gt; – A soothing massage with a gentle rocking function. It begins with subtle kneading and tapping, which gradually becomes more intense. The chair remains in a semi-reclining position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • Relax&lt;/strong&gt; – A light, relaxing massage, ideal for calming and relaxing the body.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • Waist&lt;/strong&gt; – Massage focused on the lower back, waist and hips, with additional movements in the neck and shoulders. Alternating kneading and tapping in the Zero Gravity position.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154184/EN_154184_08.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Massage perfectly tailored to the user's needs&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Manual mode&lt;strong&gt; allows you to precisely adjust the massage&lt;/strong&gt; to your individual preferences. &lt;strong&gt;The user decides on the intensity and speed of the massage heads&lt;/strong&gt;, selects the treatment area, and adjusts the width and range of the rollers' movement for specific body parts. This is an ideal option &lt;strong&gt;for those who value full control over the treatment&lt;/strong&gt; and want to tailor the massage to their current needs.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154184/EN_154184_09.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Deep relaxation in Zero Gravity mode&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The chair allows you to &lt;strong&gt;adjust the angle of inclination&lt;/strong&gt;, so you can set it to a position that has an extremely beneficial effect on the body. This feature was inspired by the posture adopted by astronauts during rocket launch – minimising gravitational pressure on the body. &lt;strong&gt;The Zero Gravity position evenly distributes the body’s weight across the entire surface of the chair&lt;/strong&gt;, reducing the load on the spine, relaxing muscles, and promoting blood and lymph circulation. It is considered the most optimal position for massage – &lt;strong&gt;it promotes complete relaxation and makes the massage more effective&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154184/EN_154184_10.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Additional features for even more comfort&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The chair is equipped with a &lt;strong&gt;back heating system&lt;/strong&gt;, which effectively supports the relaxation of tense muscles and enhances the pleasure of the massage. &lt;strong&gt;The mechanical footrest length adjustment&lt;/strong&gt; allows the chair to be adjusted to the user's height, ensuring a comfortable position during the treatment. The model also has &lt;strong&gt;illuminated side elements&lt;/strong&gt;, giving it a modern and elegant character. This creates a pleasant, relaxing atmosphere and is an additional decorative element that &lt;strong&gt;enriches the interior design&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154184/EN_154184_11.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Ability to play music during massage&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;For added comfort and relaxation, the massage &lt;strong&gt;chair can be connected to your phone via Bluetooth&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing you to play your favourite relaxing music during the session. &lt;strong&gt;The calm sounds help to quiet the mind&lt;/strong&gt;, improve well-being, and allow for complete relaxation. Additionally, the chair is equipped &lt;strong&gt;with a USB port&lt;/strong&gt; for charging mobile devices during the massage, as well as &lt;strong&gt;practical pockets&lt;/strong&gt; for conveniently storing items such as your phone.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154184/EN_154184_12.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Elegant massage chair for relaxation&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The ergonomically shaped chair &lt;strong&gt;provides comfortable support for the back, neck and legs&lt;/strong&gt;, adapting to the natural curves of the body. The interior is upholstered in soft, synthetic leather in an elegant shade of beige, and the durable foam padding &lt;strong&gt;ensures comfort&lt;/strong&gt;. The materials used are not only durable but also &lt;strong&gt;moisture-resistant and easy to clean&lt;/strong&gt;. Precise stitching emphasises its &lt;strong&gt;modern and aesthetic appearance&lt;/strong&gt;, while the solid construction ensures long-lasting reliability. The Sakura Luxury 808 model &lt;strong&gt;combines functionality with timeless design&lt;/strong&gt;, making it a perfect fit for a variety of interiors. It is &lt;strong&gt;the perfect choice for relaxing after a busy day &lt;/strong&gt;or a demanding workout.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/L7mqxmGQqQ4" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Detailed dimensions of the chair are given in the photo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes:&lt;/strong&gt; chair, panel with LCD display, instructions.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Colour: shades of beige&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Seat filling: foam&lt;br&gt;Recommended massage time: 20 minutes&lt;br&gt;Operating time adjustment: 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30 minutes&lt;br&gt;Maximum load: 150 kg&lt;br&gt;Power: 120 W&lt;br&gt;Voltage: 220-240 V&lt;/p&gt;</description>
