<item>
<sku>154176</sku>
<name>EXO Runner Up nail drill black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EXO &lt;/strong&gt;is a brand that provides top-quality products for the cosmetology and podiatry industries. It stands out for its exceptional focus on expanding its range to meet customer needs. Professional devices and accessories, including nail drills, significantly enhance work comfort thanks to their high-quality workmanship.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154176/EN_154176_1.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Brushed motor nail drill&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The functional &lt;strong&gt;EXO Runner Up nail drill&lt;/strong&gt; with a brush motor is perfect for both manicures and pedicures. &lt;strong&gt;It allows for quick nail preparation&lt;/strong&gt; and the removal of remnants of previous nail styling. &lt;strong&gt;The well-balanced head and thoughtful features&lt;/strong&gt; make working with the device &lt;strong&gt;efficient and comfortable&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154176/EN_154176_2.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Head with Twist-Lock system&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The carefully profiled head&lt;/strong&gt; fits perfectly in the hand, ensuring precision and comfort of use. &lt;strong&gt;The built-in Twist-Lock system &lt;/strong&gt;allows for quick and intuitive nail drill bit replacement, resulting in smooth and precise work. The ergonomic shape and balanced design &lt;strong&gt;minimise hand fatigue&lt;/strong&gt; even during longer treatments.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154176/EN_154176_3.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Smooth adjustment and the CLICK system&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The nail drill is equipped with a knob with a scale &lt;strong&gt;for smooth speed adjustment from 5,000 to 35,000 rpm&lt;/strong&gt;. A green LED indicates the device is ready for operation. &lt;strong&gt;The CLICK system&lt;/strong&gt; prevents the knob from being under-tightened – a characteristic click confirms the correct setting, &lt;strong&gt;protecting the motor from overload and extending the device's lifespan&lt;/strong&gt;. Switches located on the side of the housing allow you to change the rotation direction.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154176/EN_154176_4.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Precise functionality for user comfort&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The set includes a &lt;strong&gt;foot drive that allows you to control the rotation speed using pressure&lt;/strong&gt; – simply plug it in and press, without having to switch modes. This simplifies operation by allowing you to control the device without using your hands, &lt;strong&gt;increasing comfort&lt;/strong&gt; during treatments. During operation, the head can be safely hung on a plastic holder, which&lt;strong&gt; can be mounted on either side of the base and at various angles&lt;/strong&gt;, depending on the user's preference. &lt;strong&gt;A dedicated space for the bits in the housing&lt;/strong&gt; allows for convenient organisation and keeping them handy during work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154176/EN_154176_5.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Starter bit set&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The nail drill comes &lt;strong&gt;with a basic set of diamond bits&lt;/strong&gt;, allowing for cuticle treatments, nail plate preparation, and working with gel or acrylic mass. The set also includes a carrier with an abrasive pad – perfect for beginners and useful for improving daily work in the salon. &lt;strong&gt;The set allows you to start working immediately after unpacking&lt;/strong&gt;, without the need to purchase additional accessories.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Well-thought-out solutions for work comfort&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The classic colour scheme and minimalist finish&lt;/strong&gt; make the nail drill a perfect match for almost any interior. The matte, elegant housing is made of durable plastic in shades of black – &lt;strong&gt;aesthetically pleasing and easy to keep clean&lt;/strong&gt;. The flexible, spiral cable to the head reaches a length of approximately 140 cm when extended, while the power cable is approximately 150 cm long.&lt;strong&gt; The stable, well-balanced construction&lt;/strong&gt; with an appropriate weight, combined with non-slip elements on the bottom, ensures a &lt;strong&gt;secure positioning of the device during operation&lt;/strong&gt; – even with intensive use.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ceAL4IZvj40" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The set includes: &lt;/strong&gt;nail drill base, head, power supply, foot drive, plastic holder for hanging the head, set of bits, instructions.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Housing colour: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Max. rotation speed: 35,000 RPM&lt;br&gt;Twist-Lock head&lt;br&gt;Power supply: corded&lt;br&gt;Power: 65 W&lt;br&gt;Voltage: 220-240 V&lt;/p&gt;</description>
