<item>
<sku>153419</sku>
<name>Gabbiano Sylvia hairdressing wash station beige</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153419/EN_153419_01.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano&lt;/strong&gt; is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, distinguished by reliability, quality, and aesthetic craftsmanship, as well as high comfort of use. The offer includes a large selection of functional salon equipment, such as chairs, washers, and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153419/EN_153419_02.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Professional Hair Wash for Full Comfort&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The electric &lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano Sylvia hairdressing wash unit&lt;/strong&gt; is a device that allows comfortable hair washing, ensuring &lt;strong&gt;easy adjustment of position to the client's needs&lt;/strong&gt;. The simple operation and convenience of the unit &lt;strong&gt;ensure effective work&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153419/EN_153419_03.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Adjustment to Needs&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;footrest adjustable with an electric actuator&lt;/strong&gt; allows for an ergonomic position adjusted to the client's needs. This reduces muscle tension, which &lt;strong&gt;ensures comfort&lt;/strong&gt; even during longer treatments. The angle of inclination is controlled using buttons located on the back of the chair, raising or lowering the footrest. This solution not only provides exceptional comfort but also high functionality, making the wash unit &lt;strong&gt;perfectly meet the expectations of even the most demanding users&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153419/EN_153419_04.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Elegant Wash Basin for Ease of Use&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The depth of the ceramic washbasin bowl in shades of white allows for &lt;strong&gt;comfortable and efficient performance of a wide range of hairdressing services&lt;/strong&gt;, preventing excessive splashing of water and products used during the treatment. The material used makes the washbasin &lt;strong&gt;durable, resistant to discoloration and scratches&lt;/strong&gt;, and very easy to keep clean. The appropriately &lt;strong&gt;profiled collar&lt;/strong&gt; and inclined backrest provide support and comfort while washing hair, and thanks to the &lt;strong&gt;comfortable plastic overlay in shades of black&lt;/strong&gt;, the client will not feel discomfort from the cold ceramic surface.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153419/EN_153419_05.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Optimal Facilities&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The wash unit is &lt;strong&gt;equipped with a mixer tap&lt;/strong&gt;, providing constant access to hot and cold water. This allows easy adjustment of the temperature to the client's preferences. A dedicated place for hanging the handset makes work easier, and the &lt;strong&gt;chrome-plated plug with a special strainer&lt;/strong&gt; allows you to control water flow and maintain high hygiene standards in the salon. The water connection is located inside the column under the washbasin, which &lt;strong&gt;efficiently hides all pipes&lt;/strong&gt;, while the easy-to-remove panel provides convenient access if needed. The chair is profiled to ensure comfort during various treatments, and the &lt;strong&gt;footrest guarantees excellent leg support&lt;/strong&gt;. The combination of functionality and conveniences makes working in the hair salon &lt;strong&gt;even more comfortable&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/153419/EN_153419_06.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Modern Look with High Functionality&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The Gabbiano Sylvia hairdressing wash station has been designed with the aim of &lt;strong&gt;comfortably performing care or colouring treatments in mind, as well as providing the client with a comfortable position during longer procedures&lt;/strong&gt;. It catches the eye with its &lt;strong&gt;simplicity and geometric form&lt;/strong&gt;, while the perpendicular lines of the seat and armrests give it a modern feel. The backrest placed at an optimal angle &lt;strong&gt;promotes excellent support for the spine&lt;/strong&gt;. The appropriately profiled seat filled with durable foam ensures &lt;strong&gt;high comfort of use&lt;/strong&gt;, and the upholstered armrests allow for the correct positioning of the client's shoulders. The synthetic leather cover in shades of beige &lt;strong&gt;guarantees many years of durability and ease of cleaning&lt;/strong&gt;. The elegant, minimalist look of the wash station gives the interior a unique touch. The set includes complete fittings in shades of chrome, including a faucet, shower head and dedicated hoses to &lt;strong&gt;provide a complete set of tools for work&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;div class="video-container"&gt; &lt;IFRAME height=315 src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/MEcrJ9P5xvs" frameBorder=0 width=560 allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"&gt;  &lt;/IFRAME&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Dimensions are given in the photo.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Actuator: electric&lt;br&gt;Bowl material: ceramic&lt;br&gt;Bowl color: shades of white&lt;br&gt;Upholstery material: synthetic leather&lt;br&gt;Upholstery color: shades of beige&lt;br&gt;Fitting color: shades of chrome&lt;br&gt;Warranty: 12 months&lt;/p&gt;</description>
<price>813.01</price>
<category_subcategory>Hairdressing salon equipment&gt;Hairdressing furniture&gt;Armchairs and hairdressing washes&gt;Others</category_subcategory>
