<item>
<sku>150699</sku>
<name>Syis Natural Beauty Yuzu Face Cream 150 ml</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150699/EN_150699_01.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150699/EN_150699_02.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Yuzu Face Cream&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Natural facial care with moisturising, smoothing, and brightening effects&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The face cream from the Syis Natural Beauty line&lt;/strong&gt; is perfect for those seeking effective, daily skincare based on plant-based ingredients. &lt;strong&gt;The formula contains 96% natural ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;, including yuzu extract, which gives the skin a radiant appearance, &lt;strong&gt;improves its elasticity and supports collagen synthesis&lt;/strong&gt;. This product is especially designed for dry, dull skin lacking radiance.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150699/EN_150699_03.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Rich in active ingredients&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The cream's formula is &lt;strong&gt;enriched with plant oils&lt;/strong&gt;: argan, sunflower, avocado, raspberry seed, and sea buckthorn, which &lt;strong&gt;support regeneration and protect against free radicals&lt;/strong&gt;. The vitamin E contained in the composition further &lt;strong&gt;enhances its antioxidant properties&lt;/strong&gt;, while hyaluronic acid and the Pentavitin® complex provide &lt;strong&gt;intense and long-lasting hydration&lt;/strong&gt;. The PHA acids – gluconolactone and lactobionic acid – provide &lt;strong&gt;smoothing and brightening effects&lt;/strong&gt;. Algae, kiwi, apricot and ginger extracts support skin renewal, &lt;strong&gt;giving it a healthy and fresh appearance&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150699/EN_150699_04.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Active ingredients:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Citrus Junos Fruit Extract – yuzu extract&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A natural source of vitamin C and antioxidants. Brightens the complexion, improves skin tone, and supports collagen production.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Coenochloris Signiensis Extract – microalgae extract&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Provides antioxidant properties, supports regeneration, and protects against oxidative stress.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Pentavitin® (Saccharide Isomerate) – natural sugar complex&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Intensively moisturises the skin for up to 72 hours and strengthens its protective barrier.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Lactobionic Acid – lactobionic acid&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Gently exfoliates and smoothes.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Rubus Idaeus Seed Oil – raspberry seed oil&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Rich in vitamins and omega acids, this nourishing oil has regenerative and photoprotective properties.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150699/EN_150699_05.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;How to use:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Apply every morning and evening to cleansed skin on the face, neck, and décolleté. Gently pat until completely absorbed.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacity: &lt;/strong&gt;150 ml&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients (INCI):&lt;/strong&gt; Aqua, Rosa Damasena Flower Water, Persea Gratissima Oil, Sodium Polyacrylate, Argania Spinosa Kernel Oil , Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Saccharide Isomerate, Glyceryl Caprylate, Ethylhexyl Cocoate, Parfum, Rubus Idaeus Seed Oil, Citrus Junos Fruit Extract, Hippophae Rhamnoides Fruit Oil, Actinidia Chinensis Fruit Extract, Prunus Armeniaca Fruit Extract, Zingiber Officinale Root Extract, Fucus Vesiculosus Extract, Coenochloris Signiensis Extract, Glycerin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Lactobionic Acid, Helianthus Annuus Seed Oil, Tocopherol, Butylene Glycol, Calcium Gluconate, PPG-3 Benzyl Ether Myristate, Glyceryl Undecylenate, Maltodextrin, Polysorbate 20, Gluconolactone, Sodium Benzoate, Citric Acid, Sodium Citrate, Potassium Sorbate, Lecithin, Terpineol, Rose Ketones&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SYIS&lt;/strong&gt; is a Polish brand of professional cosmetics created with effective care in mind. &amp;nbsp;It is distinguished by the high quality of its active ingredients that meet the needs of modern, conscious customers.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
