<item>
<sku>150700</sku>
<name>Syis Natural Beauty wake-up shot eye cream 150 ml</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150700/EN_150700_01.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150700/EN_150700_02.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Wake-up shot eye cream&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Nourishing eye cream with caffeine and revitalizing plant cocktail&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The eye cream from the Syis Natural Beauty line&lt;/strong&gt; was developed for daily care of the delicate skin around the eyes. &lt;strong&gt;It contains 99% natural ingredients&lt;/strong&gt; that alleviate signs of fatigue, reduce dark circles, and support epidermal regeneration. &lt;strong&gt;It's perfect for morning skincare routines&lt;/strong&gt; when skin needs refreshing and soothing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150700/EN_150700_03.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Effective stimulation of the skin under the eyes&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The caffeine contained in the cream has a &lt;strong&gt;firming and tightening effect&lt;/strong&gt;, reducing dark circles and signs of fatigue. The formula is enriched with natural extracts of ginkgo biloba, eyebright, aloe vera and green tea, which &lt;strong&gt;have soothing, antioxidant and anti-aging properties&lt;/strong&gt;. Shea butter, cocoa butter, kokum butter, squalane, and vitamins A and E provide &lt;strong&gt;intense nourishment and hydration &lt;/strong&gt;while strengthening the skin's protective barrier.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150700/EN_150700_04.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Active Ingredients:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Caffeine&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Tightens, smoothes and restores skin's firmness, reducing the appearance of dark circles and signs of fatigue.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Retinyl Palmitate – Vitamin A&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Regulates epidermal renewal, reduces discoloration, improves elasticity and has a smoothing effect.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Euphrasia Officinalis Extract – eyebright extract&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A soothing ingredient with astringent and calming properties – especially valuable in the care of the sensitive eye area.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Butyrospermum Parkii Butter – shea butter&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Nourishes, smoothes and protects against dryness, improving skin condition.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Ginkgo Biloba Leaf Extract – ginkgo biloba extract&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Supports the fight against free radicals and slows down the skin's aging process.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150700/EN_150700_05.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;How to use:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Gently pat a small amount of cream into cleansed skin around the eyes. Usein the morning and evening.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; This product contains vitamin A. Please consider your daily intake before use.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacity:&lt;/strong&gt; 150 ml&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients (INCI): &lt;/strong&gt;Aqua, Glycerin, Rosa Damasena Flower Water, Butyrospermum Parkii Butter, Theobroma Cacao Seed Butter, Glyceryl Stearate, Squalane, Garcinia Indica Seed Butter, Cetearyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Stearate Citrate, Shorea Stenoptera Seed Butter, Glyceryl Caprylate, Caffeine, Helianthus Annuus Seed Oil, Triethanolamine, Coffea Arabica Seed Extract, Retinyl Palmitate, Euphrasia Officinalis Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Ginkgo Biloba Leaf Extract, Tocopherol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Gluconolactone, Lecithin, Xanthan Gum, Glyceryl Undecylenate, Calcium Gluconate, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Parfum, Limonene, Citronellol, Hexyl Cinnamal, Geraniol.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SYIS&lt;/strong&gt; is a Polish brand of professional cosmetics created with effective care in mind. &amp;nbsp;It is distinguished by the high quality of its active ingredients that meet the needs of modern, conscious customers.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
