<item>
<sku>150701</sku>
<name>Syis Natural Beauty mango booster face serum 50 ml</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150701/EN_150701_01.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150701/EN_150701_02.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Mango booster face serum&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Energizing face serum with fruit extracts and plant oils&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Syis Natural Beauty Mango Booster&lt;/strong&gt; is a lightweight yet intensely nourishing face serum &lt;strong&gt;designed for dry, tired, and dull skin&lt;/strong&gt;. Its formula, based on natural oils and plant extracts, &lt;strong&gt;effectively nourishes and moisturises the skin&lt;/strong&gt;, restoring its firmness, softness and healthy appearance. The serum &lt;strong&gt;contains 92% natural ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150701/EN_150701_03.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Revitalising and radiant care&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The serum formula is based on nourishing oils&lt;/strong&gt;: jojoba, prickly pear, sea buckthorn and sweet almond, which &lt;strong&gt;support skin regeneration, protect it from dryness&lt;/strong&gt; and improve its elasticity. Hyaluronic acid and Pentavitin® provide &lt;strong&gt;long-lasting hydration&lt;/strong&gt;, while vitamin E and beta-carotene &lt;strong&gt;effectively neutralise free radicals&lt;/strong&gt;. The formula is complemented by mango, carrot, apple and pomegranate extracts, which&lt;strong&gt; revitalise, brighten and nourish&lt;/strong&gt; the skin every day.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150701/EN_150701_04.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Active ingredients:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Mangifera Indica Fruit Extract – mango extract&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Moisturises and nourishes the skin, has a toning and revitalising effect.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Pentavitin® (Saccharide Isomerate) – natural sugar complex&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Intensively moisturises the skin for up to 72 hours and strengthens its protective barrier.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Opuntia Ficus-Indica Seed Oil – prickly pear oil&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Strengthens the protective barrier, smooths and gives the skin elasticity.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Daucus Carota Sativa Root Extract – carrot extract&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Rich in beta-carotene, it has nourishing, regenerating, and anti-aging properties.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil – jojoba oil&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Regulates sebum secretion, protects against dehydration and smooths the complexion.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150701/EN_150701_05.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;How to use:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Apply a few drops of the serum to cleansed skin on the face and neck. Gently massage until absorbed. Use in the morning and evening.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacity:&lt;/strong&gt; 50 ml&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients (INCI):&lt;/strong&gt; Aqua, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Glycerin, Propanediol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Saccharide Isomerate, Parfum, Sodium Polyacrylate Starch, Panthenol, Helianthus Annuus Seed Oil, Sodium Hyaluronate, Simmondsia Chinensis Seed Oil, Opuntia Ficus-Indica Seed Oil, Squalane, Hippophae Rhamnoides Fruit Oil, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis Oil, Punica Granatum Fruit Extract, Tocopherol, Olus Oil, Pyrus Malus Fruit Extract, Mangifera Indica Fruit Extract, Citric Acid, Sodium Citrate, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Daucus Carota Sativa Root Extract, Daucus Carota Sativa Seed Oil, Beta-Carotene, Limonene, Hexyl Cinnamal, Citronellol, Geraniol, Hexamethylindanopyran, Pinene.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SYIS&lt;/strong&gt; is a Polish brand of professional cosmetics created with effective care in mind. &amp;nbsp;It is distinguished by the high quality of its active ingredients that meet the needs of modern, conscious customers.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
