<item>
<sku>150702</sku>
<name>Syis Natural Beauty redberry face scrub 300 ml</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150702/EN_150702_01.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150702/EN_150702_02.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Redberry face scrub&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Enzymatic scrub with raspberry seeds and tropical enzymes&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Syis Natural Beauty face scrub&lt;/strong&gt; combines enzymatic exfoliation with the mechanical action of natural particles, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring a smooth and radiant skin&lt;/strong&gt;. The combination of papaya and pineapple enzymes with raspberry seed powder effectively removes dead skin cells, smooths the skin, and restores its radiant appearance without causing irritation. &lt;strong&gt;With 97% natural ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;, it is the perfect choice for those looking for effective yet gentle everyday care.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150702/EN_150702_03.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Exfoliation, moisturisation, and refreshment&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;This scrub &lt;strong&gt;works comprehensively&lt;/strong&gt;, responding to the needs of skin that requires gentle but effective cleansing. Papaya and pineapple enzymes &lt;strong&gt;gently remove dead skin cells&lt;/strong&gt;, while raspberry seed powder mechanically smooths the skin. Apple, cucumber and aloe extracts &lt;strong&gt;intensely moisturise the skin, restoring its freshness and improving its tone&lt;/strong&gt;. They also support regeneration and have a soothing effect. &lt;strong&gt;The result is smooth, soft and radiant skin &lt;/strong&gt;that better absorbs the active ingredients from subsequent skincare steps.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150702/EN_150702_04.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Active Ingredients:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Papain – papaya enzyme&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Brightens and smooths the skin, supporting natural exfoliation processes.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Ananas Sativus Fruit Extract – pineapple extract&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Contains bromelain – an enzyme with exfoliating and brightening properties.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Rubus Idaeus Seed Powder – raspberry seed powder&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A natural mechanical exfoliant that helps smooth the skin and improve its texture.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Cucumis Sativus Fruit Extract – cucumber extract&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Provides a soothing and cooling effect, restoring skin comfort.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Pyrus Malus Fruit Extract – apple extract&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Gently brightens the complexion and supports its renewal thanks to the presence of natural AHA acids.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150702/EN_150702_05.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;How to use:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Apply a small amount of product to damp skin. Massage gently in circular motions for about 5 minutes, then rinse with warm water. Use 1–2 times a week.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacity: &lt;/strong&gt;300 ml&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients (INCI):&lt;/strong&gt; Aqua, Propanediol, Pumice, Glycerin, 1,2–Hexanediol, Rubus Idaeus Seed Powder, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Triethanolamine, Parfum, Papain, Ananas Sativus Fruit Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Cucumis Sativus Fruit Extract, Pyrus Malus Fruit Extract, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, CI 16185.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SYIS&lt;/strong&gt; is a Polish brand of professional cosmetics created with effective care in mind. &amp;nbsp;It is distinguished by the high quality of its active ingredients that meet the needs of modern, conscious customers.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
