<name>Syis Natural Beauty tropical refresh face tonic 250 ml</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150703/EN_150703_01.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150703/EN_150703_02.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Tropical refresh face tonic&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Refreshing tonic with rose hydrolate and fruit extracts&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Syis Natural Beauty Tropical Refresh&lt;/strong&gt; is a light, refreshing facial tonic that &lt;strong&gt;restores the skin's natural balance&lt;/strong&gt; and provides an immediate feeling of comfort. Based on rose water and plant extracts, &lt;strong&gt;it soothes, tones&lt;/strong&gt; and prepares the skin for further care. &lt;strong&gt;The formula contains 97% natural ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150703/EN_150703_03.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Hydration, soothing and a radiant glow&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Enriched with aloe vera, the tonic &lt;strong&gt;effectively soothes irritations&lt;/strong&gt;, while hyaluronic acid and the Pentavitin® complex &lt;strong&gt;provide intense and long-lasting hydration&lt;/strong&gt;. Lactobionic and lactic acids &lt;strong&gt;gently exfoliate&lt;/strong&gt;, improving skin texture and brightening the complexion. The mango, pomegranate and rhubarb extracts contained in the formula have &lt;strong&gt;strong antioxidant, refreshing and revitalizing properties&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150703/EN_150703_04.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Active ingredients:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Pentavitin® (Saccharide Isomerate) – natural sugar complex&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Intensively moisturises the skin for up to 72 hours and strengthens its protective barrier.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Rosa Damascena Flower Water – Damask rose hydrolate&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A soothing toning ingredient that refreshes and brightens the complexion.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Lactobionic Acid – lactobionic acid&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Moisturises, exfoliates dead skin cells and smooths the skin without causing irritation.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract – aloe vera extract&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Soothes, relieves irritations and provides long-lasting hydration.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Punica Granatum Fruit Extract – pomegranate extract&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Strengthens skin elasticity, has anti-aging properties and reduces fine lines.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150703/EN_150703_05.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;How to use:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Soak a cotton pad with the tonic and gently wipe over the face, neck, and décolleté. Use in the morning and evening, or whenever skin needs refreshing.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacity:&lt;/strong&gt; 250 ml&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients (INCI):&lt;/strong&gt; Aqua, Rosa Damascena Flower Water, Glycerin, Propanediol, Saccharide Isomerate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Punica Granatum Fruit Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Mangifera Indica Fruit Extract, Rheum Rhaponticum Root Extract, Lactic Acid, Lactobionic Acid, Triethanolamine, Calcium Gluconate, Gluconolactone, Citric Acid, Sodium Citrate, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Parfum, Linalool, Limonene.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SYIS&lt;/strong&gt; is a Polish brand of professional cosmetics created with effective care in mind. &amp;nbsp;It is distinguished by the high quality of its active ingredients that meet the needs of modern, conscious customers.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
