<name>Syis Natural Beauty exotic face sensifoam 150 ml</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150704/EN_150704_01.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150704/EN_150704_02.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Exotic face sensifoam&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Gentle cleansing foam with fruit extracts&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Syis Natural Beauty Exotic Face Sensifoam&lt;/strong&gt; is a gentle daily facial cleansing foam that effectively removes impurities and supports the skin's natural balance. &lt;strong&gt;It contains 97% natural ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;, including plant-based cleansing substances and fruit extracts, which &lt;strong&gt;support the skin's condition, leaving it fresh, smooth and radiant&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150704/EN_150704_03.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Gentleness and effectiveness in one&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Mango, kiwi, and pomegranate extracts &lt;strong&gt;nourish and protect the skin from free radicals&lt;/strong&gt;, while lactic acid and apple extract &lt;strong&gt;support gentle exfoliation&lt;/strong&gt;, smoothing and brightening the complexion. The formula, based on gentle cleansing ingredients such as Disodium Cocoyl Glutamate and natural gypsophila root extract, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring effective cleansing without irritation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150704/EN_150704_04.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Active Ingredients:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Actinidia Chinensis Fruit Extract – kiwi extract&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Rich in vitamin C, it brightens the skin and supports its natural vitality.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Mangifera Indica Fruit Extract – mango extract&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Moisturises, smooths and improves skin elasticity.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Punica Granatum Fruit Extract – pomegranate extract&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Provides antioxidant and regenerative properties, protecting the skin from oxidative stress.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Disodium Cocoyl Glutamate&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A mild, plant-based cleansing ingredient that effectively cleanses the skin without damaging its natural protective barrier.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h3&gt;Gypsophila Paniculata Root Extract&lt;/h3&gt;  &lt;p&gt;A natural foaming ingredient that cleanses gently yet effectively.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/150704/EN_150704_05.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;How to use:&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Use in the morning and evening. Gently massage the foam onto damp skin until it lathers. Rinse with warm water. Avoid contact with eyes.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacity:&lt;/strong&gt; 150 ml&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ingredients (INCI): &lt;/strong&gt;Aqua, Propanediol, Disodium Cocoyl Glutamate, Glycerin, Coco-Glucoside, 1,2-Hexanediol, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Lactic Acid, Punica Granatum Fruit Extract, Mangifera Indica Fruit Extract, Actinidia Chinensis Fruit Extract, Pyrus Malus Fruit Extract, Gypsophila Paniculata Root Extract, Triethanolamine, Citric Acid, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Linalool, Limonene, Parfum.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SYIS&lt;/strong&gt; is a Polish brand of professional cosmetics created with effective care in mind. &amp;nbsp;It is distinguished by the high quality of its active ingredients that meet the needs of modern, conscious customers.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
