<item>
<sku>154215</sku>
<name>Gabbiano hairdressing stool D032 black</name>
<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154215/EN_154215_01.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano &lt;/strong&gt;is a luxury brand of hairdressing equipment and furniture, which is distinguished by reliability, quality and aesthetics of workmanship, as well as high comfort of use. The offer includes a large selection of functional salon equipment such as chairs, washers and infrazones.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154215/EN_154215_02.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Ergonomic support for everyday work&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The practical &lt;strong&gt;Gabbiano D032 hairdressing stool with a saddle-shaped seat&lt;/strong&gt; was designed with the comfort of practicioners in mind. The ergonomic contouring&lt;strong&gt; supports proper posture and relieves strain on the spine&lt;/strong&gt;, while its high mobility is perfect for salon conditions.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154215/EN_154215_03.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Ergonomics and smooth movement&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seat height adjustment in the range of 56-77 cm&lt;/strong&gt; allows the specialist to adjust their position while performing services. &lt;strong&gt;The saddle-shaped seat&lt;/strong&gt;, filled with deformation-resistant foam, guarantees comfort and ergonomics.&lt;strong&gt; The full rotation mechanism &lt;/strong&gt;makes work more efficient and convenient. Mobility is ensured by &lt;strong&gt;Roll Speed wheels &lt;/strong&gt;with an iron core and polyurethane (PU) coating, which combine smooth movement with exceptional wear resistance. The use of &lt;strong&gt;ABEC-7 bearings&lt;/strong&gt; makes the stool easy to move, significantly easier to manoeuvre.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://activeshop.com.pl/media/wysiwyg/product/154215/EN_154215_04.jpg"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;h2&gt;Stable base and durable materials&lt;/h2&gt;  &lt;p&gt;The stool is mounted on a &lt;strong&gt;five-star base &lt;/strong&gt;with a semi-matte finish in shades of black, &lt;strong&gt;ensuring high stability even under intensive use&lt;/strong&gt;. The upholstery is made of durable synthetic leather, &lt;strong&gt;resistant to moisture, stains, and everyday use&lt;/strong&gt;, while the foam seat filling retains its shape even under prolonged use. The overall design&lt;strong&gt; combines functionality with a modern, aesthetically pleasing appearance&lt;/strong&gt;, making the stool a perfect fit for professional interiors. It's an ideal choice for hairdressing salons, beauty salons, and salons which focus on &lt;strong&gt;work comfort, solidity of workmanship and elegance of furnishings&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p&gt;Lift: gas lift&lt;br&gt;Upholstery colour: shades of black&lt;br&gt;Base colour: shades of black&lt;/p&gt;</description>
